#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.10 released"
msgstr "Xfce 4.10 llançat"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:7
msgid ""
"Today, after 1 year and 4 months of work, we are pleased to announce the "
"release of the Xfce desktop 4.10, a new stable version that supersedes Xfce "
"4.8."
msgstr ""
"Avui, després d'1 any i 4 mesos de treball, ens complau anunciar el "
"llançament de l'escriptori Xfce 4.10, una nova versió estable que "
"substitueix a Xfce 4.8."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:11
msgid ""
"In the 4.10 cycle we mainly focused on polishing the desktop and improving "
"the user experience in various ways. Highlights of this release are:"
msgstr ""
"En el cicle 4.10 ens centrem principalment en polir l'escriptori i millorar "
"l'experiència de l'usuari de diverses maneres. Els punts més destacats "
"d'aquest llançament són:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:13
msgid ""
"A new application finder that has been completely rewritten and combines the "
"functionality of the old xfce4-appfinder and xfrun4."
msgstr ""
"Un nou cercador d'aplicacions que ha estat completament reescrit i combina "
"la funcionalitat de l'antic xfce4-appfinder i xfrun4."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:14
msgid ""
"The panel now has an alternative vertical display mode (a deskbar). What is "
"more, panel plugins can be arranged in multiple rows, which is particularly "
"useful in the deskbar mode."
msgstr ""
"El panell ara té un mode de visualització vertical alternatiu (una barra "
"d'escriptori). A més, els connectors del panell es poden organitzar en "
"múltiples files, cosa que és particularment útil en el mode de la barra "
"d'escriptori."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:15
msgid ""
"A new MIME type editor that allows you to easily change applications used "
"for opening different file types. The mouse and touchpad settings dialog and "
"the settings editor were extended in terms of functionality. The former now "
"supports tablets in a much better way."
msgstr ""
"Un nou editor de tipus MIME que permet canviar fàcilment les aplicacions "
"utilitzades per obrir diferents tipus de fitxers. El diàleg de configuració "
"del ratolí i del ratolí tàctil i l'editor de configuració s'han ampliat en "
"termes de funcionalitat. El primer suporta ara les tauletes d'una manera "
"molt millor."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:16
msgid ""
"It is now possible to launch applications and open files on the desktop with "
"a single click of the mouse. In addition, the 4.10 desktop can display "
"thumbnails and automatically advance through the wallpaper list."
msgstr ""
"Ara és possible llançar aplicacions i obrir fitxers a l'escriptori amb un "
"sol clic del ratolí. A més, l'escriptori 4.10 pot mostrar miniatures i "
"avançar automàticament a través de la llista de fons de pantalla."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:17
msgid ""
"The window manager can be configured to tile windows when dragging them to "
"the screen edges. The tab window (Alt+Tab) supports more flexible theming "
"and cursor key navigation."
msgstr ""
"El gestor de finestres es pot configurar per a mosaicar les finestres quan "
"les arrossegueu a les vores de la pantalla. La finestra de pestanyes "
"(Alt+Tab) admet una tematització més flexible i una navegació amb tecles de "
"cursor."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:19
msgid "An online tour of the changes in Xfce 4.10 can be viewed here:"
msgstr "Un recorregut en línia dels canvis a Xfce 4.10 es pot veure aquí:"

#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:21 content/about/news/1425081600.md:52
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:50
msgid "<https://xfce.org/about/tour>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:23
msgid ""
"A detailed overview of the changes compared to Xfce 4.8 and Xfce 4.10 "
"preview releases can be found on the following page:"
msgstr ""
"Podeu trobar una visió general detallada dels canvis en comparació amb les "
"versions de vista prèvia Xfce 4.8 i Xfce 4.10 a la pàgina següent:"

#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:25 content/about/news/1425081600.md:56
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:54
msgid "<https://xfce.org/download/changelogs>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:27 content/about/news/1425081600.md:58
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:56 content/about/news/1608595200.md:44
#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:25 content/about/news/1734220800.md:25
msgid ""
"This release can be downloaded either as a set of individual packages or as "
"a single fat tarball including all these individual versions:"
msgstr ""
"Aquest llançament es pot descarregar ja sigui com un conjunt de paquets "
"individuals o com un sol tarball de greix incloent totes aquestes versions "
"individuals:"

#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:29
#, fuzzy
msgid "<http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.10>"
msgstr "[Baixada](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.6.1/)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:31
msgid ""
"Thank you all the contributors, bug reporters, as well as translators and "
"packagers for your efforts in making this release possible."
msgstr ""
"Gràcies a tots els col·laboradors, reporters d'errors, així com a traductors "
"i empaquetadors pels vostres esforços per fer possible aquest llançament."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.12 released"
msgstr "Publicat Xfce 4.12"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:7
msgid "Xfce 4.12 is be the best release ever (yes, we like to party!)!"
msgstr ""
"L'Xfce 4.12 és el millor llançament de la història (sí, ens agrada sortir!)!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:11
msgid "Source : Internet comments."
msgstr "Font: Comentaris d'Internet."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:13
msgid ""
"Today, after 2 years and 10 months of work, we are pleased to announce the "
"release of the Xfce desktop 4.12, a new stable version that supersedes Xfce "
"4.10."
msgstr ""
"Avui, després de 2 anys i 10 mesos de treball, ens complau anunciar el "
"llançament de l'escriptori Xfce 4.12, una nova versió estable que "
"substitueix l'Xfce 4.10."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:15
msgid ""
"This long period can only be explained by how awesome Xfce 4.10 was. But as "
"all things, it needed some refreshing - and for that we saw lots of new "
"contributors providing valuable feedback, features and bugfixes. As always, "
"Xfce follows its steady pace of evolution without revolution that seems to "
"match our users' needs."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:17
msgid ""
"In this 4.12 cycle, we mainly focused on polishing our user experience on "
"the desktop and window manager, and on updating some components to take "
"advantage of newly available technologies."
msgstr ""
"En aquest cicle 4.12, ens centrem principalment en polir la nostra "
"experiència d'usuari en l'escriptori i el gestor de finestres, i en "
"actualitzar alguns components per aprofitar les noves tecnologies "
"disponibles."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:19
msgid "The main highlights of this release are:"
msgstr "Els principals punts destacats d'aquest llançament són:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:21
msgid ""
"The window manager gained a new themable Alt+Tab dialog with optional "
"windows preview and a list mode. Initial Client side decoration support was "
"implemented, window tiling mode was improved providing support for corner-"
"tiling, and a new zooming mode was added. A HiDPI Xfwm theme was also added."
msgstr ""
"El gestor de finestres ha obtingut un diàleg Alt+Tab temàtic nou amb vista "
"prèvia opcional de les finestres i un mode de llista. Es va implementar el "
"suport inicial de decoració lateral del client, es va millorar el mode de "
"tessel·lació de les finestres i es va afegir un nou mode de zoom. També es "
"va afegir un tema HiDPI Xfwm."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:22
msgid ""
"The panel can now intelligently hide itself, supports Gtk3 plugins, and saw "
"lots of its third-party plugins updated to take full advantage of the "
"features added in 4.10."
msgstr ""
"El panell ara pot amagar-se intel·ligentment, admet connectors Gtk3, i va "
"veure molts dels seus connectors de tercers actualitzats per aprofitar al "
"màxim les característiques afegides en la 4.10."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:23
msgid ""
"The desktop has a new wallpaper settings dialog, per workspace wallpaper "
"support, and better multi-monitor handling. It also supports displaying "
"folder cover art and emblems on icons now."
msgstr ""
"L'escriptori té un diàleg nou de configuració del fons de pantalla, per a la "
"implementació del fons de pantalla de l'espai de treball i una millor gestió "
"multimonitor. També suporta mostrar la caràtula de carpetes i els emblemes a "
"les icones ara."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:24
msgid ""
"Our session manager was updated to use logind and/or upower if available for "
"hibernate/suspend support. For portability and to respect our users' "
"choices, fallback modes were implemented relying on os-specific backends."
msgstr ""
"El nostre gestor de sessions s'ha actualitzat per utilitzar logind i/o "
"upower si està disponible per al suport hibernate/suspend. Per a la "
"portabilitat i per respectar les opcions dels nostres usuaris, es van "
"implementar modes de reserva basats en dorsals específics."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:25
msgid ""
"Support for multi-monitor use was improved in a new display settings dialog "
"and a quick setup popup on monitor plugging."
msgstr ""
"S'ha millorat el suport per a l'ús de múltiples monitors en un diàleg nou de "
"configuració de la pantalla i una finestra emergent de configuració ràpida "
"en el connector del monitor."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:26
msgid "The appearance dialog now showcases previews for icons and themes."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg d'aparença ara mostra previsualitzacions per a icones i temes."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:27
msgid "Xfsettingsd now supports libinput."
msgstr "Xfsettingsd ara admet libinput."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:28
msgid ""
"Power management was not forgotten: A new panel plugin was created, logind/"
"upower support was added to handle battery/lid/brightness events, and "
"locking via light-locker was implemented. The settings dialog was also "
"revamped, and support for X11 screenblanking was added."
msgstr ""
"La gestió de l'energia no s'ha oblidat: es va crear un connector de panell "
"nou, es va afegir el suport logind/upower per gestionar esdeveniments de "
"bateria/límit/brillantor, i es va implementar el bloqueig a través de light-"
"locker. El diàleg de configuració també s'ha renovat, i s'ha afegit el "
"suport per al «screenblanking» X11."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:29
msgid ""
"Our file manager, the beloved Thunar, saw an insane amount of improvements: "
"tab support, tons of bug fixes, speed-ups, key shortcuts for custom actions, "
"better naming of file copies and links, nice freespace bar in properties, "
"tweaks for the renamer and other dialogs, improved keyboard navigation, "
"fixes for the treeview pane, better wallpaper support, Gtk3 bookmarks "
"support, multiple file properties... need we say more?"
msgstr ""
"El nostre gestor de fitxers, l'estimat Thunar, va veure una gran quantitat "
"de millores: suport de pestanyes, tones de correccions d'errors, "
"acceleracions, dreceres de teclat per a accions personalitzades, millor "
"nomenclatura de còpies de fitxer i enllaços, bones barres d'espai lliure en "
"propietats, millores de navegació del teclat, millores en el panell de vista "
"en arbre, millor suport de fons de pantalla, suport d'adreces d'interès "
"Gtk3, múltiples propietats de fitxer... necessitem dir més?"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:30
msgid ""
"To prepare the future of Xfce with Gtk3, which no longer requires theme "
"engines, we are stopping the development of our Gtk theme engine, and "
"dropping our Gtk3 engine - theme makers, please update your themes to CSS if "
"you want them to work on the next Xfce version."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:31
msgid ""
"Due to gstreamer1.0 having dropped the mixer-interface entirely, and xfce4-"
"mixer and xfce4-volumed relying on this interface with gstreamer0.10, our "
"mixer application and volume daemon cannot be ported to 1.0 and are "
"consequently not maintained anymore."
msgstr ""
"A causa que gstreamer1.0 ha deixat la interfície del mesclador completament, "
"i xfce4-mixer i xfce4-volumed que depenen d'aquesta interfície amb "
"gstreamer0.10, la nostra aplicació del mesclador i el dimoni de volum no es "
"poden portar a 1.0 i, en conseqüència, ja no es mantenen."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:33
msgid ""
"Xfce wouldn't be what it is right now without all its goodies. In this area, "
"we also saw a flurry of activity, most notably:"
msgstr ""
"Xfce no seria el que és ara sense tots els seus dolços. En aquesta àrea "
"també hem vist una ràfega d'activitat, sobretot:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:35
msgid "Xfburn gained BluRay Disc burning support."
msgstr "Xfburn va obtenir suport per gravar discs BluRay."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:36
msgid "Task manager UI was totally revamped, and got ported to Gtk3."
msgstr ""
"La interfície d'usuari del gestor de tasques es va renovar totalment i es va "
"portar al Gtk3."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:37
msgid ""
"Parole's UI was totally redone, parts of it rewritten with many features "
"added. Furthermore it was ported to Gtk3 and gstreamer1.0."
msgstr ""
"La interfície d'usuari de Parole es va refer totalment, algunes parts es van "
"reescriure amb moltes característiques afegides. A més, es va portar a Gtk3 "
"i gstreamer1.0."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:38
msgid "Mousepad was totally rewritten and got an initial port to Gtk3."
msgstr ""
"El Mousepad va ser totalment reescrit i va obtenir un port inicial al Gtk3."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:39
msgid "Imgur.com support was added to the screenshooter."
msgstr "S'ha afegit la implementació d'Imgur.com al solucionador de pantalla."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:40
msgid "A new GNOME-Shell-like dashboard named xfdashboard is now available."
msgstr ""
"Ara hi ha disponible un nou tauler amb el GNOME-Shell-like anomenat "
"xfdashboard."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:41
msgid "A new alternative menu for the panel named whiskermenu was added."
msgstr ""
"Es va afegir un nou menú alternatiu per al panell anomenat whiskermenu."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:42
msgid "The GNOME2 hardware monitor plugin was ported to our panel."
msgstr ""
"El connector del monitor de maquinari del GNOME2 s'ha portat al nostre "
"panell."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:43
msgid ""
"Weather plugin got a totally new user interface with powerful customization "
"options and provides tons of detailed information."
msgstr ""
"El connector meteorològic té una interfície d'usuari totalment nova amb "
"potents opcions de personalització i proporciona tones d'informació "
"detallada."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:44
msgid ""
"Eyes plugin uses 3D coordinates to calculate its eye position, so even more "
"sometimes scary, sometimes funny eyes will spy on you!"
msgstr ""
"El connector Ulls utilitza coordenades 3D per calcular la seva posició "
"ocular, de manera que encara més de vegades els ulls espantosos i de vegades "
"divertits t'espiaran!"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:45
msgid ""
"Netload plugin works with the new udev net interface names and can be "
"configured to show transfer rates in the panel."
msgstr ""
"El connector Netload funciona amb els noms nous de la interfície de xarxa "
"udev i es pot configurar per a mostrar les taxes de transferència al panell."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:46
msgid "Clipboard manager plugin optionally displays a QR code."
msgstr ""
"El connector del gestor del porta-retalls mostra opcionalment un codi QR."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:47
msgid ""
"Cpufreq plugin now supports the intel pstate driver and can adapt better for "
"different panel sizes and information displayed."
msgstr ""
"El connector Cpufreq ara admet el controlador pstate d'intel i es pot "
"adaptar millor per a diferents mides de panell i informació mostrada."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:48
msgid ""
"Nearly all plugins have been improved to give the same look and feel and to "
"support the new deskbar panel mode."
msgstr ""
"Gairebé tots els connectors s'han millorat per donar el mateix aspecte i "
"comportament i per donar suport al nou mode de panell de la barra "
"d'escriptori."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:50
msgid "An online tour of the changes in Xfce 4.12 can be viewed here:"
msgstr "Un recorregut en línia dels canvis a Xfce 4.12 es pot veure aquí:"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:54
msgid ""
"A detailed overview of the changes between Xfce 4.10 and Xfce 4.12 releases "
"can be found on the following page:"
msgstr ""
"Podeu trobar una visió detallada dels canvis entre les versions de l'Xfce "
"4.10 i l'Xfce 4.12 a la pàgina següent:"

#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:60
#, fuzzy
msgid "<http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.12>"
msgstr "[Baixada](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.6.2/)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:62
msgid ""
"A warm thank you all the contributors, translators and packagers for your "
"efforts in making this release possible. We would also like to thank our "
"fantastic users and occasional contributors who submitted bug reports, "
"helped us find issues and sometimes provided patches. We are currently "
"reviewing all patches sent to us and will include many more fixes to Xfce in "
"the next release. We would also like to thank the many people who donated "
"money to our project via Bounty Source. This will help us meet and hack on "
"Xfce in the future!"
msgstr ""
"Un agraïment a tots els col·laboradors, traductors i empaquetadors pels "
"vostres esforços per fer possible aquest llançament. També ens agradaria "
"donar les gràcies als nostres usuaris fantàstics i col·laboradors ocasionals "
"que van enviar informes d'errors, ens van ajudar a trobar problemes i, de "
"vegades, ens van proporcionar pegats. Actualment estem revisant tots els "
"pedaços que ens han estat enviats i inclourem moltes més correccions a Xfce "
"en el proper llançament. També volem donar les gràcies a les moltes persones "
"que han donat diners al nostre projecte a través de Bounty Source. Això ens "
"ajudarà a conèixer i piratejar a Xfce en el futur!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:64
msgid ""
"As always, we welcome everyone who would like to contribute to the "
"development of Xfce! You can either [test Xfce](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/"
"building) and [report bugs](https://bugzilla.xfce.org), you can help us with "
"[translations](https://www.transifex.com/tag/xfce/) and [documentation]"
"(https://docs.xfce.org), with [usability and user experience](https://"
"wiki.xfce.org/design/start) by packaging Xfce into your distribution, and by "
"[submitting patches](https://wiki.xfce.org/dev/howto/contribute) or entirely "
"new features! You can get in touch with us on the Freenode IRC channel #xfce-"
"dev and our [mailing list](https://mail.xfce.org/mailman/listinfo/xfce4-dev)."
msgstr ""
"Com sempre, donem la benvinguda a tothom que vulgui contribuir al "
"desenvolupament de l'Xfce! Podeu fer [test de l'Xfce](https://docs.xfce.org/"
"xfce/building) i [reportar errors](https://bugzilla.xfce.org), podeu ajudar-"
"nos amb [traduccions](https://www.transifex.com/tag/xfce/) i [documentació]"
"(https://docs.xfce.org), amb [usabilitat i experiència d'usuari](https://"
"wiki.xfce.org/design/start) empaquetant Xfce a la vostra distribució, i</a>0 "
"enviant pedaços </a>1 o funcions completament noves! Podeu posar-vos en "
"contacte amb nosaltres al canal Freenode IRC  thexfce-dev i a la nostra "
"[mailing list](https://mail.xfce.org/mailman/listinfo/xfce4-dev)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.14 released"
msgstr "Publicat Xfce 4.14"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:7
msgid ""
"Today, after 4 years and 5 months of work, we are pleased to announce the "
"release of the Xfce desktop 4.14, a new stable version that supersedes Xfce "
"4.12."
msgstr ""
"Avui, després de 4 anys i 5 mesos de treball, ens complau anunciar el "
"llançament de l'escriptori Xfce 4.14, una nova versió estable que "
"substitueix a Xfce 4.12."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:11
msgid ""
"In this 4.14 cycle the main goal was to port all core components to Gtk3 "
"(over Gtk2) and GDBus (over D-Bus GLib). Most components also received "
"GObject Introspection support. Along the way we ended up polishing our user "
"experience, introducing quite a few new features and improvements (read "
"below) and fixings a boatload of bugs (read changelog)."
msgstr ""
"En aquest cicle de 4,14 l'objectiu principal era portar tots els components "
"del nucli a Gtk3 (sobre Gtk2) i GDBus (sobre D-Bus GLib). La majoria dels "
"components també van rebre suport d'Introspecció GObject. Al llarg del camí "
"vam acabar polint la nostra experiència d'usuari, introduint bastantes noves "
"funcionalitats i millores (llegir a continuació) i arreglant una càrrega "
"d'errors de vaixell (llegir registre de canvis)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:13
msgid "The **main highlights of this release** are:"
msgstr "Els **punts destacats principals d'aquest llançament** són:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:15
msgid ""
"The [window manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/start) received a slew "
"of updates and features, including support for VSync (using either Present "
"or OpenGL as backend) to reduce or remove display flickering, HiDPI support, "
"improved GLX support with NVIDIA proprietary/closed source drivers, support "
"for XInput2, various compositor improvements and a new default theme."
msgstr ""
"El gestor de finestres [](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/start) va rebre "
"una sèrie d'actualitzacions i característiques, incloent el suport per VSync "
"(utilitzant Present o OpenGL com a dorsal) per reduir o eliminar parpelleig "
"de pantalla, suport HiDPI, suport millorat GLX amb controladors de codi "
"privatiu/tancat NVIDIA, suport per XInput2, diverses millores de compositor "
"i un tema predeterminat nou."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:16
msgid ""
"The [panel](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/start) got support for "
"RandR's primary monitor feature, improved window grouping in the tasklist "
"plugin (better UX, visual group indicator etc), a per-panel \"icon-size\" "
"setting, a new default clock format and clock format evaluator as well as an "
"improved default panel layout."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:17
msgid ""
"The [desktop](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfdesktop/start) now has support "
"for RandR's primary monitor feature, an orientation option for icon "
"arrangement, a \"Next Background\" context menu option to advance the "
"wallpaper and it now syncs the user's wallpaper selection to AccountsService."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:18
msgid ""
"A completely new settings dialog to [manage color profiles](https://"
"docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/color) has been created. For most users "
"this means out of the box support for color-managed printing (through cupsd) "
"and scanning (through saned). For monitor profiles you will have to install "
"an additional service like xiccd."
msgstr ""
"S'ha creat un diàleg de configuració completament nou a [gestiona els "
"perfils de color](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/color). Per a la "
"majoria d'usuaris això significa fora de la caixa suport per a la impressió "
"gestionada per color (a través de cupsd) i escanejat (a través de saned). "
"Per als perfils de monitor hauràs d'instal·lar un servei addicional com el "
"xiccd."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:19
msgid ""
"The [display dialog](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/display) "
"received a lot of attention during this cycle and a big feature: Users are "
"now able to save and (automatically) restore complete multi-display "
"configurations, which is especially helpful for those who frequently connect "
"their laptop to varying docking stations or setups. Furthermore a lot of "
"time was spent on making the user interface more intuitive and a hidden "
"option was added to support RandR display scaling (configured via Xfconf)."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg de visualització [](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/"
"display) va rebre molta atenció durant aquest cicle i una gran "
"característica: els usuaris ara són capaços de desar i (automàticament) "
"restaurar configuracions completes de múltiples pantalles, cosa que és "
"especialment útil per a aquells que sovint connecten el seu ordinador "
"portàtil a estacions o configuracions d'acoblament variables. A més, es va "
"dedicar molt de temps a fer que la interfície d'usuari fos més intuïtiva i "
"es va afegir una opció oculta per donar suport a l'escalat de visualització "
"RandR (configurat a través de l'Xfconf)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:20
msgid ""
"We added an option to enable Gtk window scaling to the [appearance dialog]"
"(https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/appearance) and a monospace font "
"option as well. However we had to drop theme previews as they didn't produce "
"consistent results with Gtk3."
msgstr ""
"S'ha afegit una opció per habilitar l'escalat de la finestra Gtk al diàleg "
"d'aparença [](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/appearance) i també "
"una opció de tipus de lletra monoespai. No obstant això, vam haver de deixar "
"caure les vistes prèvies del tema, ja que no van produir resultats coherents "
"amb Gtk3."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:21
msgid ""
"While we decided to drop splash screens from the [session manager](https://"
"docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/start), we added lots of features and fixes "
"instead. Among them are hybrid sleep support, improvements to the default "
"session startup avoiding race conditions, a feature to add and edit "
"autostart entries, a switch user button in the logout dialog and improved "
"session chooser and settings dialogs (the latter with a new tab that shows "
"saved sessions). Furthermore you can now run commands not only \"autostart "
"style\" at login time, but also when your computer suspends, logs out etc. "
"Finally Gtk applications are now session-managed over DBus and screensavers "
"are also communicated with (e.g. inhibited) over DBus."
msgstr ""
"Mentre decidim deixar caure pantalles de presentació del [gestor de sessions]"
"(https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/start), vam afegir moltes "
"característiques i correccions en el seu lloc. Entre ells hi ha el suport "
"híbrid de son, millores en l'inici de sessió per defecte evitant les "
"condicions de carrera, una característica per afegir i editar entrades "
"d'inici automàtic, un botó d'usuari de commutació en el diàleg de sortida i "
"diàlegs millorats de selecció de sessió i configuració (aquest últim amb una "
"pestanya nova que mostra les sessions desades). A més, ara podeu executar "
"ordres no només «autostart style» en el moment d'iniciar la sessió, sinó "
"també quan l'ordinador suspèn, surt, etc. Finalment, les aplicacions Gtk ara "
"es gestionen a través de la sessió i els estalvis de pantalla també es "
"comuniquen amb (per exemple, inhibides) a través de DBus."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:22
msgid ""
"As always, [Thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/start) - our file "
"manager - received a lot of features and fixes. Among the visible changes "
"are the completely reworked pathbar, support for larger thumbnails as well "
"as support for a \"folder.jpg\" file altering the folder's icon (e.g. for "
"music album covers). Power users will also notice the improved keyboard "
"navigation (zooming, tab navigation). Thunar's volume manager has gained "
"Bluray support."
msgstr ""
"Com sempre, [Thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/start) - el nostre "
"gestor de fitxers - va rebre moltes característiques i correccions. Entre "
"els canvis visibles hi ha la barra de camí completament redissenyada, suport "
"per a miniatures més grans, així com suport per a un fitxer \"folder.jpg\" "
"que altera la icona de la carpeta (p. ex. per a portades d'àlbums de "
"música). Els usuaris d'energia també notaran la navegació millorada del "
"teclat (zooming, navegació de pestanyes). El gestor de volums de Thunar ha "
"obtingut suport Bluray."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:23
msgid ""
"Our [thumbnailing service tumbler](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/"
"tumbler) received a lot of fixes and support for the Fujifilm RAF format."
msgstr ""
"El nostre servei de miniatures [](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/tumbler) "
"va rebre moltes correccions i suport per al format Fujifilm RAF."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:24
msgid ""
"The [application finder](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-appfinder/start) "
"can now optionally be opened as a single window and can now be more easily "
"navigated with the keyboard only."
msgstr ""
"El cercador d'aplicacions [](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-appfinder/"
"start) ara es pot obrir opcionalment com una sola finestra i ara es pot "
"navegar amb més facilitat només amb el teclat."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:25
msgid ""
"The [power manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-manager/start) "
"received a lot of bugfixes and some smaller features, including support for "
"the XF86Battery button and for the newly created xfce4-screensaver. The "
"panel plugin also saw several improvements: it can now optionally show the "
"remaining time and/or percentage and it now relies on UPower's standard icon "
"names to work with more icon themes out of the box. With LXDE moving on to a "
"QT base the LXDE panel plugin was dropped."
msgstr ""
"El gestor d'energia [](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-manager/start) "
"va rebre una gran quantitat d'esmenes d'errors i algunes característiques "
"més petites, incloent-hi el suport per al botó XF86Battery i per al "
"recentment creat xfce4-screensaver. El connector del panell també va veure "
"diverses millores: ara pot mostrar opcionalment el temps i/o percentatge "
"restant i ara es basa en els noms d'icones estàndard de UPower per treballar "
"amb més temes d'icones fora de la caixa. Amb LXDE movent-se a una base de "
"QT, es va eliminar el connector del panell LXDE."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:27
msgid ""
"A lot of **applications and plugins** that are part of the Xfce eco-system - "
"often dubbed \"goodies\" - are part of what makes Xfce great. A lot of those "
"have also seen important changes along the timeline of the 4.14 release. To "
"highlight a few:"
msgstr ""
"Un munt de **aplicacions i connectors** que formen part de l'ecosistema Xfce "
"- sovint anomenat \"goodies\" - són part del que fa Xfce gran. Molts d'ells "
"també han vist canvis importants al llarg de la línia de temps de la versió "
"4.14. Per a ressaltar alguns:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:29
msgid ""
"Our [notification service](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/notifyd/start) has "
"gained support for persistence - in other words: notification logging - and "
"a \"Do Not Disturb\" mode, which suppresses all notifications. A new panel "
"plugin was created that shows missed notifications (especially helpful "
"during \"Do Not Disturb\" mode) and gives quick access to toggling \"Do Not "
"Disturb\" mode. Finally support for showing notifications on RandR's primary "
"monitor was added."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:30
msgid ""
"Our media player [Parole](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/parole/start) received "
"improved support for network streams and podcasts, as well as a new \"mini "
"mode\" and automatic choosing of the best available video backend. "
"Furthermore it also inhibits both screensavers and power managers during "
"video playback now, making sure users don't have to go wiggle their mouse "
"periodically while enjoying a movie."
msgstr ""
"El nostre reproductor multimèdia [Parole](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/parole/"
"start) va rebre un suport millorat per a fluxos de xarxa i podcasts, així "
"com un nou \"mode mini\" i l'elecció automàtica del millor dorsal de vídeo "
"disponible. A més, també inhibeix tant els estalvis de pantalla com els "
"gestors d'energia durant la reproducció de vídeo ara, assegurant-se que els "
"usuaris no han d'anar canviant el seu ratolí periòdicament mentre gaudeixen "
"d'una pel·lícula."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:31
msgid ""
"Our image viewer [Ristretto](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/ristretto/start) has "
"seen various user interface improvements and support for setting the desktop "
"wallpaper. It has recently also seen its first Gtk3-based development "
"release."
msgstr ""
"El nostre visor d'imatges [Ristretto](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/ristretto/"
"start) ha vist diverses millores de la interfície d'usuari i suport per a "
"establir el fons de pantalla de l'escriptori. Recentment també ha vist el "
"seu primer llançament de desenvolupament basat en Gtk3."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:32
msgid ""
"The [screenshooter](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screenshooter/start) now "
"allows users to move the selection rectangle and at the same time displays "
"its width and height. The imgur upload dialog was revamped and the command "
"line allows for more flexibility."
msgstr ""
"El [screenshooter](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screenshooter/start) ara "
"permet als usuaris moure el rectangle de selecció i al mateix temps mostra "
"la seva amplada i alçada. S'ha renovat el diàleg de càrrega d'imgur i la "
"línia d'ordres permet més flexibilitat."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:33
msgid ""
"Our [clipboard manager](https://docs.xfce.org/panel-plugins/clipman/start) "
"now has improved keyboard shortcut support (through a port to "
"GtkApplication), improved and more consistent icon sizing as well as a new "
"application icon."
msgstr ""
"El nostre gestor de porta-retalls [](https://docs.xfce.org/panel-plugins/"
"clipman/start) ara ha millorat el suport de dreceres de teclat (a través "
"d'un port a GtkApplication), millorat i més consistent en la mida de les "
"icones, així com una icona nova d'aplicació."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:34
msgid ""
"The [pulseaudio panel plugin](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/pulseaudio-plugin/"
"start) received MPRIS2 support to be able to remotely control media players "
"and desktop-wide multimedia key support, essentially rendering xfce4-volumed-"
"pulse a superfluous additional daemon."
msgstr ""
"El connector [pulseaudio panel plugin](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/pulseaudio-"
"plugin/start) va rebre suport MPRIS2 per poder controlar remotament "
"reproductors multimèdia i suport de clau multimèdia a tot l'escriptori, "
"essencialment renderitzant xfce4-volumed-pulse un dimoni addicional superflu."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:35
msgid ""
"And finally the [terminal emulator](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/terminal/"
"start) saw a huge amount of bug fixes and improvements since Xfce 4.12."
msgstr ""
"I finalment l'emulador de terminal [](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/terminal/"
"start) va veure una gran quantitat d'errors solucionats i millores des de "
"l'Xfce 4.12."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:37
msgid ""
"There is also a group of **new projects** that have become part of our "
"project. Say hi to:"
msgstr ""
"També hi ha un grup de **nous projectes** que han passat a formar part del "
"nostre projecte. Digues HOLA a:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:39
msgid ""
"We finally have our own [screensaver](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screensaver/"
"start) (yes - we realize it's 2019 ;)). With lots of features and tight Xfce "
"integration (obviously) it is a great addition to our catalog."
msgstr ""
"Finalment tenim el nostre propi estalvi de pantalla [](https://docs.xfce.org/"
"apps/screensaver/start) (sí - ens adonem que és 2019 ;)). Amb moltes "
"característiques i estreta integració Xfce (òbviament) és una gran addició "
"al nostre catàleg."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:40
msgid ""
"The [status notifier panel plugin](https://goodies.xfce.org/projects/panel-"
"plugins/xfce4-statusnotifier-plugin) provides a next-generation system tray "
"where applications can show indicators. It supersedes the Ubuntu-centric "
"xfce4-indicator-plugin for most application indicators."
msgstr ""
"El connector [notifier status panel](https://goodies.xfce.org/projects/panel-"
"plugins/xfce4-statusnotifier-plugin) proporciona una safata de sistema de "
"nova generació on les aplicacions poden mostrar indicadors. Substitueix "
"l'Ubuntu-centric xfce4-indicator-plugin per a la majoria d'indicadors "
"d'aplicacions."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:41
msgid ""
"[Catfish file search](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/catfish/start) is like an "
"old friend for most Xfce users - now it's officially part of Xfce!"
msgstr ""
"[Catfish cerca de fitxers](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/catfish/start) és com "
"un vell amic per a la majoria d'usuaris de l'Xfce - ara és oficialment part "
"de l'Xfce!"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:42
msgid ""
"Finally [Panel Profiles](https://git.xfce.org/apps/xfce4-panel-profiles/"
"about/), which allows you to backup and restore your panel layouts, has "
"moved under the Xfce umbrella."
msgstr ""
"Finalment, [Panel Profiles](https://git.xfce.org/apps/xfce4-panel-profiles/"
"about/), que us permet fer còpies de seguretat i restaurar les disposicions "
"del panell, s'ha mogut sota el paraigua de l'Xfce."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:44
msgid ""
"As always it’s also time to say goodbye to some older **unmaintained or "
"deprecated projects**. (Luckily our projects only go to the attic aka the "
"archive on git.xfce.org when they die.) With a salty teardrop of sadness we "
"bid farewell to:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:46
msgid ""
"garcon-vala, gtk-xfce-engine, pyxfce, thunar-actions-plugin, xfbib, xfc, "
"xfce4-kbdleds-plugin, xfce4-mm, xfce4-taskbar-plugin, xfce4-windowlist-"
"plugin, xfce4-wmdock-plugin and xfswitch-plugin"
msgstr ""
"garcon-vala, gtk-xfce-engine, pyxfce, thunar-actions-plugin, xfbib, xfc, "
"xfce4-kbdleds-plugin, xfce4-taskbar-plugin, xfce4-windowlist-plugin, xfce4-"
"wmdock-plugin i xfswitch-plugin"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:48
msgid "An online tour of the changes in Xfce 4.14 can be viewed here:"
msgstr "Un recorregut en línia pels canvis a Xfce 4.14 es pot veure aquí:"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:52
msgid ""
"A detailed overview of the changes between Xfce 4.12 and Xfce 4.14 releases "
"can be found on the following page:"
msgstr ""
"Podeu trobar una visió detallada dels canvis entre les versions de l'Xfce "
"4.12 i l'Xfce 4.14 a la pàgina següent:"

#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:58
#, fuzzy
msgid "<http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.14>"
msgstr "[Baixada](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.6.1/)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.16 released"
msgstr "Xfce 4.16 llançat"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:7
msgid ""
"Today, after 1 year and 4 months of work, we are happy to announce the "
"release of the Xfce desktop 4.16, a new stable version that supersedes Xfce "
"4.14."
msgstr ""
"Avui, després d'1 any i 4 mesos de treball, ens complau anunciar el "
"llançament de l'escriptori Xfce 4.16, una nova versió estable que "
"substitueix a Xfce 4.14."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:11
msgid ""
"4.16 was a special cycle in many respects (not only pandemic-wise, but "
"also). One of the corner-stones of the non-code changes concerns our "
"migration to GitLab, which is a change in development workflow and a huge "
"step forward in terms of becoming more contributor-friendly and welcoming. "
"In parts, the [humungous changelog of Xfce 4.16](https://www.xfce.org/"
"download/changelogs/4.16) can be attributed to new contributors proposing "
"merge requests (288 merge requests were merged or closed against our core "
"components alone!). We also created a reference Docker container ([xfce/xfce-"
"build](https://hub.docker.com/r/xfce/xfce-build)) and added CI pipelines to "
"all components to ensure we don´t break the build. None of this would have "
"been possible without our hosting being sponsored by [Gandi](https://"
"gandi.net) and [Fosshost](https://fosshost.org)!"
msgstr ""
"El 4.16 va ser un cicle especial en molts aspectes (no només per pandèmia, "
"sinó també). Una de les pedres angulars dels canvis no codificants es "
"refereix a la nostra migració a GitLab, que és un canvi en el flux de "
"treball del desenvolupament i un gran pas endavant en termes de ser més "
"amables i acollidors per als contribuents. A parts, el [humungous changelog "
"of Xfce 4.16](https://www.xfce.org/download/changelogs/4.16) es pot atribuir "
"a nous col·laboradors que proposen sol·licituds de fusió (288 sol·licituds "
"de fusió es van fusionar o es van tancar contra els nostres components "
"principals!). També vam crear un contenidor Docker de referència ([xfce/xfce-"
"build](https://hub.docker.com/r/xfce/xfce-build)) i vam afegir canonades CI "
"a tots els components per assegurar-nos que no trenquem la construcció. Res "
"d'això hauria estat possible sense que el nostre allotjament fos patrocinat "
"per [Gandi](https://gandi.net) i [Fosshost](https://fosshost.org)!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:13
msgid ""
"Another big change concerns our visual identity, which we updated from a "
"strange mix of random (partly Tango-based) icons and not following any "
"naming scheme to a new, visually consistent set (following the "
"freedesktop.org naming specification and a fixed color palette). We´re aware "
"this will generate some work for icon theme maintainers (if they really want "
"to override our gorgeous icons ;)) but we believe the longterm benefit "
"outweighs this one-time effort."
msgstr ""
"Un altre gran canvi té a veure amb la nostra identitat visual, que hem "
"actualitzat des d'una estranya barreja d'icones aleatòries (en part basades "
"en Tango) i no seguint cap esquema de nomenclatura a un nou conjunt "
"visualment consistent (seguint l'especificació de nom freedesktop.org i una "
"paleta de colors fixa). Som conscients que això generarà una mica de treball "
"per als mantenidors de temes d'icones (si realment volen anul·lar les "
"nostres magnífiques icones ;)) però creiem que el benefici a llarg termini "
"supera aquest esforç únic."

#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:15
msgid ""
"<img src=\"//cdn.xfce.org/about/tour/4.16/upstream-icons.png\" border=\"0\" "
"alt=\"upstream-icons\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:17
msgid ""
"And then finally we did some housekeeping (e.g. by dropping Gtk2 support "
"code) and we also added features and improvements - all while sticking to a "
"reasonable release cycle timeframe."
msgstr ""
"I finalment, vam fer una mica de neteja (per exemple, deixant anar el codi "
"de suport Gtk2) i també vam afegir característiques i millores - tot això "
"mantenint un període de temps de cicle de llançament raonable."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:19
msgid ""
"So without further ado, here go the **main highlights of this release**:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:21
msgid ""
"The [window manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/start) received lots "
"of updates and improvements again in the area of compositing and GLX. If a "
"primary display was set, the alt-tab dialog will now only be shown there. "
"Furthermore some handy new options to zoom the cursor along with rest of the "
"display as well as an option to keep minimized windows in the most recently "
"used list complement this release."
msgstr ""
"El [window manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/start) va rebre moltes "
"actualitzacions i millores de nou en l'àrea de composició i GLX. Si s'ha "
"establert una pantalla primària, el diàleg alt-tab ara només es mostrarà "
"allà. A més, algunes noves opcions útils per a fer zoom al cursor juntament "
"amb la resta de la pantalla, així com una opció per a mantenir les finestres "
"minimitzades a la llista més recent complementen aquesta versió."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:22
msgid ""
"We added a new plugin to the [panel](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/"
"start) dubbed “statustray” which combines both StatusNotifier and legacy "
"Systray items. An animated autohide transition now clearly shows the user "
"“where the panel has gone” and a dark mode (enabled by default) makes the "
"panel drop into the background a bit more with bright themes like the Gtk "
"default Adwaita. Quite a few more smaller improvements were also introduced "
"like accessing desktop actions from a Launcher´s right-click menu, the "
"Window Buttons plugin now offering to `Launch a new instance` of an "
"application and the Workspace Switcher now optionally showing automatic "
"numbering for workspaces."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:23
msgid ""
"Support for fractional scaling was added to the [display dialog](https://"
"docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/display), along with highlighting the "
"preferred mode of a display with an asterisk and adding aspect ratios next "
"to resolutions. Falling back to a working mode after misconfiguring the "
"display layout has also been made more robust."
msgstr ""
"El suport per a l'escalat fraccionat s'ha afegit al diàleg de visualització "
"[](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/display), juntament amb el "
"ressaltat del mode preferit d'una pantalla amb un asterisc i l'addició de "
"relacions d'aspecte al costat de resolucions. Tornant a un mode de treball "
"després de configurar malament la disposició de visualització també s'ha fet "
"més robusta."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:24
msgid ""
"A new tab in the “About Xfce” dialog shows basic system information like CPU "
"or GPU type. Furthermore the layout and visuals of the dialog were improved."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:25
msgid ""
"The [settings manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/start) has "
"improved search and filter capabilities. Furthermore all settings dialogs "
"now use window decorations drawn by Gtk (client side decorations)."
msgstr ""
"El [settings manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/start) ha "
"millorat les capacitats de cerca i filtratge. A més, tots els diàlegs de "
"configuració ara utilitzen decoracions de finestres dibuixades per Gtk "
"(decoracions laterals del client)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:26
msgid ""
"The “Mime Settings” and “Preferred Applications” dialogs were merged into "
"the “Default Applications” dialog - making it easier for users to set which "
"application handles which filetype or action from one place."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:27
msgid ""
"Our file manager [Thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/start) received "
"a boatload of fixes and quite a few notable features, including pause for "
"copy/move operations, support for queued file transfer, remembering view "
"settings per directory and support for transparency in Gtk themes."
msgstr ""
"El nostre gestor de fitxers [Thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/"
"start) va rebre una càrrega de correccions i bastantes característiques "
"notables, incloent una pausa per a les operacions de còpia/moure, suport per "
"a la transferència de fitxers a la cua, recordant la configuració de la "
"vista per directori i suport per a la transparència en els temes Gtk."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:28
msgid ""
"Our [thumbnailing service tumbler](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/"
"tumbler) became more flexible by being able to exclude paths. Furthermore "
"support for .epub (e-book format) was added."
msgstr ""
"El nostre [thumbnailing service tumbler](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/"
"tumbler) es va fer més flexible en ser capaç d'excloure camins. A més, s'ha "
"afegit el suport per al .epub (format de llibre electrònic)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:29
msgid ""
"The [session manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/start) offers "
"improved support for GPG agent 2.1 and the setting dialog was visually "
"improved."
msgstr ""
"El gestor de sessions [](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/start) "
"ofereix un millor suport per a l'agent GPG 2.1 i el diàleg de configuració "
"s'ha millorat visualment."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:30
msgid ""
"The [power manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-manager/start) "
"received a lot of bugfixes and some smaller features - among them a cleanup "
"of its settings dialog, an optional visual indicator for when `Presentation "
"Mode` is enabled, more accurate battery status icons and automatically "
"dismissing low-power notifications upon the connection of a charger."
msgstr ""
"El gestor d'energia [](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-manager/start) "
"va rebre moltes correccions d'errors i algunes característiques més petites "
"- entre elles una neteja del seu diàleg de configuració, un indicador visual "
"opcional per quan el ,Mode de Presentació. està activat, icones d'estat de "
"la bateria més precises i automàticament descarta notificacions de baixa "
"potència a la connexió d'un carregador."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:31
msgid ""
"The [desktop](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfdesktop/start) mostly received "
"bugfixes and small improvements - and the new default wallpaper!"
msgstr ""
"L'escriptori [](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfdesktop/start) majoritàriament "
"va rebre esmenes d'errors i petites millores - i el fons de pantalla nou per "
"defecte!"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:32
msgid ""
"Our menu library [garcon](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/garcon/start) received "
"new APIs and now doesn´t launch applications as children of the process "
"hosting the menu anymore. The previous behavior led to applications crashing "
"along with e.g. the panel."
msgstr ""
"La nostra biblioteca de menús [garcon](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/garcon/"
"start) va rebre noves APIs i ara ja no llança aplicacions com a fills del "
"procés d'allotjament del menú. El comportament anterior va provocar que les "
"aplicacions s'estavellessin juntament amb, per exemple, el panell."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:33
msgid ""
"The [applicaton finder](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-appfinder/start) "
"now allows for sorting applications by “frecency” - a combination of "
"frequency and recency."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:34
msgid ""
"Dependency updates: Drop Gtk2, add LibGTop, bump Gtk &gt;= 3.22, GLib and "
"GDBus &gt;= 2.50"
msgstr ""

