#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:15
msgid ""
"The major focus during this development cycle was the preparation of the "
"codebase to be ready for Wayland. So that we meanwhile have experimental "
"Wayland support for most components. More details in the links below."
msgstr ""
"El focus principal durant aquest cicle de desenvolupament va ser la "
"preparació de la base de codi per estar llest per al Wayland. De manera que, "
"mentrestant, tenim suport experimental del Wayland per a la majoria dels "
"components. Més detalls als enllaços següents."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:17
msgid ""
