#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour410.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.10 tour"
msgstr "Recorregut de l'Xfce 4.10"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.10. It only "
"covers the visual part of what has been done; for the full list of changes, "
"see the [changelogs](/download/changelogs/)."
msgstr ""
"Aquest recorregut us presentarà les característiques principals noves de "
"l'Xfce 4.10. Només cobreix la part visual que s'ha fet; per a la llista "
"completa dels canvis, consulteu els [registres de canvis](/download/"
"changelogs/)."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:9
msgid "Online Documentation"
msgstr "Documentació en línia"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:11
msgid ""
"During the 4.10 development we've decided to remove user manuals from the "
"packages and move them to an online wiki at [docs.xfce.org](https://"
"docs.xfce.org). The reason for this change is to make [contributing](https://"
"docs.xfce.org/wiki/documentation) and updating the documentation easier."
msgstr ""
"Durant el desenvolupament de la versió 4.10 s'ha decidit eliminar els "
"manuals d'usuari dels paquets i moure'ls anuna wiki en línia a "
"[docs.xfce.org](https://docs.xfce.org). La motivació d'aquest canvi és fer "
"que[contribuir](https://docs.xfce.org/wiki/documentation) i actualitzar la "
"documentació sigui més fàcil."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:13
msgid ""
"![When you click a Help button Xfce will ask you to go to an online wiki "
"page][img-online-help]"
msgstr ""
"![Quan premeu sobre un botó d'ajuda, l'Xfce us demanarà d'accedir a una "
"pàgina en línia de la wiki.][img-online-help]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:15
msgid ""
"We hope that with the introduction of the wiki it will be easier for "
"developers and contributors to maintain the documentation."
msgstr ""
"Esperem que amb la introducció de la wiki mantenir la documentació sigui més "
"fàcil tant per als desenvolupadors com pels contribuïdors."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:17 content/about/tour418.md:199
#: content/about/tour46.md:131
msgid "Application Finder *(xfce4-appfinder)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:19
msgid "![Collapsed view of the Application Finder][img-appfinder-collapsed]"
msgstr "![Vista reduïda del Application Finder][img-appfinder-collapsed]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:21
msgid ""
"The application finder has been completely rewritten and combines the "
"functionality of the old appfinder and xfrun4. Apart from user interface "
"improvements, it now allows creating custom actions matching a prefix or a "
"regex pattern."
msgstr ""
"S'ha reescrit completament l'Application Finder i  ara combina les "
"funcionalitats de l'antic appfinder i del xfrun4. A més a més de millores a "
"la interfície d'usuari, ara permet crear accions personalitzades amb "
"coincidències segons un prefix o un patró d'expressió regular."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:23
msgid "![Expanded view of the Application Finder][img-appfinder-expanded]"
msgstr "![Vista extesa de l'Application Finder][img-appfinder-expanded]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:25 content/about/tour412.md:39
#: content/about/tour414.md:33 content/about/tour416.md:47
#: content/about/tour418.md:37 content/about/tour46.md:19
#: content/about/tour48.md:29
msgid "Panel *(xfce4-panel)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:27
msgid "Multiple Rows"
msgstr "Files múltiples"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:29
msgid ""
"In 4.10 there is a single panel-wide option for configuring the number of "
"rows in the panel. Some plugins (e.g. *launchers*) fit a single row, while "
"others, like window buttons are allowed to occupy full width of the panel."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:31
msgid ""
"![A horizontal panel with a number of rows set to three][img-panel-rows]"
msgstr ""
"![Un panell horitzontal amb el número de files seleccionat a tres.][img-"
"panel-rows]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:33
msgid "Deskbar Mode"
msgstr "Mode barra d'escriptori"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:35
msgid ""
"The panel features a new configuration called a *deskbar* mode. In the "
"deskbar mode the panel is aligned vertically, just like in the vertical "
"mode, but the plugins are laid out horizontally. With multiple rows, it "
"allows creating wide vertical panels suitable for wide-screen setups."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:37
msgid ""
"![A panel in Deskbar mode with a number of rows set to five][img-panel-"
"deskbar]"
msgstr ""
"![Un panell en el mode barra d'escriptori amb el número de files seleccionat "
"a tres.][img-panel-deskbar]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:39
msgid "Actions Plugin"
msgstr "Connector d'accions"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:41
msgid ""
"Session plugin from the xfce4-session package has been merged with a "
"rewritten *actions* plugin"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:43
msgid ""
"![Action plugin in a menu mode (left), and in a button mode (right)][img-"
"panel-actions]"
msgstr ""
"![Complement Acció en mode menú (esquerra) i en mode botó (dreta)][img-panel-"
"actions]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:45
msgid "Window Buttons"
msgstr "Botons de les finestres"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:47
msgid ""
"The *window buttons* plugin no longer expands, which makes the plugin "
"positioning more flexible. In order to restore the previous behavior please "
"add a transparent *separator* plugin with the **Expand** option enabled just "
"behind the window buttons plugin."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:49 content/about/tour412.md:105
#: content/about/tour414.md:55 content/about/tour416.md:41
#: content/about/tour418.md:71 content/about/tour46.md:67
#: content/about/tour48.md:9
msgid "File Manager *(thunar)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:51
msgid ""
"There are few visual changes in this release of Thunar. The window has less "
"padding and the position of the status bar has been adjusted."
msgstr ""
"Aquest lliurament del Thunar té uns quants canvis visuals. La finestra té "
"menys separació i s'ha ajustat la posició de la barra d'estat."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:53 content/about/tour46.md:33
msgid "Session Manager *(xfce4-session)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:55
msgid ""
"The *session manager*'s settings dialog has a button for clearing the saved "
"session (no more `rm -r ~/.config/sessions`). Xfce4-tips has been removed "
"and the session manager can now lock the screen before suspending or "
"hibernating the system."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:57
msgid "Applications Autostart"
msgstr "Inici automàtic d'aplicacions"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:59
msgid ""
"Another noticeable change is the way GNOME and KDE compatibility works. "
"Compatibility check boxes only enable services, which have to be started "
"before other applications (*gnome-keyring* and *gconf* for GNOME and "
"*kdeinit* for KDE). All other autostart applications are available from "
"**Applications Autostart**, but they are listed using an italic font and not "
"enabled by default in order to distinguish them from Xfce applications. "
"Unlike in previous versions of Xfce, compatibility services can be started "
"independently from each other."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:61
msgid ""
"![Applications, which are not a part of Xfce, are listed using an italic "
"font][img-session-autostart]"
msgstr ""
"![Les aplicacions, que no formen part de l'Xfce, es llisten utilitzant un "
"tipus de lletra cursiva][img-session-autostart]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:63 content/about/tour412.md:63
#: content/about/tour46.md:85 content/about/tour48.md:73
msgid "Settings *(xfce4-settings)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:65
msgid "Settings Daemon"
msgstr "Dimoni d'ajusts"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:67
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.8 used two processes for applying settings: `xfce4-settings-helper` "
"and `xfsettingsd`. In 4.10 they have been merged into xfsettingsd, which now "
"handles all system settings."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:71
msgid ""
"The new *settings manager* groups configuration dialogs in categories and "
"allows you to search for their names or descriptions. Most of the dialogs "
"are also now embedded in the settings manager window (this was a compile-"
"time option in Xfce 4.8)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:73
msgid ""
"![The settings manager with icons grouped by category and a search filter "
"applied][img-settings-manager]"
msgstr ""
"![S'ha aplicat el gestor de paràmetres amb icones agrupades per categoria i "
"un filtre de cerca][img-settings-manager]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:75
msgid "Settings Editor"
msgstr "Editor d'ajusts"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:77
msgid ""
"The *settings editor* no longer collapses the entire tree when you edit a "
"property (this is because it now reloads a single cell rather than the whole "
"tree). Most properties can now be edited in-place, making it easier to "
"quickly adjust settings."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:79
msgid ""
"Using settings editor you can also monitor changes of settings in a selected "
"channel. Right-click on a channel in the main window, and select **Monitor** "
"to display the monitor window."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzant l'editor de configuració també podeu supervisar els canvis de "
"configuració en un canal seleccionat. Feu clic amb el botó dret sobre un "
"canal a la finestra principal i seleccioneu **Monitor** per a mostrar la "
"finestra del monitor."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:81
msgid ""
"![Settings editor with an open channel monitor, while editing a property in-"
"place][img-settings-editor]"
msgstr ""
"![Arranjament de l'editor amb un monitor de canal obert, mentre edita una "
"propietat al lloc][img-settings-editor]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:83
msgid "MIME Type Editor"
msgstr "Editor de tipus MIME"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:85
msgid ""
"In the last couple of years, many people were asking for a tool to manage "
"their file type associations. The new *MIME type editor* does just that. It "
"allows you to easily assign a default application to a file type, see your "
"changes and reset them to default settings when necessary. Note that it does "
"not allow you to change the system MIME Type definitions (add or remove "
"types and change icons)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:87
msgid ""
"![MIME types matching a pattern and a menu for selecting a default "
"application][img-settings-mime]"
msgstr ""
"![Tipus MIME que coincideixen amb un patró i un menú per a seleccionar una "
"aplicació predeterminada][img-settings-mime]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:89
msgid "Mouse and Touchpad"
msgstr "Ratolí i ratolí tàctic"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:91
msgid ""
"The *mouse and touchpad* dialog is capable of handling basic Synaptics and "
"Wacom properties in the GUI. A settings daemon running in the background "
"handles all kinds of device properties, as documented in the [mouse settings]"
"(https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/mouse) wiki."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:93
msgid ""
"![Synaptics touchpad settings in the mouse and touchpad dialog][img-settings-"
"mouse]"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:95 content/about/tour412.md:73
#: content/about/tour418.md:65 content/about/tour420.md:277
msgid "Appearance Settings"
msgstr "Ajusts de l'aparença"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:97
msgid ""
"In 4.10 you can drag and drop a tarball with a downloaded theme onto the "
"*style* or *icon* list. Xfce will attempt to extract and install the files "
"into the `~/.themes` or `~/.icons` directory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:99 content/about/tour412.md:55
#: content/about/tour418.md:47 content/about/tour46.md:9
msgid "Desktop Manager *(xfdesktop)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:101
msgid ""
"Although the initial plan for Xfce 4.10 was to integrate desktop handling in "
"Thunar, we have decided not to do it at this time yet. Meanwhile, Xfdesktop "
"has gained support for single-click operation, automated background image "
"cycling and thumbnail rendering."
msgstr ""
"Tot i que el pla inicial per a Xfce 4.10 era integrar la manipulació "
"d'escriptori a Thunar, hem decidit no fer-ho en aquest moment encara. "
"Mentrestant, Xfdesktop ha obtingut suport per a l'operació d'un sol clic, el "
"cicle automatitzat de la imatge de fons i la representació de miniatures."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:103
msgid ""
"![Desktop with image thumbnails and support for single-click operation][img-"
"xfdesktop]"
msgstr ""
"![Escriptori amb miniatures d'imatge i suport per a l'operació d'un sol clic]"
"[img-xfdesktop]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:105
msgid "Xfdesktop is now shipped with a new default background image."
msgstr "Xfdesktop ara s'envia amb una nova imatge de fons predeterminada."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:107 content/about/tour412.md:9
#: content/about/tour418.md:213 content/about/tour46.md:43
msgid "Window Manager *(xfwm4)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:109
msgid ""
"Xfwm4 can now tile a window when you drag it to the edge of the screen. This "
"feature is optional and is disabled by default. In such a case windows can "
"still be tiled using a keyboard shortcut. Another improvement is a better "
"theming support and cursor key navigation in the tab window (Alt+Tab)."
msgstr ""
"Xfwm4 ara pot tessel·lar una finestra quan l'arrossegueu fins a la vora de "
"la pantalla. Aquesta característica és opcional i està desactivada per "
"defecte. En aquest cas, les finestres encara es poden enrajolar utilitzant "
"una drecera de teclat. Una altra millora és un millor suport de tematització "
"i navegació de tecles de cursor a la finestra de pestanyes (Alt+Tab)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour412.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.12 tour"
msgstr "Recorregut de l'Xfce 4.12"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.12. It only "
"covers improvements made on the surface; for the full list of changes, see "
"the [changelogs](/download/changelogs/)."
msgstr ""
"Aquest recorregut us presentarà les característiques principals noves de "
"l'Xfce 4.12. Només cobreix les millores realitzades en la superfície; per a "
"la llista completa dels canvis, consulteu els [registres de canvis](/"
"download/changelogs/)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:11
msgid "Window Switcher Dialog"
msgstr "Diàleg del commutador de finestres"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:13
msgid ""
"The window manager's Alt+Tab dialog is now fully themeable and also gained "
"two new modes: a 'List' mode and a 'Window Preview' mode. Furthermore users "
"use their mouse to click/select the window they want to give focus to."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg Alt+Tab del gestor de finestres ara és completament temable i "
"també ha guanyat dos modes nous: un mode «Llista» i un mode «Vista prèvia de "
"finestres». A més, els usuaris utilitzen el seu ratolí per fer clic/"
"seleccionar la finestra a la qual volen donar el focus."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:15
msgid "![The traditional dialog is fully themable now][img-tabwin-simple-crop]"
msgstr ""
"![El diàleg tradicional ara és completament temable][img-tabwin-simple-crop]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:17
msgid "The List mode of the Alt-Tab dialog."
msgstr "El mode de llista del diàleg Alt-Tab."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:19
msgid ""
"![List mode of Alt-Tab, showing all window titles][img-tabwin-list-crop]"
msgstr ""
"![Mode de llista d'Alt-Tab, mostrant tots els títols de les finestres][img-"
"tabwin-list-crop]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:21
msgid ""
"The Window Preview mode shows thumbnails of windows' content alongside their "
"icon. Activating the compositor is a prerequisite for this mode."
msgstr ""
"El mode Vista prèvia de la finestra mostra miniatures del contingut de les "
"finestres al costat de la seva icona. Activar el compositor és un requisit "
"previ per a aquest mode."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:23
msgid "![Window thumbnails][img-tabwin-preview-crop]"
msgstr "![Miniatures de les finestres][img-tabwin-preview-crop]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:25
msgid "Tiling, Zooming, Client-side Decorations"
msgstr "Tiling, Zoom, Decoracions del costat del client"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:27
msgid ""
"Support for Client-Side Decorations (CSDs) has been improved. They now "
"properly snap to screen and panel borders, and tile correctly, even with "
"shadows."
msgstr ""
"S'ha millorat el suport per a les Decoracions Client-Side (CSD). Ara "
"s'ajusten correctament a les vores de la pantalla i del panell, i s'enrajola "
"correctament, fins i tot amb ombres."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:29
msgid "![Gtk3 apps with their decorations drawn by the client][img-xfwm4-csd]"
msgstr ""
"![Aplicacions Gtk3 amb les seves decoracions dibuixades pel client][img-"
"xfwm4-csd]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:31
msgid ""
"Window tiling mode was improved by providing support for corner-tiling, and "
"a new zooming mode was added using Alt + Mouse Wheel."
msgstr ""
"El mode de tessel·lació de les finestres s'ha millorat proporcionant suport "
"per a la inclinació de les cantonades, i s'ha afegit un nou mode de zoom "
"utilitzant Alt + Roda del ratolí."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:33
msgid ""
"![Drag and drop a window to a corner to tile it][img-xfwm4-tiling-small]"
msgstr ""
"![Arrossega i deixa anar una finestra a una cantonada per tessel·lar-la][img-"
"xfwm4-tiling-small]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:35
msgid "HiDPI Support"
msgstr "Compatibilitat amb HiDPI"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:37
msgid ""
"In order to better support modern hi-resolution screens, two new Xfwm4 "
"themes were added (hdpi, xhdpi)."
msgstr ""
"Per tal de donar un millor suport a les pantalles modernes d'alta resolució, "
"es van afegir dos nous temes Xfwm4 (hdpi, xhdpi)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:41
msgid "Intelligent Hiding"
msgstr "Amagat intel·ligent"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:43
msgid ""
"The panel can now intelligently hide itself when a window is dragged near it."
msgstr ""
"El panell ara pot amagar-se intel·ligentment quan una finestra s'arrossega a "
"prop d'ella."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:45
msgid "![Oh what is this window??][img-panel-shown]"
msgstr "![Oh, què és aquesta finestra?][img-panel-shown]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:47
msgid "![Don't come closer!][img-panel-shown-stack]"
msgstr "![No t'acostis!][img-panel-shown-stack]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:49
msgid "![Hah! Now you don't see me!][img-panel-hidden]"
msgstr "![Hah! Ara no em veus!][img-panel-hidden]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:51
msgid "Gtk3 plugins"
msgstr "Connectors de Gtk3"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:53
msgid ""
"Infrastructure was added to be able to load Gtk3 plugins alongside Gtk2 "
"plugins."
msgstr ""
"S'ha afegit una infraestructura per poder carregar connectors Gtk3 al costat "
"dels connectors Gtk2."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:57
msgid ""
"The desktop has a new wallpaper settings dialog with many new options and "
"better multi-monitor support. Drag the dialog to the display or workspace "
"where you want to change the wallpaper."
msgstr ""
"L'escriptori té un diàleg nou de configuració del fons de pantalla amb "
"moltes opcions noves i un millor suport multimonitor. Arrossegueu el diàleg "
"a la pantalla o a l'espai de treball on voleu canviar el fons de pantalla."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:59
msgid ""
"![Better multi-monitor support][img-xfdesktop-properties-multiworkspace]"
msgstr "![Millor suport multimonitor][img-xfdesktop-properties-multiworkspace]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:61
msgid ""
"Uncheck 'apply to all workspaces' to set a different wallpaper for each "
"workspace."
msgstr ""
"Desmarqueu «aplica a tots els espais de treball» per a establir un fons de "
"pantalla diferent per a cada espai de treball."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:65 content/about/tour418.md:59
#: content/about/tour420.md:287
msgid "Display Settings"
msgstr "Mostra els paràmetres"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:67
msgid ""
"Support for multi-monitor use was vastly improved in the display settings "
"dialog. Upon connecting a new display, a quick setup popup offers some of "
"the most-used modes for users to quickly change their layout."
msgstr ""
"El suport per a l'ús de multimonitor s'ha millorat enormement en el diàleg "
"de configuració de la pantalla. En connectar una pantalla nova, una finestra "
"emergent de configuració ràpida ofereix alguns dels modes més utilitzats "
"perquè els usuaris canviïn ràpidament la seva disposició."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:69
msgid "![Configure multiple displays][img-xfce4-display-settings-twoscreens]"
msgstr ""
"![Configura múltiples pantalles][img-xfce4-display-settings-twoscreens]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:71
msgid ""
"![Choose your layout when plugging in a new display][img-xfce4-display-"
"layout]"
msgstr ""
"![Trieu la vostra disposició quan es connecti a una pantalla nova][img-xfce4-"
"display-layout]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:75
msgid "The appearance dialog now showcases previews for styles and icons."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg d'aparença ara mostra previsualitzacions per als estils i les "
"icones."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:77
msgid "![Gtk style preview][img-xfce4-appearance-settings-style]"
msgstr "![Vista prèvia de l'estil Gtk][img-xfce4-appearance-settings-style]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:79
msgid "![Icon theme preview][img-xfce4-appearance-settings-icons]"
msgstr "![Vista prèvia del tema d'icones][img-xfce4-appearance-settings-icons]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour412.md:81 content/about/tour414.md:69
#: content/about/tour416.md:67
msgid "Power Manager *(xfce4-power-manager)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:83 content/about/tour414.md:71
#: content/about/tour414.md:85
msgid "Panel Plugin"
msgstr "Connector del panell"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:85
msgid ""
"A new panel plugin was created which allows you to quickly control your "
"screen brightness, either via the menu or by simply using your mouse's "
"scroll wheel over the plugin. The plugin's menu also shows all other "
"connected devices with a power status, e.g. bluetooth keyboards or wireless "
"mice. It still offers quick access to the presentation mode, which inhibits "
"your screensaver for as long as the option is active."
msgstr ""
"S'ha creat un nou connector del panell que permet controlar ràpidament la "
"brillantor de la pantalla, ja sigui a través del menú o simplement "
"utilitzant la roda de desplaçament del ratolí sobre el connector. El menú "
"del connector també mostra tots els altres dispositius connectats amb un "
"estat d'energia, per exemple, teclats bluetooth o ratolins sense fils. "
"Encara ofereix un accés ràpid al mode de presentació, que inhibeix el vostre "
"estalvi de pantalla mentre l'opció estigui activa."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:87
msgid ""
"![The plugin's menu allows users to control screen brightness and check on "
"the remaining uptime their battery provides.][img-xfpm-plugin-crop]"
msgstr ""
"![El menú del connector permet als usuaris controlar la brillantor de la "
"pantalla i comprovar el temps d'activitat restant que proporciona la "
"bateria.][img-xfpm-plugin-crop]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:89 content/about/tour414.md:49
msgid "Settings Dialog"
msgstr "Diàleg d'ajusts"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:91
msgid ""
"The settings dialog was completely restructured (separating button/lid "
"events from system and display behavior) and offers a clearer way of setting "
"your preferences."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg de configuració s'ha reestructurat completament (separant els "
"esdeveniments dels botons/límits del sistema i el comportament de la "
"pantalla) i ofereix una manera més clara d'establir les vostres preferències."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:93
msgid ""
"![Configure what action to take when certain buttons are pressed or the "
"laptop lid is closed][img-xfpm-prefs-general]"
msgstr ""
"![Configura l'acció a prendre quan es pressionen certs botons o es tanca la "
"tapa del portàtil][img-xfpm-prefs-general]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:95
msgid ""
"![Configure what to do when the user is inactive or battery is drained][img-"
"xfpm-prefs-system]"
msgstr ""
"![Configura què fer quan l'usuari està inactiu o la bateria està "
"descarregada][img-xfpm-prefs-system]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:97
msgid "![Manage display power management][img-xfpm-prefs-display]"
msgstr ""
"![Administra la gestió de l'energia del monitor][img-xfpm-prefs-display]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:99
msgid "![Display information on all connected devices][img-xfpm-prefs-devices]"
msgstr ""
"![Informació del monitor en tots els dispositius connectats][img-xfpm-prefs-"
"devices]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:101
msgid ""
"When light-locker is available, you can control its settings directly via "
"the power manager."
msgstr ""
"Quan estigui disponible un bloqueig de llum, podeu controlar la seva "
"configuració directament a través del gestor d'energia."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:103
msgid "![Setup light-locker integration][img-xfpm-prefs-security]"
msgstr ""
"![Configura la integració amb el bloqueig de llum][img-xfpm-prefs-security]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:107
msgid "Tab Support"
msgstr "Implementació de pestanyes"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:109
msgid ""
"A long-awaited feature was added: you can now open multiple folders in the "
"same Thunar window."
msgstr ""
"S'ha afegit una característica molt esperada: ara podeu obrir diverses "
"carpetes a la mateixa finestra Thunar."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:111
msgid "![Browse multiple directories][img-thunar-tabs]"
msgstr "![Navegació per diversos directoris][img-thunar-tabs]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:113
msgid ""
"Thunar now displays the remaining free space with a bar in a folder "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"Thunar ara mostra l'espai lliure restant amb una barra a les propietats "
"d'una carpeta."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:115
msgid "![Freespace bar][img-thunar-freespace]"
msgstr "![Barra d'espai lliure][img-thunar-freespace]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:117
msgid "And you can select multiple files to see their properties at once."
msgstr ""
"I podeu seleccionar diversos fitxers per veure les seves propietats alhora."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:119
msgid "![Multiple File Properties][img-thunar-multifiles-props]"
msgstr "![Propietats de fitxers múltiples][img-thunar-multifiles-props]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour412.md:121
msgid "Goodies"
msgstr "Dolços"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:123
msgid ""
"There have been lots of improvements to our goodies, and some new and shiny "
"applications have been added by new contributors."
msgstr ""
"Hi ha hagut un munt de millores en els nostres dolços, i algunes aplicacions "
"noves i brillants han estat afegides per nous contribuents."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:125
msgid "Alternative panel menu plugin *(xfce4-whiskermenu)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:127
msgid ""
"The whisker menu is an alternative to the traditional menu plugin, showing "
"favourites, allowing to search through existing apps and much more."
msgstr ""
"El menú whisker és una alternativa al connector de menú tradicional, "
"mostrant els favorits, permetent cercar a través d'aplicacions existents i "
"molt més."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:129
msgid "![Browse through categories][img-whiskermenu-default]"
msgstr "![Navegació a través de categories][img-whiskermenu-default]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:131
msgid "![Search for an application][img-whiskermenu-search]"
msgstr "![Cerca d'una aplicació][img-whiskermenu-search]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:133
msgid "Task Manager *(xfce4-taskmanager)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:135
msgid ""
"The task manager got a revamped user interface, a filter and also supports "
"Gtk3 now."
msgstr ""
"El gestor de tasques té una interfície d'usuari renovada, un filtre i també "
"suporta ara el Gtk3."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:137
msgid "![Show processes as a tree][img-taskman-tree]"
msgstr "![Mostra els processos com un arbre][img-taskman-tree]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:139
msgid "![Filter processes by name][img-taskman-filter]"
msgstr "![Filtra els processos pel nom][img-taskman-filter]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:141 content/about/tour414.md:91
msgid "Media Player *(parole)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:143
msgid ""
"Parole's UI was totally redone in Gtk3. It now supports multiple video "
"backends, makes more efficient use of your resources and contains a few "
"novel plugins."
msgstr ""
"La interfície d'usuari de Parole es va refer totalment a Gtk3. Ara admet "
"múltiples dorsals de vídeo, fa un ús més eficient dels vostres recursos i "
"conté alguns connectors nous."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:145
msgid "![Watch videos][img-parole]"
msgstr "![Veure vídeos][img-parole]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:147
msgid ""
"The media controls are now contained in a slide-over overlay (with a "
"configurable timeout)."
msgstr ""
"Els controls multimèdia ara estan continguts en una superposició de "
"diapositives (amb un temps d'espera configurable)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:149
msgid "![Listen to music][img-parole-audio]"
msgstr "![Escoltar música][img-parole-audio]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:151
msgid "Text Editor *(mousepad)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:153
msgid ""
"Mousepad was totally rewritten, gained a settings dialog and now supports "
"Gtk3."
msgstr ""
"Mousepad ha estat totalment reescrit, ha guanyat un diàleg de configuració i "
"ara és compatible amb Gtk3."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:155
msgid "![New mousepad settings][img-mousepad-prefs]"
msgstr "![Ajusts nous de mousepad][img-mousepad-prefs]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour412.md:157
msgid "A note on Xfce's portability"
msgstr "Una nota sobre la portabilitat de l'Xfce"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:159
msgid ""
"All but one of those screenshots were taken on machines running OpenBSD "
"-current, a good proof that Xfce is still portable and friendly to all Unix "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"Totes menys una d'aquestes imatges van ser preses en màquines amb OpenBSD, "
"una bona prova que Xfce és encara portable i amigable per a tots els "
"sistemes Unix."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour414.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.14 tour"
msgstr "Visita a Xfce 4.14"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.14. It only "
"covers improvements made on the surface; for the full list of changes, see "
"the [changelogs](/download/changelogs/)."
msgstr ""
"Aquest recorregut us introduirà les noves característiques principals de "
"l'Xfce 4.14. Només cobreix les millores realitzades a la superfície; per a "
"la llista completa de canvis, vegeu els [changelogs](/download/changelogs/)."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:9 content/about/tour416.md:17
#: content/about/tour418.md:53
msgid "Settings Manager *(xfce4-settings)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:11
msgid "Color Profiles Dialog"
msgstr "Diàleg Perfils de color"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:13
msgid ""
"A new dialog for setting [color profiles](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-"
"settings/4.14/color) for monitors, printers and scanners was introduced. It "
"acts as a frontend to various daemons that talk directly to colord, e.g. "
"saned (scanners), cupsd (printers) or xiccd (monitors)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:15
msgid "![The new color profiles dialog][img-color-profiles]"
msgstr "![El diàleg Perfils de color nous][img-color-profiles]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:17 content/about/tour416.md:29
msgid "Display Dialog"
msgstr "Mostra el diàleg"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:19
msgid ""
"Several improvements were made to the [display dialog](https://docs.xfce.org/"
"xfce/xfce4-settings/4.14/display). Apart from tweaks to the user interface "
"to make the interaction more intuitive (introducing display numbering, "
"showing a primary indicator with quick access to panel, notification and "
"desktop settings etc.) a feature to save and restore complete display "
"profiles was added. If a single profile exists for a setup, the Xfce "
"settings daemon will automatically enable it. If multiple profiles exist, it "
"will pop up the minimal dialog and offer all profiles in addition to the "
"previously available pre-sets (internal only, mirror, extend and external "
"only)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:21
msgid "![The primary indicator][img-display-general]"
msgstr "![L'indicador primari][img-display-general]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:23
msgid "![The display profile list][img-display-advanced]"
msgstr "![La llista de perfils de visualització][img-display-advanced]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:25
msgid ""
"![The improved minimal dialog - in this case only showing one profile only "
"which never happens anymore now ;)][img-display-minimal]"
msgstr ""
"![El diàleg mínim millorat - en aquest cas només es mostra un perfil que ja "
"no passa mai més ;)][img-display-minimal]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:27
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Accessibilitat"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:29
msgid ""
"One [accessibility](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/4.14/"
"accessibility) feature that people coming from other desktop environments or "
"operating systems were still missing is to set a (custom) keyboard shortcut "
"(by default: Super+F1) to visually locate the mouse pointer. This feature "
"was added in Xfce 4.14."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:31
msgid "![The mouse pointer location animation][img-locate-mouse]"
msgstr "![L'animació de la ubicació del punter del ratolí][img-locate-mouse]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:35
msgid "General: Icon size"
msgstr "General: Mida de les icones"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:37
msgid ""
"A new feature that we introduced in the [panel](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/"
"xfce4-panel/4.14/start) is being able to control the icon size of all "
"plugins. ('All' may not be technically correct, as not all plugins support "
"the new API as of now, but now they *can*. Plus the Window buttons plugin is "
"an exception, because libwnck doesn't allow anything other than 16px or "
"32px.) This means setups that were previously impossible, because icons "
"would upscale automatically according to size-steps hard-coded in the panel, "
"are now possible (see below)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:39
msgid "![A 32px tall panel with 16px icons][img-panel-iconsize]"
msgstr "![Un panell de 32px d'alçada amb icones de 16px][img-panel-iconsize]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:41
msgid "Window buttons: Grouping"
msgstr "Botons de la finestra: Agrupament"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:43
msgid ""
"Grouping was improved in the [Window buttons plugin](https://docs.xfce.org/"
"xfce/xfce4-panel/4.14/tasklist), both functionally (by improving the "
"matching and icon-finding) and visually by providing a new group indicator "
"that is less likely to clash with window titles containing an enumeration in "
"brackets."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:45
msgid "![The new group indicator (two terminal windows)][img-panel-group]"
msgstr ""
"![El nou indicador de grup (dues finestres de terminal)][img-panel-group]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:47
msgid "Session *(xfce4-session)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:51
msgid ""
"As soon as a [session](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/4.14/"
"preferences) has been saved a new tab is dynamically added to the settings "
"dialog displaying all saved sessions and allowing to delete one or all of "
"them. This should make it way more discoverable for users if they actually "
"have saved sessions that influence the startup behavior - previously this "
"had to be checked manually in the filesystem."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:53
msgid "![The settings dialog after saving a session][img-session-saved]"
msgstr ""
"![El diàleg de configuració després de desar una sessió][img-session-saved]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:57
msgid "Pathbar"
msgstr "Barra de camins"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:59
msgid ""
"Up to Xfce 4.12 [Thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/4.14/start) "
"offered two options for the pathbar/locationbar. The best of both worlds has "
"now been mixed into one powerful pathbar, featuring both clickable "
"breadcrumbs (i.e. folders), an easily accessible way to hand-type a path as "
"well as an improved look."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:61
msgid "![Thunar's new pathbar][img-thunar-pathbar]"
msgstr "![Barra de ruta nova del Thunar][img-thunar-pathbar]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:63
msgid "Folder Thumbnailer"
msgstr "Miniatura de carpetes"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:65
msgid ""
"Same as on the Desktop you can now save an image with the name 'folder.jpg' "
"in a folder and get it displayed as its icon in the File Manager. Note: "
"[Please read the docs](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/tumbler/"
"available_plugins#customized_thumbnailer_for_folders) on how to set this up "
"(if your distribution hasn't enabled it by default)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:67
msgid "![Thunar's new folder thumbnails][img-thunar-folder-jpg]"
msgstr "![Miniatures de carpetes noves del Thunar][img-thunar-folder-jpg]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:73
msgid ""
"The [Power Manager's panel plugin](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-"
"manager/4.14/panel-plugin) supports symbolic icons now and uses the standard "
"UPower icon names (making it more compatible with all icon themes). It also "
"shows an indicator if applications inhibit power management functions like "
"suspend (when power is low) or display dimming (after a defined timeout)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:75
msgid ""
"![Parole's video playback is inhibiting power management][img-xfpm-"
"inhibitors]"
msgstr ""
"![La reproducció de vídeo de Parole està inhibint la gestió d'energia][img-"
"xfpm-inhibitors]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:77
msgid "Notification Service *(xfce4-notifyd)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:79 content/about/tour44.md:123
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Ajusts"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:81
msgid ""
"Several new features have been added in Xfce's [Notification service]"
"(https://docs.xfce.org/apps/notifyd/start), including a notifications log, "
"the possibility to disable notifications per application, a global 'Do Not "
"Disturb' mode, which inhibits all notifications, and finally a new animation "
"('slide out')."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:83
msgid "![The new notification animation 'slide out'][img-notifyd-slideout]"
msgstr "![L'animació de notificació nova «slide out»][img-notifyd-slideout]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:87
msgid ""
"Furthermore a new panel plugin was added which provides quick access to both "
"the 'Do Not Disturb' mode as well as the log of recent notifications."
msgstr ""
"A més, s'ha afegit un nou connector de panell que proporciona accés ràpid "
"tant al mode 'No molestar' com al registre de notificacions recents."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:89
msgid "![The new panel plugin][img-notifyd-panel]"
msgstr "![El connector nou del panell][img-notifyd-panel]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:93
msgid "Mini Mode"
msgstr "Mode mínim"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:95
msgid ""
"[Parole](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/parole/start) now features a 'Mini "
"Mode', where the interface is simplified to just display the album artwork "
"and can be positioned over other windows without getting in the way."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:97
msgid ""
"![Just right-click anywhere in the player window to select 'Mini Mode'...]"
"[img-parole-normal-mode]"
msgstr ""
"![Feu clic amb el botó dret a qualsevol lloc de la finestra del reproductor "
"per a seleccionar el «Mode Mini»...][img-parole-normal-mode]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:99
msgid ""
"![Afterwards, enjoy a truly minimalistic playback experience!][img-parole-"
"mini-mode]"
msgstr ""
"![Després, gaudeix d'una experiència de reproducció realment minimalista!]"
"[img-parole-mini-mode]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:101
msgid "Screensaver *(xfce4-screensaver)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:103
msgid "A Modern Locking Experience"
msgstr "Una experiència de bloqueig moderna"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:105
msgid ""
"The new Xfce [Screensaver](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screensaver/start) "
"provides a configurable lockscreen experience. You can selectively toggle "
"the lock screen and screensaver, and all Xscreensaver themes are supported "
"(with configuration options) out of the box. If you prefer a blank screen, "
"Xfce Screensaver also includes a blank screen option with DPMS integration."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:107
msgid ""
"![The new lock screen, sharing styles with LightDM GTK+ Greeter for a "
"consistent experience.][img-saver-dialog]"
msgstr ""
"![La nova pantalla de bloqueig, compartint estils amb el LightDM GTK+ "
"Greeter per a una experiència coherent.][img-saver-dialog]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:109
msgid ""
"![Make it your own. Xfce Screensaver supports a multitude of configuration "
"options.][img-saver-preferences]"
msgstr ""
"![Fes-ho teu. Xfce Screensaver admet multitud d'opcions de configuració.]"
"[img-saver-preferences]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:111
msgid "Terminal *(xfce4-terminal)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:113
msgid ""
"Lots and lots of features have accumulated in the [Terminal](https://"
"docs.xfce.org/apps/terminal/start) over the last years. Amongst them 'Undo "
"Close Tab' and 'Close Other Tabs' functionality (similar to web browsers), "
"'Copy Input to All Tabs', 'Set Title Color' (allows to customize tab text "
"color), 'Save Contents' (saves tab contents to a file), an 'Unsafe Paste' "
"dialog (which prevents the terminal from auto-executing pasted text as a "
"command) and support for zooming. Finally when closing a tab or window, "
"there is a new check for running processes which prevents accidentally "
"closing a terminal that is running a process."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:115
msgid "![Zooming, 'Save Contents' and much more!][img-terminal]"
msgstr "![Ampliació, 'Desa el contingut' i molt més!][img-terminal]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:117
msgid "Screenshooter *(xfce4-screenshooter)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:119
msgid ""
"The Xfce [Screenshooter](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screenshooter/start) "
"gained several notable features, amongst others seeing the size of the "
"screenshot while dragging, moving the selection with the mouse and better "
"[imgur](https://imgur.com) integration."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:121
msgid ""
"![I can drag and move the screenshot area, whoop whoop!][img-screenshooter]"
msgstr ""
"![Puc arrossegar i moure l'àrea de captura de pantalla, puta!][img-"
"screenshooter]"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour416.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.16 tour"
msgstr "Tour Xfce 4.16"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.16. It only "
"covers improvements made on the (user-visible) surface; for the full list of "
"changes, see the [changelog](/download/changelogs/4.16/)."
msgstr ""
"Aquest recorregut us introduirà les noves característiques principals de "
"l'Xfce 4.16. Només cobreix les millores realitzades a la superfície (visible "
"per l'usuari); per a la llista completa de canvis, vegeu el registre de "
"canvis [](/download/changelogs/4.16/)."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour416.md:9
msgid "Visual identity: New icons and palette"
msgstr "Identitat visual: noves icones i paleta"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:11
msgid ""
"In order to make Xfce shine a little more out of the box and to strengthen "
"its visual identity we created new icons for all of our core applications "
"and based them on a shared palette to ensure consistency. We also set some "
"further (implicit) design constraints, loosely following Adwaita's "
"principles."
msgstr ""
"Per tal de fer que Xfce brilli una mica més fora de la caixa i per enfortir "
"la seva identitat visual, vam crear noves icones per a totes les nostres "
"aplicacions principals i les vam basar en una paleta compartida per "
"assegurar la consistència. També vam establir algunes restriccions de "
"disseny (implícites), seguint vagament els principis d'Adwaita."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:13
msgid "![The Xfce palette][img-palette]"
msgstr "![La paleta Xfce][img-palette]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:15
msgid ""
"![New upstream Xfce icons, coming in many sizes for sharp appearance][img-"
"upstream-icons]"
msgstr ""
"![Icones noves de l'Xfce, que venen en moltes mides per a una aparença "
"nítida][img-upstream-icons]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:19
msgid ""
"The Settings Manager itself received a visual refresh of its filter box, "
"which can now be hidden permanently. At the same time the search "
"capabilities of the filter box were improved by searching the descriptive "
"'Comments' part of each dialog's launcher (aka [.desktop](https://"
"specifications.freedesktop.org/desktop-entry-spec/desktop-entry-spec-"
"latest.html)) file."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:21
msgid "![Visually cleaner, more powerful filter box][img-settings-manager]"
msgstr "![Caixa de filtres visualment més neta i potent][img-settings-manager]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour416.md:23 content/about/tour418.md:163
msgid "Default Applications"
msgstr "Aplicacions predeterminades"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:25
msgid ""
"This new dialog represents a merger between the previously available 'Mime "
"Settings' and the 'Preferred Applications' dialogs. Consolidating both in "
"one place means users have an easier time setting default applications to "
"handle certain file types."
msgstr ""
"Aquest diàleg nou representa una fusió entre els diàlegs «Configuració MIME» "
"disponibles anteriorment i «Aplicacions preferides». Consolidar tots dos en "
"un sol lloc significa que els usuaris tenen un temps més fàcil d'establir "
"aplicacions predeterminades per gestionar certs tipus de fitxers."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:27
msgid "![The new Default Applications dialog][img-default-applications]"
msgstr ""
"![El diàleg Aplicacions predeterminades noves][img-default-applications]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:31
msgid ""
"To better support high-density displays - which come in various sizes and "
"densities - we added fractional scaling based on the RandR extension of X11. "
"Furthermore the preferred mode of a display is now marked with an asterisk "
"and aspect ratios are shown along display resolutions."
msgstr ""
"Per a un millor suport de pantalles d'alta densitat - que venen en diverses "
"mides i densitats - afegim escalat fraccionat basat en l'extensió RandR de "
"X11. A més, el mode preferit d'una pantalla ara està marcat amb un asterisc "
"i les relacions d'aspecte es mostren al llarg de les resolucions de "
"visualització."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:33
msgid "![Fractional scaling support][img-display-dialog]"
msgstr "![Implementació de l'escalat fraccionat][img-display-dialog]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour416.md:35
msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "Dreceres de teclat"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:37
msgid ""
"In order to make things easier for our users we added more default keyboard "
"shortcuts out of the box, for instance for window tiling or to open Thunar. "
"The keyboard shortcuts dialog itself was also visually updated."
msgstr ""
"Per tal de fer les coses més fàcils per als nostres usuaris, vam afegir més "
"dreceres de teclat predeterminades fora de la caixa, per exemple per a la "
"tessel·lació de finestres o per obrir Thunar. El diàleg de dreceres de "
"teclat també s'ha actualitzat visualment."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:39
msgid "![Visually updated keyboard shortcuts dialog][img-keyboard-shortcuts]"
msgstr ""
"![Diàleg de dreceres de teclat actualitzades visualment][img-keyboard-"
"shortcuts]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:43
msgid ""
"In Thunar's copy and move dialogs users can now easily pause the respective "
"file operation. Furthermore support for queued file transfer, remembering "
"view settings per folder and support for transparency in Gtk themes was "
"added."
msgstr ""
"En els diàlegs de còpia i moviment de Thunar, els usuaris ara poden fer una "
"pausa fàcil a l'operació de fitxer respectiva. A més, s'ha afegit el suport "
"per a la transferència de fitxers a la cua, recordant la configuració de la "
"vista per carpeta i el suport per a la transparència en els temes Gtk."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:45
msgid "![Thunar can now pause copying/moving files][img-thunar-copy]"
msgstr ""
"![El Thunar ara pot fer una pausa en copiar/moure fitxers][img-thunar-copy]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:49
msgid ""
"The panel received quite a few noteworthy updates, an animation for autohide "
"and intellihide, a new 'Status Tray' plugin that combines both legacy "
"Systray item support with modern StatusNotifier item support, dark mode "
"support, launchers showing additional actions on right-click, window buttons "
"offering to 'Launch a new instance...' and much more."
msgstr ""
"El panell va rebre bastants actualitzacions notables, una animació per a "
"ocultar automàticament i intel·ligir, un nou connector «Status Tray» que "
"combina el suport d'element Systray heretat amb el suport modern d'element "
"StatusNotifier, suport en mode fosc, llançadors que mostren accions "
"addicionals en el clic dret, botons de finestra que ofereixen per a «Llançar "
"una instància nova...» i molt més."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:51
msgid "![Dark mode enabled in the panel's settings dialog][img-panel-dark]"
msgstr ""
"![Mode fosc activat al diàleg de configuració del panell][img-panel-dark]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:53
msgid "![The new statustray plugin][img-panel-statustray]"
msgstr "![El connector nou de la safata d'estat][img-panel-statustray]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:55
msgid "![Autohide animation][img-panel-autohide]"
msgstr "![Amaga automàticament l'animació][img-panel-autohide]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:57
msgid "![Launch a new instance!][img-panel-launch]"
msgstr "![Llança una instància nova!][img-panel-launch]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour416.md:59
msgid "About Dialog *(xfce4-about)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:61
msgid ""
"Not only was the Xfce tab reworked to be more visually appealing and easily "
"parsable, a separate tab showing basic information about the user's system "
"was also added."
msgstr ""
"No només es va reelaborar la pestanya Xfce per ser més atractiva visualment "
"i fàcil d'analitzar, també es va afegir una pestanya separada que mostra "
"informació bàsica sobre el sistema de l'usuari."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:63
msgid "![About Xfce][img-about-xfce]"
msgstr "![Quant a Xfce][img-about-xfce]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:65
msgid "![About System][img-about-system]"
msgstr "![Quant al sistema][img-about-system]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:69
msgid ""
"The settings dialog of the power manager was cleaned up and shows either 'on "
"battery' or 'plugged in' settings as opposed to both in a huge table."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg de configuració del gestor d'energia s'ha netejat i mostra la "
"configuració «en bateria» o «connectat» en lloc de totes dues en una taula "
"enorme."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:71
msgid "![Power Manager settings][img-powermanager]"
msgstr "![Configuració del gestor d'energia][img-powermanager]"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour418.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.18 tour"
msgstr "Tour Xfce 4.18"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.18. It only "
"covers improvements made on the (user-visible) surface."
msgstr ""
"Aquest recorregut us introduirà noves característiques principals de l'Xfce "
"4.18. Només cobreix les millores realitzades en la superfície (visible per "
"l'usuari)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:9
msgid ""
"Check the full [Xfce 4.18 changelog](/download/changelogs/4.18/) for a "
"detailed list of changes."
msgstr ""
"Comproveu el registre complet de canvis [Xfce 4.18](/download/changelogs/"
"4.18/) per a una llista detallada de canvis."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour418.md:11
msgid "Widget Library *(libxfce4ui)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:13
msgid "Filename Input Dialog"
msgstr "Diàleg d'entrada del nom de fitxer"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:15
msgid ""
"XfceFilenameInput is a comfortable widget for filename input, which was "
"added in order to prevent invalid filenames at an early stage and to give "
"detailed feedback on the concrete problem."
msgstr ""
"XfceFilenameInput és un giny còmode per a l'entrada de noms de fitxer, que "
"es va afegir per tal d'evitar noms de fitxer no vàlids en una fase "
"primerenca i per donar una retroalimentació detallada sobre el problema "
"concret."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:17
msgid ""
"![XfceFilenameInput - trailing whitespaces][img-xfce4ui-new-file-dialog1]"
msgstr ""
"![XfceFilenameInput - espais en blanc finals][img-xfce4ui-new-file-dialog1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:19
msgid "![XfceFilenameInput - slash][img-xfce4ui-new-file-dialog2]"
msgstr "![XfceFilenameInput - barra][img-xfce4ui-new-file-dialog2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:21
msgid "Generic Shortcut Editor"
msgstr "Editor de dreceres genèriques"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:23
msgid ""
"This widget is a shortcut editor which was introduced in order to have a "
"graphical interface to modify component-specific shortcuts. Currently, it is "
"only used inside Thunar, Xfce4-terminal and Mousepad, though other "
"components might follow."
msgstr ""
"Aquest giny és un editor de dreceres que es va introduir per tal de tenir "
"una interfície gràfica per modificar les dreceres específiques de "
"components. Actualment, només s'utilitza dins de Thunar, Xfce4-terminal i "
"Mousepad, encara que altres components podrien seguir."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:25
msgid "![XfceShortcutsEditor in Thunar][img-xfce4ui-shortcuts-editor]"
msgstr "![XfceShortcutsEditor en Thunar][img-xfce4ui-shortcuts-editor]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour418.md:27
msgid "Thumbnail Service *(tumbler)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:29
msgid ""
"Some performance improvements for the pixbuf-thumbnailer and the scheduler "
"were done. As well now there are multiple overwrite options for the desktop-"
"thumbnailer."
msgstr ""
"Es van fer algunes millores de rendiment per a la miniatures de pixbuf i el "
"programador. També ara hi ha múltiples opcions de sobreescriptura per a "
"l'escriptori-miniatures."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:31
msgid ""
"There is now support for the thumbnail sizes x-large and xx-large, which are "
"very useful for high resolution displays."
msgstr ""
"Ara hi ha suport per a les mides de miniatures x-large i xx-large, que són "
"molt útils per a pantalles d'alta resolució."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:33
msgid ""
"Tumbler and Thunar now support shared thumbnail repositories, like described "
"in the freedesktop.org thumbnail specification. This feature can be used to "
"produce thumbnails for a folder in advance, directly located near the "
"pictures. Like that, the thumbnails don't need to be re-generated for each "
"individual user."
msgstr ""
"Tumbler i Thunar ara admeten repositoris compartits de miniatures, com es "
"descriu a l'especificació de miniatures freedesktop.org. Aquesta "
"característica es pot utilitzar per produir miniatures per a una carpeta amb "
"antelació, directament situada a prop de les imatges. D'aquesta manera, les "
"miniatures no necessiten ser regenerades per a cada usuari individual."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:35
msgid ""
"For more information on shared thumbnails, check the [related blog post]"
"(http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog03.html)."
msgstr ""
"Per a més informació sobre les miniatures compartides, consulteu l'entrada "
"[relacionada amb el blog](http://users.uoa.gr/sdi1800073/sources/"
"xfceblog03.html)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:39
msgid ""
"The DateTime and the Clock plugins provided overlapping functionality. In "
"order to prevent parallel development, they have been merged into a single "
"plugin."
msgstr ""
"Els connectors DateTime i Clock proporcionaven una funcionalitat "
"superposada. Per tal d'evitar el desenvolupament paral·lel, s'han fusionat "
"en un únic connector."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:41
msgid "![The new 'Clock' panel widget][img-panel-clock1]"
msgstr "![El giny nou del panell «Bloqueja»][img-panel-clock1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:43
msgid ""
"The new Clock plugin received a new binary time mode now and provides a "
"sleep monitor. Here's a screenshot of all possible layouts which are: "
"Analog, Binary, Digital, Fuzzy and LCD."
msgstr ""
"El nou connector del Rellotge ha rebut un nou mode binari de temps ara i "
"proporciona un monitor de son. Aquesta és una captura de pantalla de totes "
"les disposicions possibles que són: Analògic, Binari, Digital, Fuzzy i LCD."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:45
msgid "![All possible Clock Modes][img-panel-clock2]"
msgstr "![Tots els modes de rellotge possibles][img-panel-clock2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:49
msgid ""
"Like in Thunar, the 'Delete' menu entry in the context menu can now be "
"hidden."
msgstr ""
"Igual que a Thunar, l'entrada de menú «Elimina» al menú contextual ara es "
"pot ocultar."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:51
msgid ""
"In order to don't mess the desktop by accident on pressing 'rearrange "
"desktop icons', the user is asked for confirmation now."
msgstr ""
"Per tal de no molestar l'escriptori per accident en prémer 'reordenar icones "
"d'escriptori', es demana a l'usuari confirmació ara."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:55
msgid ""
"The search entry for xfce4-settings-manager was a bit simplified. Now it "
"will always be shown, without any slider or button."
msgstr ""
"L'entrada de cerca d'xfce4-settings-manager s'ha simplificat una mica. Ara "
"sempre es mostrarà, sense control lliscant ni botó."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:57
msgid ""
"![xfce4-settings-manager - the search entry is always shown][img-settings-"
"main-dialog]"
msgstr ""
"![xfce4-settings-manager - l'entrada de cerca sempre es mostra][img-settings-"
"main-dialog]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:61
msgid ""
"xfce4-display-settings got some minor improvements and the possibility to "
"decide what to do when new displays are connected."
msgstr ""
"xfce4-display-settings va obtenir algunes millores menors i la possibilitat "
"de decidir què fer quan es connecten noves pantalles."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:63
msgid "![xfce4-display-settings - minor improvements][img-settings-display]"
msgstr "![xfce4-display-settings - millores menors][img-settings-display]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:67
msgid ""
"On selecting a new theme, there is now the option to automatically set a "
"matching xfwm4 theme, if available."
msgstr ""
"En seleccionar un tema nou, ara hi ha l'opció d'establir automàticament un "
"tema xfwm4, si està disponible."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:69
msgid ""
"![xfce4-appearance-settings - toggle to set matching Xfwm4 theme][img-"
"settings-appearance]"
msgstr ""
"![xfce4-appearance-settings - commuta per establir el tema Xfwm4 que "
"coincideix][img-settings-appearance]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:73 content/about/tour420.md:171
msgid "List View"
msgstr "Vista de llista"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:75
msgid ""
"For directories, the count of containing files can now be displayed in the "
"size column. It is now possible to add a 'file creation date' column, and "
"the 'configure columns' dialog can be opened with a right-click on any "
"column head."
msgstr ""
"Per als directoris, el recompte de fitxers que contenen ara es pot mostrar a "
"la columna de mida. Ara és possible afegir una columna 'data de creació de "
"fitxers', i el diàleg 'configura les columnes' es pot obrir amb un clic dret "
"sobre qualsevol capçalera de columna."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:77
msgid "![Thunar - List View - Preferences][img-thunar-listview1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Vista de llista - Preferències][img-thunar-listview1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:79
msgid ""
"![Thunar - List View - File count and file creation date][img-thunar-"
"listview2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Vista de llista - Nombre de fitxers i data de creació de fitxers]"
"[img-thunar-listview2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:81
msgid "Image Preview"
msgstr "Vista prèvia de la imatge"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:83
msgid ""
"Finally, an image preview side pane has been added to Thunar. No, wait, "
"actually two of them! You can choose to either use the 'embedded' mode which "
"will take no extra space, but hide parts of the left side pane. Or you can "
"go for the 'standalone' mode, which will use a separate pane on the right "
"and display as well some basic information."
msgstr ""
"Finalment, s'ha afegit una subfinestra lateral de vista prèvia d'imatge a "
"Thunar. No, espera, en realitat dos d'ells! Podeu triar utilitzar el mode "
"«incrustat» que no prendrà espai addicional, però ocultarà parts de la "
"subfinestra lateral esquerra. O podeu anar pel mode 'standalone', que "
"utilitzarà una subfinestra separada a la dreta i mostrarà també alguna "
"informació bàsica."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:85
msgid "![Thunar - Embedded Image Preview][img-thunar-preview1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Vista prèvia de la imatge incrustada][img-thunar-preview1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:87
msgid "![Thunar - Standalone Image Preview][img-thunar-preview2]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Vista prèvia de la imatge independent][img-thunar-preview2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:89
msgid "Undo and Redo"
msgstr "Desfés"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:91
msgid ""
"It is now possible to undo basic file operations and to redo them. Undo and "
"Redo can be used for 'move', 'rename', 'trash', 'link' and 'create' "
"operations. Per default, a history of the last 10 operations is stored, "
"though the history length is configurable. Whenever an Undo/Redo is "
"triggered, a notification with few details will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Ara és possible desfer les operacions bàsiques de fitxers i refer-les. "
"Desfés i Refés es poden utilitzar per a les operacions 'moure', "
"'reanomenar', 'trash', 'enllaç' i 'crear'. Per defecte, s'emmagatzema un "
"historial de les últimes 10 operacions, encara que la longitud de "
"l'historial és configurable. Sempre que s'activi un Desfer/Refer, es "
"mostrarà una notificació amb pocs detalls."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:93
msgid "![Thunar - Undo and Redo][img-thunar-undo-redo]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Desfés i Refés][img-thunar-undo-redo]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:95
msgid "File Highlight"
msgstr "Ressalta el fitxer"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:97
msgid ""
"Files now can be highlighted by setting the background and the filename to "
"different colors. This can be done via an additional tab, located in the "
"'properties' dialog. The view menu provides a checkbox in order to enable/"
"disable the feature. Once enabled, files now can be shown in all the colors "
"of the rainbow."
msgstr ""
"Els fitxers ara es poden ressaltar establint el fons i el nom de fitxer a "
"diferents colors. Això es pot fer a través d'una pestanya addicional, "
"situada en el diàleg «propietats». El menú Visualitza proporciona una "
"casella de selecció per a activar/inhabilitar la característica. Un cop "
"activat, els fitxers ara es poden mostrar en tots els colors de l'arc de "
"Sant Martí."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:99
msgid "![Thunar - File Highlight Options][img-thunar-hightlight1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Opcions de ressaltat de fitxers][img-thunar-hightlight1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:101
msgid "![Thunar - Highlighted files in List View][img-thunar-hightlight2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Fitxers ressaltats a la vista de llista][img-thunar-hightlight2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:103
msgid "![Thunar - Highlighted files in Icon View][img-thunar-hightlight3]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Fitxers ressaltats a la vista d'icones][img-thunar-hightlight3]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:105
msgid ""
"For more information on file highlight, check the [related blog post]"
"(https://elessar-space.blogspot.com/2022/08/gsoc22-file-highlighting-in-"
"thunar.html)."
msgstr ""
"Per a més informació sobre el ressaltat d'arxius, consulteu l'entrada "
"[relacionada amb el blog](https://elessar-space.blogspot.com/2022/08/gsoc22-"
"file-highlighting-in-thunar.html)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:107 content/about/tour420.md:90
msgid "Toolbar"
msgstr "Barra d'eines"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:109
msgid ""
"It is now possible to customize the toolbar according to your personal "
"needs! An additional dialog has been added for that purpose, on which the "
"visibility and position of specific items can be managed. As well custom "
"actions, which appear for folders can be used in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Ara és possible personalitzar la barra d'eines d'acord amb les vostres "
"necessitats personals! S'ha afegit un diàleg addicional per a aquest "
"propòsit, sobre el qual es pot gestionar la visibilitat i la posició "
"d'elements específics. A més, les accions personalitzades, que apareixen per "
"a carpetes, es poden utilitzar a la barra d'eines."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:111
msgid ""
"When the menubar is hidden, an additional toolbar button which can be used "
"to show the menu will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Quan la barra de menús estigui oculta, es mostrarà un botó addicional de la "
"barra d'eines que es pot utilitzar per a mostrar el menú."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:113
msgid "![Thunar - Toolbar with all configurable Elements][img-thunar-toolbar1]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Barra d'eines amb tots els elements configurables][img-thunar-"
"toolbar1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:115
msgid "![Thunar - Toolbar Configuration Dialog][img-thunar-toolbar2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Diàleg de configuració de la barra d'eines][img-thunar-toolbar2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:117
msgid "![Thunar - Show Menubar button][img-thunar-toolbar3]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Mostra el botó de la barra de menús][img-thunar-toolbar3]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:119
msgid ""
"For more information on the configurable toolbar, check the [related blog "
"post](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog10.html)."
msgstr ""
"Per a més informació sobre la barra d'eines configurable, consulteu "
"l'entrada [relacionada amb el blog](http://users.uoa.gr/sdi1800073/sources/"
"xfceblog10.html)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:121 content/about/tour420.md:177
msgid "Split View"
msgstr "Vista dividida"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:123
msgid ""
"Thunar now provides the option to use split panes. The pane separator can be "
"moved, and its position will be stored. Via a xfconf setting, it is as well "
"possible to have a vertical split."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:125
msgid "![Thunar - Split Panes][img-thunar-splitpanes]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Panells dividits][img-thunar-splitpanes]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:127 content/about/tour420.md:115
msgid "Statusbar"
msgstr "Barra d'estat"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:129
msgid ""
"The status bar style was tweaked and '|' is now used to separate entries. "
"Furthermore, it is now possible to customize it by using the context menu."
msgstr ""
"L'estil de la barra d'estat es va modificar i ara s'utilitza '.' per separar "
"entrades. A més, ara és possible personalitzar-lo utilitzant el menú "
"contextual."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:131
msgid "![Thunar - Statusbar Customization][img-thunar-statusbar]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Personalització de la barra d'estat][img-thunar-statusbar]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:133
msgid "Recursive Search"
msgstr "Cerca recursiva"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:135
msgid ""
"Thunar has now the possibility to search recursively, directly inside Thunar "
"itself. The search is done in a separate thread and search results are added "
"rapidly into a List View. A new row 'Location' shows where the search "
"results are located, and the context menu provides the option 'Open Item "
"Location' in order to travel there quickly. The preferences dialog provides "
"an option to limit recursive search to local folders, or to disable it."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:137
msgid "![Thunar - Recursive Search][img-thunar-search1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Cerca recursiva][img-thunar-search1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:139
msgid "![Thunar - Recursive Search Preferences][img-thunar-search2]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Preferències de cerca recursives][img-thunar-search2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:141
msgid ""
"For more information on the recursive search feature, check the [related "
"blog post](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog04.html)."
msgstr ""
"Per a més informació sobre la funció de cerca recursiva, consulteu l'entrada "
"[relacionada amb el blog](http://users.uoa.gr/sdi1800073/sources/"
"xfceblog04.html)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:143
msgid "Recently used Files"
msgstr "Fitxers usats recentment"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:145
msgid ""
"Recently used files now can be accessed in the side pane. Like for the "
"'Recursive Search' feature, the new 'Location' row can be used in List View. "
"Additionally, for 'Recent' a new row 'Recency' can be added to sort the "
"files by their latest usage."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:147
msgid "![Thunar - Recently Used Files][img-thunar-recent]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Fitxers utilitzats recentment][img-thunar-recent]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:149
msgid ""
"For more information on 'Recent' in Thunar check the [related blog post]"
"(http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog02.html)."
msgstr ""
"Per a més informació sobre 'Recent' a Thunar, consulteu la publicació del "
"blog [relacionada](http://users.uoa.gr/sdi1800073/sources/xfceblog02.html)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:151
msgid "Bookmark Menu"
msgstr "Menú d'adreces d'interès"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:153
msgid ""
"In order to keep the 'Go' menu compact, bookmarks have been moved into a "
"separate, new 'Bookmarks' menu. The menu item 'add Bookmark' was rather "
"hidden in the 'send to' menu in Thunar 4.18. As part of the new 'Bookmarks' "
"menu, it is more prominent now."
msgstr ""
"Per tal de mantenir el menú «Ves» compacte, els punts s'han mogut a un menú "
"nou i separat «Adreces d'interès». L'element de menú 'afegeix una adreça "
"d'interès' estava més aviat amagat en el menú 'envia a' en Thunar 4.18. Com "
"a part del nou menú \"Bookmarks\", ara és més prominent."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:155
msgid "![Thunar - Bookmarks Menu][img-thunar-bookmarks]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Menú d'adreces d'interès][img-thunar-bookmarks]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:157
msgid "Trash directory"
msgstr "Directori de paperera"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:159
msgid ""
"With the new release, the trash directory provides an info bar which gives "
"easy access to `Empty Trash` and 'Restore' functionality. When using List "
"View, a 'Date Deleted' column will be shown, so that the files can be sorted "
"by deletion date. Via context menu, it is now possible to select 'Restore "
"and Show' in order to automatically open a new tab in the folder of the "
"restored file(s)."
msgstr ""
"Amb el nou llançament, el directori de la paperera proporciona una barra "
"d'informació que dona fàcil accés a la funcionalitat  andEmpty Trash. i "
"'Restaura'. Quan s'utilitza la vista de llista, es mostrarà una columna "
"«Data suprimida», de manera que els fitxers es puguin ordenar per data "
"d'eliminació. A través del menú contextual, ara és possible seleccionar "
"'Restaura i mostra' per tal d'obrir automàticament una pestanya nova a la "
"carpeta del/s fitxer/s restaurat/s."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:161
msgid "![Thunar - Trash Infobar and Date Deleted Column][img-thunar-trash]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Barra d'informació de la paperera i Columna suprimida][img-thunar-"
"trash]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:165
msgid ""
"The management to set/unset default applications for specific mime types was "
"improved. The context menu got a dedicated item 'Set Default Application' "
"which will open the 'ApplicationChooserDialog' with 'use as default' "
"preselected. The dialog now has a section 'Default Application' in order to "
"make clear which default application currently is set. If you want to remove "
"applications from the list, right click it and select 'forget association'."
msgstr ""
"S'ha millorat la gestió per establir/desestablir aplicacions predeterminades "
"per a tipus MIME específics. El menú contextual té un element dedicat "
"'Configura l'aplicació predeterminada' que obrirà el "
"'ApplicationChooserDialog' amb 'usa com a predeterminat' preseleccionat. El "
"diàleg ara té una secció 'Aplicació predeterminada' per tal de deixar clar "
"quina aplicació predeterminada s'ha establert actualment. Si voleu eliminar "
"les aplicacions de la llista, feu-hi clic amb el botó dret i seleccioneu "
"«Oblida l'associació»."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:167
msgid ""
"![Thunar - Context Menu Entry to set Default Application][img-thunar-default-"
"application1]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Entrada del menú contextual per a establir l'aplicació "
"predeterminada][img-thunar-default-application1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:169
msgid ""
"![Thunar - Revamped Application Chooser Dialog][img-thunar-default-"
"application2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Diàleg de selecció d'aplicacions renovat][img-thunar-default-"
"application2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:171 content/about/tour420.md:147
msgid "Custom Actions"
msgstr "Accions personalitzades"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:173
msgid ""
"It is now possible to arrange custom actions in cascading submenus. Just "
"enter the same submenu name for a custom action in order to place it into "
"the same menu. If you require multiple menu levels, you can achieve that by "
"using '/' in the path of the 'Submenu' entry."
msgstr ""
"Ara és possible organitzar accions personalitzades en submenús en cascada. "
"Només cal introduir el mateix nom de submenú per a una acció personalitzada "
"per tal de col·locar-la al mateix menú. Si necessiteu diversos nivells de "
"menú, podeu aconseguir-ho utilitzant '/' en el camí de l'entrada 'Submenu'."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:175
msgid "![Thunar - Custom Action Submenu][img-thunar-uca-submenu1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Submenú d'acció personalitzada][img-thunar-uca-submenu1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:177
msgid "![Thunar - Custom Action Configuration Dialog][img-thunar-uca-submenu2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Diàleg de configuració d'accions personalitzades][img-thunar-uca-"
"submenu2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:179 content/about/tour420.md:227
#: content/about/tour420.md:355
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Preferències"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:181
msgid ""
"The thumbnail settings in the preferences dialog got grouped together, and "
"meanwhile it is possible to limit the file size for which thumbnails should "
"be generated. That should mitigate possible performance issues by preventing "
"thumbnail generation for huge video files."
msgstr ""
"La configuració de les miniatures del diàleg de preferències s'ha agrupat, i "
"mentrestant és possible limitar la mida del fitxer per al qual s'han de "
"generar les miniatures. Això hauria de mitigar els possibles problemes de "
"rendiment evitant la generació de miniatures per a fitxers de vídeo enormes."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:183
msgid "![Thunar - Thumbnail Preferences][img-thunar-preferences1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Preferències de miniatures][img-thunar-preferences1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:185
msgid ""
"File transfer operations optionally can use *.partial~ as an intermediate "
"file now. After a transfer operation, there is now the option to verify the "
"file checksums in order to make sure that no single bit got corrupted. Note "
"that the checksum feature will require some extra time during copy when "
"activated."
msgstr ""
"Les operacions de transferència de fitxers opcionalment ara poden utilitzar "
"*.partial com a fitxer intermedi. Després d'una operació de transferència, "
"ara hi ha l'opció de verificar les sumes de verificació dels fitxers per tal "
"d'assegurar-se que cap bit es va corrompre. Tingueu en compte que la funció "
"de suma de verificació requerirà un temps extra durant la còpia quan estigui "
"activada."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:187
msgid "![Thunar - File Transfer Preferences][img-thunar-preferences2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Preferències de transferència de fitxers][img-thunar-preferences2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:189
msgid ""
"For more information on the new file transfer options, check the [related "
"blog post](https://dev.ikx.kr/GSOC-5th/)."
msgstr ""
"Per a més informació sobre les noves opcions de transferència de fitxers, "
"consulteu l'entrada [relacionada amb el blog](https://dev.ikx.kr/GSOC-5th/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:191
msgid ""
"A checkbox was added in order to allow running shell scripts. In Thunar 4.18 "
"it only was possible to change that behavior by changing a hidden setting. "
"Use that option with caution!"
msgstr ""
"S'ha afegit una casella de selecció per a permetre executar scripts "
"d'intèrpret d'ordres. En Thunar 4.18 només era possible canviar aquest "
"comportament canviant una configuració oculta. Utilitzeu aquesta opció amb "
"precaució!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:193
msgid "![Thunar - Script Execution Preferences][img-thunar-preferences3]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Preferències d'execució de scripts][img-thunar-preferences3]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:195
msgid ""
"There is now the possibility to restore tabs on startup, and to show the "
"full directory path in the tab title."
msgstr ""
"Ara hi ha la possibilitat de restaurar pestanyes en iniciar, i mostrar el "
"camí complet del directori en el títol de la pestanya."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:197
msgid "![Thunar - Tab and Window Preferences][img-thunar-preferences4]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Preferències de la pestanya i la finestra][img-thunar-"
"preferences4]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:201
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuració"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:203
msgid ""
"Application Finder got support for the 'PrefersNonDefaultGPU' property, "
"which is useful for systems with hybrid graphic cards."
msgstr ""
"Application Finder va obtenir suport per a la propietat "
"'PrefersNonDefaultGPU', que és útil per a sistemes amb targetes gràfiques "
"híbrides."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:205
msgid "Environment variables are now parsed when passed in collapsed mode."
msgstr ""
"Les variables d'entorn ara s'analitzen quan es passen en mode col·lapsat."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:207
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Aparença"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:209
msgid "An option to hide the window decorations was added."
msgstr "S'ha afegit una opció per ocultar les decoracions de les finestres."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:211
msgid "![xfce4-appfinder without window decorations][img-appfinder]"
msgstr "![xfce4-appfinder sense decoracions de finestres][img-appfinder]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:215
msgid "Workspaces"
msgstr "Espais de treball"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:217
msgid "Workspace setting will now work as well with other window managers."
msgstr ""
"La configuració de l'espai de treball ara també funcionarà amb altres "
"gestors de finestres."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:219
msgid "Compositor"
msgstr "Compositor"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:221
msgid "The compositor now supports adaptive vsync with GLX."
msgstr "El compositor ara suporta vsync adaptatiu amb GLX."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour418.md:223 content/about/tour420.md:12
#: content/about/tour420.md:205
msgid "General"
msgstr "General"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:225 content/about/tour420.md:44
msgid "Scaling"
msgstr "Escalat"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:227
msgid ""
"Improved support for UI scaling and fix for many blurry icons in the core "
"components when scaling is used. This will be particularly useful for Hi DPI "
"screens."
msgstr ""
"S'ha millorat el suport per a l'escalat de la interfície d'usuari i s'han "
"solucionat moltes icones difuminades en els components del nucli quan "
"s'utilitza l'escalat. Això serà particularment útil per a pantalles DPI "
"d'alta qualitat."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:229
msgid "Window Header Bars"
msgstr "Barres de capçalera de la finestra"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:231
msgid ""
"All header bars of Xfce Windows/Dialogs by default will be drawn by the "
"window manager now (Xfwm4). Some dialogs optionally support 'GtkHeaderBar' "
"(CSD) which can be enabled via a xfconf setting."
msgstr ""
"Totes les barres de capçalera de l'Xfce Windows/Dialogs per defecte seran "
"dibuixades pel gestor de finestres ara (Xfwm4). Alguns diàlegs admeten "
"opcionalment «GtkHeaderBar» (CSD) que es pot habilitar a través d'un "
"paràmetre xfconf."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:233
msgid ""
"![xfce-appearance-settings - Preference to enable GtkHeaderBar][img-general-"
"gtkheaderbar]"
msgstr ""
"![Xfce-appearance-settings - Preferència per habilitar GtkHeaderBar][img-"
"general-gtkheaderbar]"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour420.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.20 tour"
msgstr "Tour Xfce 4.20"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:8
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.20. It only "
"covers improvements made on the (user-visible) surface."
msgstr ""
"Aquest recorregut us introduirà les noves característiques principals de "
"l'Xfce 4.20. Només cobreix les millores realitzades en la superfície "
"(visible per l'usuari)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:10
msgid ""
"Check the full [Xfce 4.20 changelog](/download/changelogs/4.20/) for a "
"detailed list of changes."
msgstr ""
"Comproveu el registre complet de canvis [Xfce 4.20](/download/changelogs/"
"4.20/) per a una llista detallada de canvis."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:14
msgid "Wayland"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:16
msgid ""
"**Important Notice:** Please be aware that the Wayland support in Xfce 4.20 "
"is experimental. It is recommended for advanced users only, as you may "
"encounter bugs and experience incomplete functionality. Proceed with caution!"
msgstr ""
"<b>Important Notice:</b> Si us plau, tingueu en compte que el suport Wayland "
"a Xfce 4.20 és experimental. Es recomana només per a usuaris avançats, ja "
"que podeu trobar errors i experimentar una funcionalitat incompleta. "
"Procedeix amb precaució!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:18
msgid ""
"Thanks to [Brian](https://gitlab.xfce.org/kelnos) and [Gaël](https://"
"gitlab.xfce.org/Tamaranch) almost all Xfce components are able to run on "
"Wayland windowing, while still keeping support for X11 windowing."
msgstr ""
"Gràcies a [Brian](https://gitlab.xfce.org/kelnos) i [Ga.l](https://"
"gitlab.xfce.org/Tamaranch) gairebé tots els components de l'Xfce són capaços "
"d'executar-se a les finestres Wayland, mentre que encara es manté el suport "
"per a les finestres X11."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:20
msgid ""
"This major effort was achieved by abstracting away any X11/Wayland windowing "
"specific calls and making use of Wayland/Wlroots protocols. A whole new Xfce "
"library, \"libxfce4windowing\" was introduced during that process. XWayland "
"will not be required to run any of the ported Xfce components."
msgstr ""
"Aquest gran esforç es va aconseguir mitjançant l'abstracció de qualsevol "
"crida X11/Wayland de finestres específiques i fent ús dels protocols Wayland/"
"Wlroots. Durant aquest procés es va introduir una nova biblioteca de l'Xfce, "
"\"libxfce4windowing\". XWayland no serà necessari per executar cap dels "
"components de l'Xfce portats."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:22
msgid ""
"So far Xfce does not feature a compositor which supports Wayland. If you "
"want to run Xfce in Wayland, Labwc and Wayfire will give you the best "
"results. A detailed instruction on this can be found [here](https://"
"wiki.xfce.org/releng/wayland_roadmap#testing). Please be aware that Wayland "
"support is still experimental!"
msgstr ""
"Fins ara Xfce no compta amb un compositor que admet Wayland. Si voleu "
"executar Xfce al Wayland, Labwc i Wayfire us donarà els millors resultats. "
"Una instrucció detallada sobre això es pot trobar [aquí](https://"
"wiki.xfce.org/releng/waylandroadmap#testing). Si us plau, tingueu en compte "
"que el suport del Wayland encara és experimental!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:24
msgid ""
"Plans are underway to add Wayland support to Xfwm4 while preserving its "
"existing X11 functionality. However, such a restructurization will be a "
"major effort and we cannot tell yet when/if it will be done, so please don't "
"hold your breath waiting for it."
msgstr ""
"Hi ha plans en marxa per afegir suport Wayland a Xfwm4 mentre es preserva la "
"seva funcionalitat X11 existent. No obstant això, aquesta reestructuració "
"serà un esforç important i encara no podem dir quan/si es farà, així que si "
"us plau no mantenir l'alè esperant-lo."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:26
msgid ""
"For few components and multiple features, it was not possible to port them "
"to Wayland, partly because there are no standardized Wayland protocols "
"available yet to provide the required services:"
msgstr ""
"Per a pocs components i múltiples característiques, no va ser possible "
"portar-los al Wayland, en part perquè no hi ha protocols de Wayland "
"estandarditzats disponibles encara per proporcionar els serveis necessaris:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:28
msgid ""
"Workspace support is missing (ext-workspace protocol [was just merged]"
"(https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wayland/wayland-protocols/-/merge_requests/"
"40))."
msgstr ""
"Manca el suport d'espai de treball (el protocol d'espai de treball següent "
"[acaba de fusionar-se](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wayland/wayland-"
"protocols/-/mergerequests/40))."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:29
msgid ""
"Systray icons will be missing for multiple applications (required to use "
"StatusNotifier instead of GtkStatusIcon)"
msgstr ""
"Falten les icones Systray per a múltiples aplicacions (requerit per "
"utilitzar StatusNotifier en lloc de GtkStatusIcon)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:30
msgid ""
"Xfce4-settings: Keyboard and mouse settings so far are internal to the "
"Wayland compositor and as such the according Xfce dialogs won't be available "
"on Wayland yet."
msgstr ""
"Configuració Xfce4: Els paràmetres del teclat i del ratolí fins ara són "
"interns del compositor Wayland i, com a tal, els diàlegs Xfce segons encara "
"no estaran disponibles al Wayland."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:31
msgid ""
"Power related keyboard handling (brightness keys, suspend, etc.) is internal "
"to the Wayland compositor and as such cannot be supported yet by Xfce "
"components."
msgstr ""
"La gestió de teclat relacionada amb l'energia (tecles de brillantor, "
"suspensió, etc.) és interna del compositor Wayland i com a tal no es pot "
"suportar encara pels components Xfce."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:32
msgid ""
"Wayland does not specify a native protocol for taking screenshots. However, "
"xfce4-screenshooter already supports screenshots via the wlroots "
"'screencopy' protocol (entire screen). Screenshots of a rectangle selection "
"or the active window are not yet supported via Wayland."
msgstr ""
"El Wayland no especifica un protocol natiu per a prendre captures de "
"pantalla. No obstant això, xfce4-screenshooter ja admet captures de pantalla "
"a través del protocol 'screencopy' de wlroots (pantalla sencera). Les "
"captures de pantalla d'una selecció de rectangle o de la finestra activa "
"encara no estan admeses a través del Wayland."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:34
msgid "Some other Xfce components don't run at all on Wayland:"
msgstr ""
"Alguns altres components de l'Xfce no s'executen en absolut al Wayland:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:36
msgid "Xfwm4"
msgstr "Xfwm4"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:37
msgid "Xfdashboard"
msgstr "Xfdashboard"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:38
msgid ""
"Xfce4-screensaver (porting to Wayland [completed but not merged](https://"
"gitlab.xfce.org/apps/xfce4-screensaver/-/merge_requests/28), as it requires "
"the experimental [libwlembed library](https://gitlab.xfce.org/kelnos/"
"libwlembed))"
msgstr ""
"Xfce4-screensaver (portant al Wayland [completat però no fusionat](https://"
"gitlab.xfce.org/apps/xfce4-screensaver/-/mergerequests/28), ja que requereix "
"la biblioteca experimental [libwlembed](https://gitlab.xfce.org/kelnos/"
"libwlembed))"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:39
msgid ""
"Xfce4-windowck-plugin (needs to be [ported to libxfce4windowing](https://"
"gitlab.xfce.org/panel-plugins/xfce4-windowck-plugin/-/issues/37))"
msgstr ""
"Connector Xfce4-windowck (cal [adaptat a libxfce4windowing](https://"
"gitlab.xfce.org/panel-plugins/xfce4-windowck-plugin/-/issues/37))"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:40
msgid ""
"Xfce4-xkb-plugin (keyboard handling is internal to the Wayland compositor)"
msgstr ""
"Connector Xfce4-xkb- (la gestió del teclat és interna del compositor Wayland)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:42
msgid ""
"More detailed info on the current Wayland status can be found on our "
"[Wayland roadmap.](https://wiki.xfce.org/releng/wayland_roadmap)"
msgstr ""
"Podeu trobar informació més detallada sobre l'estat actual del Wayland al "
"nostre [Wayland roadmap.](https://wiki.xfce.org/releng/waylandroadmap)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:46
msgid ""
"Icons and thumbnail scaling was fixed for various components. Various "
"missing icons for larger scales were added. Any blurriness when using Xfce "
"components on a HiDPI display should be gone now."
msgstr ""
"Es van fixar les icones i l'escalat de miniatures per a diversos components. "
"Es van afegir diverses icones que faltaven per a escales més grans. "
"Qualsevol difuminat quan s'utilitzin components Xfce en una pantalla HiDPI "
"hauria d'haver desaparegut ara."

#: content/about/tour420.md:48
#, fuzzy
msgid "[exo](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/exo/start)"
msgstr "[Baixada](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.8pre3/)"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:50
msgid "Icon View Performance"
msgstr "Rendiment de la vista d'icones"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:52
msgid ""
"By using different container types, the \"Exo-Icon-View\" now can handle "
"100,000 files and more without freezing."
msgstr ""
"Mitjançant l'ús de diferents tipus de contenidors, l'\"Exo-Icon-View\" ara "
"pot gestionar 100.000 arxius i més sense congelar."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:54
msgid "Type ahead search box"
msgstr "Escriviu el quadre de cerca endavant"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:56
msgid ""
"The type ahead search box in the exo icon view now always stays inside the "
"according view widget."
msgstr ""
"El quadre de cerca de tipus anterior a la vista d'icones de l'exo ara sempre "
"es manté dins del giny de vista d'acord."

#: content/about/tour420.md:58
msgid "[libxfce4ui](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/libxfce4ui/start)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:60
msgid "Shortcut Editor"
msgstr "Editor de dreceres"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:62
msgid ""
"Shortcuts now can be used for multiple actions if they don't conflict with "
"each other."
msgstr ""
"Les dreceres ara es poden utilitzar per a múltiples accions si no entren en "
"conflicte entre si."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:64
msgid "About Dialog"
msgstr "Quant al diàleg"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:66
msgid ""
"The dialog now shows the distribution logo, information about the used "
"windowing system and the used GPU."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg ara mostra el logotip de la distribució, informació sobre el "
"sistema de finestres utilitzat i la GPU utilitzada."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:68
msgid "![libxfce4ui - about dialog][img-libxfce4ui_about]"
msgstr "![libxfce4ui - quant al diàleg][img-libxfce4ui_about]"

#: content/about/tour420.md:70
msgid "[libxfce4windowing](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/libxfce4windowing/start)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:72
msgid ""
"This library is new to Xfce. Libxfce4windowing is an abstraction library "
"that attempts to present windowing concepts (screens, top level windows, "
"workspaces, etc.) in a windowing-system-independent manner."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta biblioteca és nova per a Xfce. Libxfce4windowing és una biblioteca "
"d'abstracció que intenta presentar conceptes de finestra (pantalles, "
"finestres de nivell superior, espais de treball, etc.) de manera independent "
"del sistema de finestres."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:74
msgid ""
"Currently, X11 is fully supported via libwnck. Wayland is partially "
"supported by using various Wayland protocol extensions. However, the full "
"range of operations available on X11 is not available on Wayland, due to "
"missing features in these protocols extensions."
msgstr ""
"Actualment, X11 està totalment suportat a través de libwnck. El Wayland és "
"parcialment compatible amb l'ús de diverses extensions de protocol Wayland. "
"No obstant això, el rang complet d'operacions disponibles en X11 no està "
"disponible en el Wayland, a causa de les característiques que manquen en "
"aquestes extensions de protocols."

#: content/about/tour420.md:76
#, fuzzy
msgid "[thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/start)"
msgstr "[Lloc web de Thunar](https://xfce.org/projects/thunar)"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:78
msgid "Mounted and Remote Locations"
msgstr "Ubicacions muntades i remotes"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:80
msgid "Mount points now show an emblem and have a specific type description."
msgstr ""
"Els punts de muntatge ara mostren un emblema i tenen una descripció de tipus "
"específica."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:82
msgid "Ipv6 remote URLs are now supported."
msgstr "Els URL remots Ipv6 ara estan admesos."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:84
msgid ""
"It is now possible to create symbolic links as well on remote locations."
msgstr "Ara és possible crear enllaços simbòlics també en llocs remots."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:86
msgid "Search"
msgstr "Cerca"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:88
msgid ""
"It is not required any more to wait until a search is finished to open the "
"context menu on search results."
msgstr ""
"Ja no cal esperar fins que acabi una cerca per obrir el menú contextual "
"sobre els resultats de la cerca."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:92
msgid "A couple of new toolbar buttons were added:"
msgstr "S'han afegit un parell de botons nous de la barra d'eines:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:94
msgid "View Switcher - A drop-down button to select a view."
msgstr "Commutador de vista - Un botó desplegable per a seleccionar una vista."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:95
msgid ""
"Menu - This hamburger button will show automatically in the toolbar, when "
"the menubar is hidden. It will reveal a vertical menu, bar, when pressed."
msgstr ""
"Menú - Aquest botó d'hamburguesa es mostrarà automàticament a la barra "
"d'eines, quan la barra de menús estigui oculta. Mostrarà un menú vertical, "
"barra, quan es prem."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:96
msgid "New Tab - Open a new tab using the current directory."
msgstr "Pestanya nova - Obre una pestanya nova utilitzant el directori actual."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:97
msgid "New Window - Open a new window using the current directory."
msgstr "Finestra nova - Obre una finestra nova utilitzant el directori actual."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:99
msgid "![thunar - new toolbar buttons][img-thunar_toolbar_new_items]"
msgstr ""
"![thunar - botons nous de la barra d'eines][img-thunar_toolbar_new_items]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:101
msgid ""
"![thunar - improved hamburger toolbar button][img-thunar_toolbar_hamburger]"
msgstr ""
"![thunar - botó millorat de la barra d'eines d'hamburgueses][img-"
"thunar_toolbar_hamburger]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:103
msgid ""
"On shrinking the Thunar window, toolbar items will now be moved to an "
"overflow menu. Like that, it is possible to maintain smaller thunar windows."
msgstr ""
"En reduir la finestra Thunar, els elements de la barra d'eines ara es mouran "
"a un menú de desbordament. D'aquesta manera, és possible mantenir les "
"finestres lunars més petites."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:105
msgid ""
"Furthermore, a bug was fixed which prevented the usage of submenu custom "
"actions in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"A més, es va corregir un error que va impedir l'ús d'accions personalitzades "
"de submenú a la barra d'eines."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:107
msgid "Window Decorations"
msgstr "Decoracions de les finestres"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:109
msgid "There is now an option to use client side decorations in Thunar (CSD)."
msgstr ""
"Ara hi ha una opció per utilitzar decoracions laterals del client a Thunar "
"(CSD)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:111
msgid "![thunar - CSD with menu][img-thunar_csd_with_menu]"
msgstr "![thunar - CSD amb menú][img-thunar_csd_with_menu]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:113
msgid "![thunar - CSD without menu][img-thunar_csd_without_menu]"
msgstr "![thunar - CSD sense menú][img-thunar_csd_without_menu]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:117
msgid ""
"An option to show the number of hidden files in the statusbar was added."
msgstr ""
"S'ha afegit una opció per a mostrar el nombre de fitxers ocults a la barra "
"d'estat."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:119
msgid "Recently Used Files"
msgstr "Fitxers usats recentment"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:121
msgid ""
"Only files which were successfully opened are now added to the list of "
"recently used files."
msgstr ""
"Només els fitxers que s'han obert correctament s'afegeixen a la llista de "
"fitxers usats recentment."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:123
msgid "Directories won't be added to the recently used files anymore."
msgstr "Els directoris ja no s'afegiran als fitxers utilitzats recentment."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:125
msgid "Symbolic Icons"
msgstr "Icones simbòliques"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:127
msgid ""
"There is now an option to use symbolic icons in the side pane and colored "
"icons in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Ara hi ha una opció per a utilitzar icones simbòliques a la subfinestra "
"lateral i icones de color a la barra d'eines."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:129
msgid "![thunar - symbolic icons][img-thunar_symbolic_icons]"
msgstr "![thunar - icones simbòliques][img-thunar_symbolic_icons]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:131
msgid "![thunar - colored icons][img-thunar_colored_icons]"
msgstr "![thunar - icones de color][img-thunar_colored_icons]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:133
msgid "Drag and Drop"
msgstr "Arrossega i deixa anar"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:135
msgid "While dragging files, folders are now opened automatically on hover."
msgstr ""
"Mentre arrossegueu fitxers, les carpetes s'obren automàticament en passar-hi "
"per sobre."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:137
msgid ""
"While dragging files, the focus of the split view pane is now updated when "
"hovered."
msgstr ""
"Mentre arrossegueu fitxers, el focus de la subfinestra de vista dividida "
"s'actualitza quan es passa per sobre."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:139
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "Rendiment"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:141
msgid ""
"In the past, you might have faced situation involving bigger numbers of "
"files in which thunar showed a freeze. Due to various different performance "
"measures, thunar now is much more bullet-proof for action involving huge "
"numbers of files."
msgstr ""
"En el passat, és possible que us hagueu enfrontat a una situació que implica "
"un nombre més gran d'arxius en els quals thunar va mostrar una congelació. A "
"causa de diverses mesures de rendiment diferents, thunar ara és molt més a "
"prova de bales per a l'acció que implica un gran nombre d'arxius."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:143
msgid ""
"This was achieved by using appropriate container types, moving some actions "
"into separate jobs and throttling of view-updates."
msgstr ""
"Això es va aconseguir mitjançant l'ús de tipus de contenidors apropiats, "
"movent algunes accions en treballs separats i l'augment de les "
"actualitzacions."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:145
msgid ""
"A [number of integration test cases](https://wiki.xfce.org/thunar/dev/"
"integration_testcases) will be used in order to keep performance on the "
"current level in the future."
msgstr ""
"S'utilitzarà un [nombre de casos de prova d'integració](https://"
"wiki.xfce.org/thunar/dev/integration_testcases) per tal de mantenir el "
"rendiment al nivell actual en el futur."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:149
msgid ""
"Shortcuts for custom action will now as well work when the custom action is "
"located in a sub-menu."
msgstr ""
"Les dreceres per a l'acció personalitzada ara també funcionaran quan l'acció "
"personalitzada estigui situada en un submenú."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:151
msgid "File Transfer"
msgstr "Transferència de fitxers"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:153
msgid ""
"For file validation in thunar 4.18.x a md5 checksum was calculated for "
"source and target file. This calculation turned out to be rather slow and "
"actually superfluous. Now files are just compared directly. In addition, the "
"usage of direct I/O operations now attempts to prevent comparison of "
"possibly cached buffers."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:155
msgid ""
"An option was added to only copy files in parallel if the relevant devices "
"are in idle state. This prevents possible fragmentation during copy for HDD "
"drives."
msgstr ""
"S'ha afegit una opció per copiar només fitxers en paral·lel si els "
"dispositius rellevants estan en estat inactiu. Això evita la possible "
"fragmentació durant la còpia per a unitats HDD."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:157
msgid "Transferring files no longer steals the current focus."
msgstr "La transferència de fitxers ja no roba el focus actual."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:159
msgid ""
"The file transfer question dialog now provides the same options while having "
"less buttons. In addition, file thumbnails now are properly requested by the "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg de la pregunta de transferència de fitxers ara proporciona les "
"mateixes opcions mentre hi ha menys botons. A més, les miniatures de fitxer "
"ara són sol·licitades adequadament pel diàleg."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:161
msgid "![thunar - file transfer dialog][img-thunar_transfer_dialog]"
msgstr ""
"![thunar - diàleg de transferència de fitxers][img-thunar_transfer_dialog]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:163
msgid "Launchers"
msgstr "Llançadors"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:165
msgid ""
"By default, launcher names instead of filenames are shown now for trusted "
"launchers."
msgstr ""
"De manera predeterminada, els noms dels llançadors en lloc dels noms de "
"fitxer es mostren ara per als llançadors de confiança."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:167
msgid "Undo/Redo"
msgstr "Desfés"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:169
msgid ""
"The user now will be asked before any deletion will be done by an undo "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Ara es demanarà a l'usuari abans que qualsevol supressió es faci mitjançant "
"una operació de desfer."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:173
msgid ""
"Similar to the tree-view side pane, the main view now also supports folder "
"expansion."
msgstr ""
"Similar a la subfinestra lateral de vista en arbre, la vista principal ara "
"també admet l'expansió de carpetes."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:175
msgid "![thunar - expandable folders][img-thunar_expandable_folders]"
msgstr "![thunar - carpetes expandibles][img-thunar_expandable_folders]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:179
msgid ""
"A shortcut now can be used to toggle between split-view panes, and the "
"focused pane now uses different coloring."
msgstr ""
"Ara es pot utilitzar una drecera per a alternar entre les subfinestres de "
"vista dividida, i la subfinestra focalitzada ara utilitza coloracions "
"diferents."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:181
msgid "![thunar - split view][img-thunar_split_view]"
msgstr "![thunar - vista dividida][img-thunar_split_view]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:183
msgid ""
"A dialog will now ask for confirmation when closing a split-pane with "
"multiple tabs."
msgstr ""
"Un diàleg ara demanarà confirmació en tancar un quadre dividit amb múltiples "
"pestanyes."

#: content/about/tour420.md:185
msgid "[xfce4-appfinder](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-appfinder/start)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:187
msgid ""
"The application list now as well can be navigated via Ctrl+N / Ctrl+P keys "
"(VI default)."
msgstr ""
"La llista d'aplicacions ara també es pot navegar a través de les tecles "
"Ctrl+N / Ctrl+P (per defecte VI)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:189
msgid ""
"An option was added to close the Appfinder window automatically when focus "
"is lost."
msgstr ""
"S'ha afegit una opció per tancar la finestra de l'Appfinder automàticament "
"quan es perd el focus."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:191
msgid ""
"Ctrl+Enter can be used to execute commands immediately when selecting "
"entries from the dropdown."
msgstr ""
"Ctrl+Retorn es pot utilitzar per a executar ordres immediatament en "
"seleccionar entrades del desplegable."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:193
msgid ""
"Within the new version, application specific actions will show on right "
"click."
msgstr ""
"Dins de la nova versió, les accions específiques de l'aplicació es mostraran "
"en el clic dret."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:195
msgid "An option to show generic names of launchers was added."
msgstr "S'ha afegit una opció per mostrar noms genèrics de llançadors."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:197
msgid ""
"Appfinder optionally can now be launched as a daemon, so that it will "
"respond even quicker."
msgstr ""
"De manera opcional, l'Appfinder ara es pot llançar com un dimoni, de manera "
"que respondrà encara més ràpid."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:199
msgid "An option allows now to launch items on a single click."
msgstr "Una opció permet ara llançar elements en un sol clic."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:201
msgid "![xfce4-appfinder - settings][img-appfinder_new]"
msgstr "![xfce4-appfinder - paràmetres][img-appfinder_new]"

#: content/about/tour420.md:203
#, fuzzy
msgid "[xfce4-panel](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/start)"
msgstr "[Baixada](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.8pre3/)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:207
msgid "The border width of the panel is now configurable."
msgstr "L'amplada de la vora del panell ara és configurable."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:209
msgid ""
"For manual installations: the panel now does its best to find plugins in XDG "
"base directories, and better preserves its configuration when it can't find "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Per a instal·lacions manuals: el panell ara fa tot el possible per trobar "
"connectors en directoris base XDG, i millor conserva la seva configuració "
"quan no els pot trobar."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:211
msgid "Clock"
msgstr "Rellotge"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:213
msgid "LCD clock: An option was added to visualize inactive segments."
msgstr "Rellotge LCD: s'ha afegit una opció per visualitzar segments inactius."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:215
msgid "Analog: There is now an optional 24h mode."
msgstr "Analog: Ara hi ha un mode opcional de 24h."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:217
msgid "Digital: Week numbers now are shown optionally."
msgstr "Digital: Els números de setmana ara es mostren opcionalment."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:219
msgid "Show Desktop"
msgstr "Mostra l'escriptori"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:221
msgid ""
"There is now the possibility to show the desktop when hovering the mouse on "
"the \"show desktop\" panel icon."
msgstr ""
"Ara hi ha la possibilitat de mostrar l'escriptori en passar el ratolí per "
"sobre de la icona del panell «Mostra l'escriptori»."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:223
msgid "Tasklist"
msgstr "Llista de tasques"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:225
msgid ""
"Icon size management has been improved overall, notably by switching to "
"libxfce4windowing."
msgstr ""
"La gestió de la mida de les icones s'ha millorat en general, sobretot "
"canviant a libxfce4windowing."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:229
msgid ""
"The 'delete' key can now be used to remove panel objects, and several "
"objects can be removed at once."
msgstr ""
"La tecla «suprimeix» ara es pot utilitzar per a eliminar objectes del "
"panell, i es poden eliminar diversos objectes alhora."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:231
msgid ""
"Panel objects in the panel configuration list now will have the same icons "
"as in the panel itself."
msgstr ""
"Els objectes del panell a la llista de configuració del panell ara tindran "
"les mateixes icones que en el mateix panell."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:233
msgid "![xfce4-panel - panel configuration list][img-panel_item_list]"
msgstr ""
"![xfce4-panel - llista de configuració del panell][img-panel_item_list]"

#: content/about/tour420.md:235
msgid ""
"[xfce4-power-manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-manager/start)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:237
msgid "Screen Locking"
msgstr "Bloqueig de pantalla"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:239
msgid ""
"There is no dedicated \"security\" tab anymore. Lock screen management was "
"massively simplified and \"Light Locker\" was dropped. \"lock-on-sleep\" is "
"now synchronized with xfce4-session and xfce4-screensaver."
msgstr ""
"Ja no hi ha cap pestanya dedicada a la \"seguretat\". La gestió de la "
"pantalla de bloqueig es va simplificar massivament i es va eliminar \"Light "
"Locker\". \"lock-on-sleep\" ara està sincronitzat amb xfce4-session i xfce4-"
"screensaver."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:241
msgid ""
"Screen locking settings are now only handled by xfce4-screensaver to avoid "
"conflicts. A button to open xfce4-screensaver-preferences was added:"
msgstr ""
"La configuració de bloqueig de pantalla ara només es gestiona amb l'estalvi "
"de pantalla xfce4 per evitar conflictes. S'ha afegit un botó per obrir xfce4-"
"screensaver-preferences:"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:243
msgid "![xfce4-power-manager - settings][img-power_manager_settings]"
msgstr "![xfce4-power-manager - configuració][img-power_manager_settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:245
msgid "![xfce4-screensaver - settings][img-power_manager_screensaver]"
msgstr "![xfce4-screensaver - configuració][img-power_manager_screensaver]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:247
msgid "Power Settings"
msgstr "Configuració d'energia"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:249
msgid ""
"Support for handling different power profiles via power-profiles-daemon was "
"added."
msgstr ""
"S'ha afegit el suport per a gestionar diferents perfils d'energia a través "
"de Power-profiles-daemon."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:251
msgid ""
"The overall charge state calculation was wrong for some cases and is now "
"fixed."
msgstr ""
"El càlcul general de l'estat de càrrega era incorrecte per a alguns casos i "
"ara està fixat."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:253
msgid ""
"When the critical power dialog pops up, unintentional user actions are now "
"prevented."
msgstr ""
"Quan apareix el diàleg de potència crítica, ara s'eviten les accions "
"d'usuari no intencionades."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:255
msgid "There is now support for the hybrid sleep mode."
msgstr "Ara hi ha suport per al mode de son híbrid."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:257
msgid "The device details tab now as well shows the energy rate."
msgstr "La pestanya de detalls del dispositiu també mostra la taxa d'energia."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:259
msgid "Others"
msgstr "Altres"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:261
msgid "Several use-cases for lid close were fixed."
msgstr "Es van fixar diversos casos d'ús per al tancament de la tapa."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:263
msgid "There are now the options \"shutdown\" and \"do nothing\" on lid close."
msgstr ""
"Ara hi ha les opcions \"apagar\" i \"no fer res\" al tancament de la tapa."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:265
msgid ""
"Buttons to change the brightness exponentially and keyboard backlight toggle "
"keys now are supported."
msgstr ""
"Els botons per a canviar la brillantor exponencialment i les tecles de "
"retroil·luminació del teclat ara estan admeses."

#: content/about/tour420.md:267
msgid "[xfce4-session](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/start)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:269
msgid ""
"The logout dialog will not provide a checkbox to enable session saving "
"anymore."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg de sortida ja no proporcionarà una casella de selecció per a "
"habilitar el desament de la sessió."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:271
msgid ""
"It is now possible to start a Wayland session via `startxfce4 --wayland`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:273
msgid ""
"Minimal support for xdg-desktop-portal was added by registering for a "
"wallpaper, screenshot and background xapp."
msgstr ""
"S'ha afegit un suport mínim per al xdg-desktop-portal registrant un fons de "
"pantalla, captura de pantalla i xapp de fons."

#: content/about/tour420.md:275
msgid "[xfce4-settings](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/start)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:279
msgid ""
"Icon themes are now loaded in a separate thread, in order to prevent a "
"possible freeze."
msgstr ""
"Els temes d'icones ara es carreguen en un fil separat, per tal d'evitar una "
"possible congelació."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:281
msgid ""
"For icon themes which are known to be incomplete, a warning now will be "
"shown."
msgstr ""
"Per als temes d'icones que se sap que són incomplets, ara es mostrarà un "
"avís."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:283
msgid "The usage of client side decorations is opt-in now, not opt-out."
msgstr "L'ús de decoracions laterals del client és opt-in ara, no opt-out."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:285
msgid ""
"Dark themes now are identified and supported in a more reliable way. "
"(Relevant e.g. for the Qogir and Orchis themes)"
msgstr ""
"Els temes foscos ara s'identifiquen i es recolzen d'una manera més fiable. "
"(P. ex. rellevant per als temes Qogir i Orchis)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:289
msgid ""
"The default display profile has been added to the list of profiles that can "
"match, and will be used if more than one matches now."
msgstr ""
"El perfil de visualització per defecte s'ha afegit a la llista de perfils "
"que poden coincidir, i s'utilitzarà si coincideix més d'un ara."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:291
msgid ""
"Profile management has been extended to all profiles, not just those that "
"match, and their names can now be edited."
msgstr ""
"La gestió de perfils s'ha estès a tots els perfils, no només als que "
"coincideixen, i ara es poden editar els seus noms."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:293
msgid ""
"Scaling now always is done for both dimensions, and the preview shows the "
"resulting size."
msgstr ""
"L'escalat ara sempre es fa per a ambdues dimensions, i la vista prèvia "
"mostra la mida resultant."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:295
msgid ""
"Mirror state management has been improved overall, in particular by removing "
"the need to match refresh rates."
msgstr ""
"En general, s'ha millorat la gestió de l'estat mirall, en particular "
"eliminant la necessitat d'igualar les taxes d'actualització."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:297
msgid ""
"The minimal dialog has been improved, in particular by allowing the display "
"to be extended to the left and from top to bottom, and with compact profile "
"display."
msgstr ""
"S'ha millorat el diàleg mínim, en particular permetent que la pantalla "
"s'estengui cap a l'esquerra i de dalt a baix, i amb una pantalla de perfil "
"compacta."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:299
msgid "![xfce4-settings - minimal display][img-settings_display]"
msgstr "![xfce4-settings - visualització mínima][img-settings_display]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:301
msgid "Mouse Settings"
msgstr "Configuració del ratolí"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:303
msgid ""
"A checkbox was added to toggle between adaptive and flat mouse accel profile."
msgstr ""
"S'ha afegit una casella de selecció per commutar entre el perfil "
"d'acceleració del ratolí adaptatiu i pla."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:305
msgid ""
"High resolution scrolling can now be enabled for mice which do support it."
msgstr ""
"El desplaçament d'alta resolució ara es pot habilitar per als ratolins que "
"el suporten."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:307
msgid "![xfce4-settings - mouse][img-settings_mouse]"
msgstr "![xfce4-settings - ratolí][img-settings_mouse]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:309
msgid "Mime Settings"
msgstr "Paràmetres del Mime"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:311
msgid "It is now possible to select/change multiple items at once."
msgstr "Ara és possible seleccionar/canviar diversos elements alhora."

#: content/about/tour420.md:313
#, fuzzy
msgid "[xfconf](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfconf/start)"
msgstr "[Baixada](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.6.2/)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:315
msgid ""
"A systemd user unit, corresponding to the D-Bus session service, is now "
"added."
msgstr ""
"Ara s'afegeix una unitat d'usuari del systemd, corresponent al servei de "
"sessió D-Bus."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:317
msgid ""
"Whitespaces are now properly escaped when writing a xfconf channel to disk."
msgstr ""
"Els espais en blanc ara s'escapen adequadament quan s'escriu un canal xfconf "
"al disc."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:319
msgid "Xfconf-query now displays array contents."
msgstr "Xfconf-query ara mostra el contingut de la matriu."

#: content/about/tour420.md:321
msgid "[xfdesktop](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfdesktop/start)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:323
msgid "Background Management"
msgstr "Gestió de fons"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:325
msgid ""
"For random wallpaper cycling, wallpapers now are only repeated after all "
"other wallpapers were shown."
msgstr ""
"Per al ciclisme aleatori de fons de pantalla, els fons de pantalla ara només "
"es repeteixen després que es mostrin tots els altres fons de pantalla."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:327
msgid ""
"Old Xfce backgrounds were ported from .png to .svg to be usable for large "
"screens."
msgstr ""
"Els fons Xfce antics es van portar de .png a .svg per a ser usables per a "
"pantalles grans."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:329
msgid "Gradients will now be rendered in a gamma-correct way."
msgstr "Els degradats ara es renderitzaran de manera gamma-correcta."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:331
msgid "Icon grid"
msgstr "Quadrícula d'icones"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:333
msgid "The confirmation dialog for arranging desktop icons now is optional."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg de confirmació per a organitzar les icones d'escriptori ara és "
"opcional."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:335
msgid ""
"It is now possible to set custom colors for icon labels and icon background."
msgstr ""
"Ara és possible establir colors personalitzats per a les etiquetes d'icones "
"i el fons d'icones."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:337
msgid "The icon grid on each monitor is now independent of one another."
msgstr ""
"La quadrícula d'icones de cada monitor és ara independent l'un de l'altre."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:339
msgid "Minimized Application Icons"
msgstr "Icones d'aplicacions minimitzades"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:341
msgid ""
"Window icons are now initially shown on the monitor where the window was "
"present before being minimized."
msgstr ""
"Les icones de finestra es mostren inicialment al monitor on hi havia la "
"finestra abans de ser minimitzada."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:343
msgid ""
"The context menu (when clicking on an empty space) now has more useful "
"options than before."
msgstr ""
"El menú contextual (en fer clic sobre un espai buit) ara té més opcions "
"útils que abans."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:345
msgid "File Icons"
msgstr "Icones de fitxer"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:347
msgid "There is now an option to sort folders before files."
msgstr "Ara hi ha una opció per ordenar carpetes abans que fitxers."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:349
msgid ""
"The positions of the icons are now saved in a way that should avoid icons "
"moving around in unexpected ways when monitors are added and removed."
msgstr ""
"Les posicions de les icones ara es desen d'una manera que hauria d'evitar "
"que les icones es moguin de manera inesperada quan s'afegeixen i s'eliminen "
"els monitors."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:351
msgid ""
"New files and dropped files now will be placed near the current cursor "
"location."
msgstr ""
"Els fitxers nous i els fitxers deixats anar ara es col·locaran a prop de la "
"ubicació actual del cursor."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:353
msgid "Icons of fixed disks and drives can now be optionally shown."
msgstr ""
"Les icones dels discs i unitats fixes ara es poden mostrar opcionalment."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:357
msgid "The 'Desktop Icons' tab was fully reworked."
msgstr "La pestanya «Icones de l'escriptori» s'ha redissenyat completament."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:359
msgid "![xfdesktop - settings - desktop icons][img-xfdesktop_settings_icons]"
msgstr ""
"![xfdesktop - configuració - icones d'escriptori][img-"
"xfdesktop_settings_icons]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:361
msgid ""
"All shortcuts of Xfdesktop now can be configured, using the "
"XfceShortcutsManagers widget."
msgstr ""
"Totes les dreceres de l'Xfdesktop ara es poden configurar, utilitzant el "
"giny XfceShortcutsManagers."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:363
msgid ""
"![xfdesktop - settings - keyboard shortcuts][img-"
"xfdesktop_settings_shortcuts]"
msgstr ""
"![xfdesktop - configuració - dreceres de teclat][img-"
"xfdesktop_settings_shortcuts]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:365
msgid ""
"More folders that hold background images were added as shortcuts in the "
"settings dialog."
msgstr ""
"S'han afegit més carpetes que contenen imatges de fons com a dreceres al "
"diàleg de configuració."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:367
msgid ""
"The settings dialog will update if the background is changed from outside "
"the dialog."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg de configuració s'actualitzarà si el fons es canvia des de fora "
"del diàleg."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:369
msgid ""
"Wallpaper image folders now are loaded fully asynchronously to prevent lag."
msgstr ""
"Les carpetes d'imatges de fons de pantalla ara es carreguen de forma "
"totalment asíncrona per evitar el retard."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:371
msgid "Context Menu"
msgstr "Menú contextual"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:373
msgid "Cascading custom actions will now as well shown correctly in Xfdesktop."
msgstr ""
"Les accions personalitzades en cascada ara també es mostraran correctament a "
"Xfdesktop."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:375
msgid "It is now possible to open multiple selected folders at once."
msgstr "Ara és possible obrir diverses carpetes seleccionades alhora."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:377
msgid ""
"The context menu now opens on button press rather than button release, as "
"most users will expect."
msgstr ""
"El menú contextual ara s'obre en prémer el botó en lloc de prémer el botó, "
"com la majoria d'usuaris esperaran."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:379
msgid "The middle-click window list menu has new styling and added features."
msgstr ""
"El menú de llista de finestres amb clic del mig té un estil nou i funcions "
"afegides."

#: content/about/tour420.md:381
#, fuzzy
msgid "[xfwm4](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/start)"
msgstr "[Baixada](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.6.2/)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:383
msgid "Support for stretch theme variants"
msgstr "Suport per a les variants del tema d'estirament"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:385
msgid "Compositor: Block softpipe for GLX vsync"
msgstr "Compositor: bloca softpipe per a GLX vsync"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:387
msgid "Focus: Include skip taskbar/pager when passing focus"
msgstr ""
"Focus: inclou l'omissió de la barra de tasques o el paginador en passar el "
"focus"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:389
msgid ""
"Fix crash when alt-tabbing ([#762](https://gitlab.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/-/"
"issues/762))"
msgstr ""
"Corregeix una fallada quan es punxa alt ([)762](https://gitlab.xfce.org/xfce/"
"xfwm4/-/issues/762))"

#: content/about/tour420.md:391
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p align=\"right\"><small>Used theme: \"Greybird-dark\". Used icon-theme: "
"\"elementary Xfce dark\".</small></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"right\"><small>Tema usat: «Greybird-dark». Icona-tema utilitzat: "
"«elementary Xfce dark».</small></p>"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour44.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.4 tour"
msgstr "Recorregut de l'Xfce 4.4"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:7
msgid ""
"As of today, the long awaited version 4.4.0 of the Xfce Desktop Environment "
"is finally available. I will try to highlight some of the new features which "
"have been added since the last stable release."
msgstr ""
"A dia d'avui, la tan esperada versió 4.4.0 de l'entorn d'escriptori Xfce "
"finalment està disponible. Intentaré destacar algunes de les noves "
"característiques que s'han afegit des de l'última versió estable."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:9
msgid "Desktop Icons"
msgstr "Icones de l'escriptori"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:11
msgid ""
"One of the most often requested features during the 4.0 and 4.2 was support "
"for icons on the desktop. Now, with Xfce 4.4.0, this feature was finally "
"added to the desktop manager **Xfdesktop**."
msgstr ""
"Una de les característiques més sol·licitades durant les versions 4.0 i 4.2 "
"va ser el suport per a les icones a l'escriptori. Ara, amb Xfce 4.4.0, "
"aquesta característica es va afegir finalment al gestor d'escriptori "
"<b>Xfdesktop</b>."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:13
msgid "![Desktop Icons][img-desktop-icons]"
msgstr "![Icones de l'escriptori][img-desktop-icons]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:15
msgid ""
"The desktop manager utilizes **Thunar**'s libraries to handle application "
"launchers and regular files/folders on the desktop. The desktop manager is "
"also able to display icons for minimized windows on the desktop, which is "
"quite a popular feature from the CDE world. Of course, you can disable the "
"desktop icons altogether if you prefer a clean desktop."
msgstr ""
"El gestor d'escriptori utilitza les biblioteques <b>Thunar</b>'s per "
"gestionar llançadors d'aplicacions i fitxers/carpetes regulars a "
"l'escriptori. El gestor d'escriptori també és capaç de mostrar icones per a "
"finestres minimitzades a l'escriptori, que és una característica bastant "
"popular del món CDE. Per descomptat, podeu desactivar les icones "
"d'escriptori si preferiu un escriptori net."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:17
msgid "![Desktop Settings][img-desktop-settings]"
msgstr "![Ajusts de l'escriptori][img-desktop-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:19
msgid ""
"**Xfdesktop** also continues to provide access to the applications menu, as "
"it did in the previous Xfce releases."
msgstr ""
"<b>Xfdesktop</b> també continua proporcionant l'accés al menú d'aplicacions, "
"com ho ha fet en els anteriors llançaments de l'Xfce."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:23
msgid ""
"The desktop icon support goes hand in hand with the new file manager [Thunar]"
"(http://thunar.xfce.org/) which replaces the previous file manager **Xffm**."
msgstr ""
"El suport d'icones d'escriptori va de la mà amb el nou gestor de fitxers "
"[Thunar](http://thunar.xfce.org/) que reemplaça l'anterior gestor de fitxers "
"<b>Xffm</b>."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:25
msgid "![Thunar File Manager][img-thunar]"
msgstr "![Gestor de fitxers Thunar][img-thunar]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:27
msgid ""
"**Thunar** was written from scratch to provide an easy to use, but still "
"very lightweight file manager for Xfce. Its user interface was designed to "
"look similar to the file chooser which was introduced with GTK+ 2.4, and "
"other file managers such as **Nautilus** and **pcmanfm** already picked up "
"that idea as well."
msgstr ""
"<b>Thunar</b> es va escriure des de zero per proporcionar un gestor de "
"fitxers fàcil d'utilitzar, però encara molt lleuger per a Xfce. La seva "
"interfície d'usuari va ser dissenyada per semblar-se al selector de fitxers "
"que es va introduir amb GTK+ 2.4, i altres gestors de fitxers com "
"<b>Nautilus</b> i <b>pcmanfm</b> ja van recollir aquesta idea."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:29
msgid ""
"**Thunar** supports all the file management functionality which users will "
"expect, and also several advanced features. For example, a so-called *Bulk "
"Renamer* is included which allows users to rename multiple files at once "
"using a certain criterion."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:31
msgid "![Thunar Bulk Rename][img-thunar-bulk-rename]"
msgstr "![Reanomena el Thunar Bulk][img-thunar-bulk-rename]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:33
msgid "Removable Drives and Media"
msgstr "Unitats i mitjans extraïbles"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:35
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.4.0 provides easy access to data on removable drives and media. Just "
"insert the media into the drive or plug the new drive in to the computer and "
"an icon representing the removable volume will appear on the desktop and in "
"**Thunar**'s side pane."
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.4.0 proporciona un accés fàcil a les dades de les unitats i suports "
"extraïbles. Simplement inseriu el suport a la unitat o connecteu la unitat "
"nova a l'ordinador i apareixerà una icona que representa el volum extraïble "
"a l'escriptori i a la subfinestra lateral <b>Thunar</b>."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:37
msgid "![Removable Volumes][img-removable-volumes]"
msgstr "![Volums extraïbles][img-removable-volumes]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:39
msgid ""
"Click on the icon to automatically mount the volume. Right-click the icon to "
"unmount the drive or eject the media from the drive. Note however that this "
"feature requires [HAL](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Software_2fhal) and is "
"therefore only available for Linux 2.6.x and FreeBSD 6.x and above at the "
"time of this writing (there is limited removable media support for FreeBSD "
"4.x and 5.x which does not require HAL)."
msgstr ""
"Feu clic a la icona per a muntar automàticament el volum. Feu clic amb el "
"botó dret a la icona per a desmuntar la unitat o expulsar els suports de la "
"unitat. Tingueu en compte, però, que aquesta característica requereix [HAL]"
"(https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Software2fhal) i, per tant, només està "
"disponible per a Linux 2.6.x i FreeBSD 6.x i més amunt en el moment "
"d'aquesta escriptura (hi ha un suport de suport extraïble limitat per a "
"FreeBSD 4.x i 5.x que no requereix HAL)."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:41
msgid "Text Editor"
msgstr "Editor de text"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:43
msgid ""
"The new text editor **MousePad** is included with this release. **MousePad** "
"provides all the basic editor functionality, nothing more, nothing less."
msgstr ""
"El nou editor de text <b>MousePad</b> s'inclou amb aquest llançament. "
"<b>MousePad</b> proporciona tota la funcionalitat bàsica de l'editor, res "
"més, res menys."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:45
msgid "![MousePad][img-mousepad]"
msgstr "![MousePad][img-mousepad]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:47
msgid ""
"You can think of **MousePad** as the equivalent to **NotePad** on Windows. "
"It starts up very fast, usually in less than one second, even on older "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"Podeu pensar en <b>MousePad</b> com l'equivalent a <b>NotePad</b> a Windows. "
"Comença molt ràpid, normalment en menys d'un segon, fins i tot en sistemes "
"més antics."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:51
msgid "**Xfwm4** continues to be the window manager of the hearts."
msgstr "<b>Xfwm4</b> continua sent el gestor de finestres dels cors."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:53
msgid "![Xfwm4 ARGB32][img-xfwm4-argb32]"
msgstr "![ARGB32 de l'Xfwm4][img-xfwm4-argb32]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:55
msgid ""
"This release features an enhanced compositor, supporting transparent ARGB "
"windows, shadows, window frame transparency and much more."
msgstr ""
"Aquest llançament presenta un compositor millorat, suportant finestres ARGB "
"transparents, ombres, transparència de marc de finestra i molt més."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:57
msgid "![Xfwm4 Switcher][img-xfwm4-switcher]"
msgstr "![Commutador Xfwm4][img-xfwm4-switcher]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:59
msgid ""
"**Xfwm4** also includes a brand new application switcher, as shown in the "
"screenshot above, which displays all windows from the current workspace with "
"icons and window titles."
msgstr ""
"<b>Xfwm4</b> també inclou un commutador d'aplicacions nou, com es mostra a "
"la captura de pantalla anterior, que mostra totes les finestres de l'espai "
"de treball actual amb icones i títols de les finestres."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:61
msgid "![Xfwm4 Themes][img-xfwm4-themes]"
msgstr "![Temes de l'Xfwm4][img-xfwm4-themes]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:63
msgid ""
"Further on support for multiple image formats for window decoration themes "
"was added, including `PNG`, `GIF` and `SVG` images."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:65
msgid "![Xfwm4 Tweaks][img-xfwm4-tweaks]"
msgstr "![Retocs de l'Xfwm4][img-xfwm4-tweaks]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:67
msgid ""
"Advanced controls for the window manager were also added, allowing thorough "
"tweaking of window behavior."
msgstr ""
"També es van afegir controls avançats per al gestor de finestres, permetent "
"ajustar a fons el comportament de la finestra."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:71
msgid ""
"The **Xfce4-panel** was completely rewritten for the Xfce 4.4 release. "
"Multiple panels are supported *out of the box* now and can easily be "
"configured using the new **Panel Manager** shown in the screenshot below."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:73
msgid "![Panel Manager][img-panel-manager]"
msgstr "![Gestor de panells][img-panel-manager]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:75
msgid ""
"One of the major problems in previous Xfce releases was that every plugin "
"had to be run in the same process as the panel, and hence every plugin was "
"able to crash the whole panel. To address this issue, support for external "
"plugins was added to the panel."
msgstr ""
"Un dels principals problemes en els llançaments anteriors de l'Xfce va ser "
"que cada connector havia de ser executat en el mateix procés que el panell, "
"i per tant cada connector va ser capaç de bloquejar tot el panell. Per a "
"abordar aquest problema, s'ha afegit el suport per a connectors externs al "
"panell."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:77
msgid "![Panel Add Item Dialog][img-panel-additem]"
msgstr "![Diàleg d'afegir un element al panell][img-panel-additem]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:79
msgid ""
"Developers of panel plugins can now decide whether the plugin should run as "
"external process or as part of the panel process, depending on the stability "
"of the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Els desenvolupadors de connectors de panell ara poden decidir si el "
"connector s'ha d'executar com a procés extern o com a part del procés de "
"panell, depenent de l'estabilitat del connector."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:81
msgid "![Panel Icon Box Plugin][img-panel-iconbox]"
msgstr "![Connector de quadre d'icones del panell][img-panel-iconbox]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:83
msgid ""
"Since there is now support for multiple panels, the separate **Xftaskbar4** "
"and **Xfce4-iconbox** utilities are no longer required. Instead, both the "
"taskbar and the iconbox are available as panel plugins now."
msgstr ""
"Atès que ara hi ha suport per a múltiples panells, les utilitats separades "
"<b>Xftaskbar4</b> i <b>Xfce4-iconbox</b> ja no són necessàries. En lloc "
"d'això, tant la barra de tasques com el quadre d'icones estan disponibles "
"ara com a connectors de panell."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:85
msgid ""
"Most of the additional panel plugins, available via the [Xfce Goodies "
"Project](https://goodies.xfce.org/), have been updated for the new panel, "
"and several new plugins were added. For example, the brand new **xfce4-"
"xfapplet-plugin** allows users to add GNOME panel applets to the Xfce panel."
msgstr ""
"La majoria dels connectors de panells addicionals, disponibles a través del "
"[Xfce Goodies Project](https://goodies.xfce.org/), s'han actualitzat per al "
"nou panell, i s'han afegit diversos connectors nous. Per exemple, el nou "
"<b>xfce4-xfapplet-plugin</b> permet als usuaris afegir miniaplicacions del "
"panell GNOME al panell Xfce."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:87
msgid "Time Management"
msgstr "Gestió del temps"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:89
msgid ""
"The new time management application **Orage** replaces the **Xfcalendar**, "
"which was introduced with Xfce 4.2.0. **Orage** provides several features to "
"efficiently manage your time."
msgstr ""
"La nova aplicació de gestió del temps <b>Orage</b> reemplaça el "
"<b>Xfcalendar</b>, que es va introduir amb Xfce 4.2.0. <b>Orage</b> "
"proporciona diverses funcions per gestionar el vostre temps de manera "
"eficient."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:91
msgid "![Orage][img-orage]"
msgstr "![Orage][img-orage]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:93
msgid ""
"While **Orage** is very lightweight and easy to use, it supports all the "
"important features found in larger calendar applications like **Outlook** or "
"**Evolution**. While **Xfcalendar** used the custom `dbh` format in the past "
"to store your settings, **Orage** is based on `ical` and therefore "
"compatible with other calendar applications."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:95
msgid "Terminal Emulator"
msgstr "Emulador de terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:97
msgid ""
"While **Terminal** was already available during the 4.2 days, it was not "
"mature enough at that time to be part of the core. With this major release, "
"it was moved into the core desktop."
msgstr ""
"Mentre que la terminal <b></b> ja estava disponible durant els 4,2 dies, no "
"era prou madura en aquell moment per formar part del nucli. Amb aquest "
"llançament principal, es va traslladar a l'escriptori central."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:99
msgid "![Terminal][img-terminal]"
msgstr "![Terminal][img-terminal]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:101
msgid ""
"Besides the basic features which you might expect from a terminal emulator, "
"it includes some nice additional features, like multiple tabs per window, "
"customizable toolbars and the ability to configure nearly every aspect of "
"the application via *hidden options*. As can be seen in the screenshot "
"above, this release also supports real transparency using **Xfwm4**'s "
"integrated composition manager."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:103
msgid "Printing"
msgstr "Impressió"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:105
msgid ""
"**Xfprint**, the Xfce printing management application, saw several small "
"improvements with this release. First, the `a2ps` converter is not mandatory "
"anymore, whilst still recommended. Support for `CUPS` 1.2 was added and "
"**Xfprint** is now able to display the printer state with the `CUPS`-backend."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:107
msgid "![Xfce Printing][img-xfprint]"
msgstr "![Impressió de l'Xfce][img-xfprint]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:109
msgid ""
"**Xfprint** also integrates with **MousePad** to provide generic printing "
"support for different kinds of text documents using the `a2ps` converter."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:111
msgid "![Xfce Print Dialog][img-xfprint-dialog]"
msgstr "![Diàleg d'impressió de l'Xfce][img-xfprint-dialog]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:113
msgid ""
"As you can see the print dialog still looks relatively similar to that of "
"Xfce 4.2, but the internal workings of the printing support were improved, "
"especially the `CUPS` support. Besides that, the printing management "
"functionality was moved to a library, so other applications can use the API "
"to access the printer configuration."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:115
msgid "Autostart"
msgstr "Inici automàtic"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:117
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.4.0 implements the new [Autostart Specification](https://"
"freedesktop.org/wiki/Standards_2fautostart_2dspec) - actually Xfce was the "
"first desktop to implement said feature, but the others were faster to "
"release. ;-)"
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.4.0 implementa la nova especificació d'inici automàtic [](https://"
"freedesktop.org/wiki/Standards2fautostart2dspec) - en realitat Xfce va ser "
"el primer escriptori a implementar aquesta característica, però els altres "
"van ser més ràpids de llançar. ;-)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:119
msgid "![Xfce Autostart Editor][img-autostart]"
msgstr "![Editor d'inici automàtic de l'Xfce][img-autostart]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:121
msgid ""
"The specification consists of two parts, the *Autostart of Applications "
"During Startup*, which is implemented in **xfce4-session** and the "
"*Autostart Of Applications After Mount* which is implemented in [thunar-"
"volman](http://foo-projects.org/~benny/projects/thunar-volman/index.html). "
"This release also includes the **xfce4-autostart-editor**, shown in the "
"screenshot above, which allows users to easily add, remove or disable "
"autostarted applications."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:125
msgid ""
"This release introduces new options to customize the desktop to your needs. "
"Some examples of new settings dialogs were already shown in the sections "
"above."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta versió presenta noves opcions per personalitzar l'escriptori a les "
"vostres necessitats. Alguns exemples de diàlegs de configuració nous ja es "
"mostraven a les seccions anteriors."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:127
msgid "![Preferred Applications][img-preferences-applications]"
msgstr "![Aplicacions preferides][img-preferences-applications]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:129
msgid ""
"The preferred applications framework, which was previously only available in "
"**Terminal**, was imported into Xfce, so users no longer need to edit shell "
"profiles to specify which browser and terminal emulator should be used by "
"Xfce applications. The goal was to make it as easy as possible to change an "
"application for a certain category (GNOME users may have already noticed "
"that GNOME adopted this approach, because it is such simple)."
msgstr ""
"El marc de treball d'aplicacions preferides, que anteriorment només estava "
"disponible al terminal <b></b>, es va importar a Xfce, de manera que els "
"usuaris ja no necessiten editar perfils de l'intèrpret d'ordres per "
"especificar quin navegador i emulador de terminal haurien d'utilitzar les "
"aplicacions Xfce. L'objectiu era facilitar al màxim el canvi d'una aplicació "
"per a una categoria determinada (els usuaris del GNOME ja s'han adonat que "
"el GNOME va adoptar aquest enfocament, perquè és tan senzill)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:131
msgid "![Keyboard Shortcuts][img-preferences-keyboard]"
msgstr "![Dreceres de teclat][img-preferences-keyboard]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:133
msgid ""
"And then there was the problem with the keyboard shortcuts in Xfce 4.2... "
"Xfce 4.2 limited the number of freely available keyboard shortcuts, while "
"people wanted to assign any number of keyboard shortcuts. With Xfce 4.4 this "
"limitation is history and the application shortcuts are now separated from "
"the window manager shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"I després hi havia el problema amb les dreceres de teclat a Xfce 4.2... Xfce "
"4.2 limitava el nombre de dreceres de teclat disponibles lliurement, mentre "
"que la gent volia assignar qualsevol nombre de dreceres de teclat. Amb Xfce "
"4.4 aquesta limitació és l'historial i les dreceres de l'aplicació ara estan "
"separades de les dreceres del gestor de finestres."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:135
msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "Comentaris"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:137
msgid ""
"Please post comments on this article in my [blog](http://xfce-"
"diary.blogspot.com/2007/01/visual-tour-of-xfce-440.html) and use the [xfce](/"
"community/lists) mailinglist if you have questions about Xfce 4.4.0 or "
"trouble with the installation."
msgstr ""
"Si us plau, publiqueu comentaris sobre aquest article al meu [blog](http://"
"xfce-diary.blogspot.com/2007/01/visual-tour-of-xfce-440.html) i utilitzeu la "
"llista de correu [xfce](/community/lists) si teniu preguntes sobre Xfce "
"4.4.0 o problemes amb la instal·lació."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:139 content/about/tour46.md:137
msgid "Links"
msgstr "Enllaços"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour44.md:141 content/about/tour46.md:139
msgid "[Xfce website](https://xfce.org/)"
msgstr "[Lloc web de l'Xfce](https://xfce.org/)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour44.md:142
msgid "[Thunar website](http://thunar.xfce.org/)"
msgstr "[Lloc web de Thunar](http://thunar.xfce.org/)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:146
msgid "Written by Benedikt Meurer, 21 Jan 2007"
msgstr "Escrit per Benedikt Meurer, 21 de gener del 2007"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour46.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.6 tour"
msgstr "Recorregut de l'Xfce 4.6"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:7
msgid ""
"The long awaited 4.6.0 version of the Xfce Desktop Environment is finally "
"available. We will try to highlight some of the new features which have been "
"added since the last stable release."
msgstr ""
"La tan esperada versió 4.6.0 de l'entorn d'escriptori Xfce finalment està "
"disponible. Intentarem destacar algunes de les noves característiques que "
"s'han afegit des de l'última versió estable."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:11
msgid ""
"Since desktop icons have been introduced in Xfce 4.4, people have expressed "
"the need to allow the selection of multiple icons (rubber banding). With "
"**Xfce 4.6**, the **Xfdesktop** manager finally implements this feature: you "
"can select multiple icons, remove them, etcetera..."
msgstr ""
"Com que les icones d'escriptori s'han introduït a Xfce 4.4, la gent ha "
"expressat la necessitat de permetre la selecció de múltiples icones (banda "
"de brossa). Amb <b>Xfce 4.6</b>, el gestor <b>Xfdesktop</b>finalment "
"implementa aquesta funció: podeu seleccionar múltiples icones, eliminar-les, "
"etcetera..."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:13
msgid "![Multiple icons selection][img-xfdesktop-rubberbanding]"
msgstr "![Selecció de diverses icones][img-xfdesktop-rubberbanding]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:15
msgid ""
"**Xfce 4.6** features a brand new desktop menu which allows you to "
"manipulate files as with the **Thunar** filemanager contextual menu, but "
"also to open applications, exit your session, or access the help "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"<b>Xfce 4.6</b> compta amb un nou menú d'escriptori de marca que us permet "
"manipular fitxers com amb el menú contextual del gestor de fitxers "
"<b>Thunar</b>, però també per obrir aplicacions, sortir de la sessió o "
"accedir a la documentació d'ajuda."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:17
msgid "![New desktop menu][img-xfdesktop-menu]"
msgstr "![Menú d'escriptori nou][img-xfdesktop-menu]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:21
msgid ""
"A lot of long standing bugs have been fixed in **Xfce4 Panel**, particularly "
"for multiple screen setups, but this new release also brings an improved set "
"of panel plugins."
msgstr ""
"Una gran quantitat d'errors permanents han corregits al <b>Panell de "
"l'Xfce4</b>, particularment per a les configuracions de múltiples pantalles, "
"però aquesta nova versió també porta un conjunt millorat dels connectors del "
"panell."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:23
msgid "![New binary clock][img-xfce4-panel-clock]"
msgstr "![Rellotge binari nou][img-xfce4-panel-clock]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:25
msgid ""
"The **clock plugin** has been rewritten to consume fewer system resources "
"and to fix some display bugs, but there is also a new clock mode for the "
"geek in you: binary clock! The new **notification area plugin** allows you "
"to hide selected notification icons to keep your notification area clean and "
"readable."
msgstr ""
"El <b>connector del rellotge</b> ha estat reescrit per consumir menys "
"recursos del sistema i per corregir alguns errors de visualització, però "
"també hi ha un mode de rellotge nou per al friki que hi ha dins vostre: el "
"rellotge binari! El nou <b>connector d'àrea de notificació</b> us permet "
"ocultar les icones de notificació seleccionades per mantenir la vostra àrea "
"de notificació neta i llegible."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour46.md:27
msgid "Sound Mixer *(xfce4-mixer)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:29
msgid ""
"**Xfce4 Mixer** has been rewritten from scratch to use [Gstreamer](https://"
"gstreamer.freedesktop.org/). This allows us to more easily support multiple "
"sound systems, the user interface is more polished, and you can manage "
"several different sound cards. Additionally, a panel plugin allows you to "
"set the system sound quickly using the mouse scroll wheel."
msgstr ""
"<b>Xfce4 Mixer</b> ha estat reescrit des de zero per utilitzar [Gstreamer]"
"(https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/). Això ens permet suportar més fàcilment "
"múltiples sistemes de so, la interfície d'usuari és més polida, i es poden "
"gestionar diverses targetes de so diferents. A més, un connector de panell "
"permet establir el so del sistema ràpidament utilitzant la roda de "
"desplaçament del ratolí."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:31
msgid "![New sound mixer][img-xfce4-mixer]"
msgstr "![Mesclador de sons nou][img-xfce4-mixer]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:35
msgid ""
"**Xfce 4.6** comes with an enhanced session manager: your session should be "
"started faster, and the settings dialog has been reworked to ease the "
"management of session-aware applications. Additionally, the session manager "
"will now automatically restart session applications which crashed so that "
"you are not left without a desktop, panel, window manager, etcetera, if a "
"crash occurs."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:37
msgid "![Session settings dialog][img-xfce4-session-settings]"
msgstr "![Diàleg d'ajusts de la sessió][img-xfce4-session-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:39
msgid ""
"The session manager also includes a new long-awaited feature: support for "
"**suspend** and **hibernate** \"out of the box.\" The logout dialog now has "
"two additional buttons which offer to suspend or hibernate your computer."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:41
msgid "![Session logout dialog][img-xfce4-session-logout]"
msgstr "![Diàleg de tancament de la sessió][img-xfce4-session-logout]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:45
msgid ""
"As usual, **Xfwm4** has matured quite a bit during this release cycle: many "
"bugs have been fixed, support for multiple displays has been added, and "
"overall performance has been improved."
msgstr ""
"Com sempre, <b>Xfwm4</b> ha madurat bastant durant aquest cicle de "
"llançament: molts errors han estat corregits, la compatibilitat per a "
"diversos monitors ha estat afegida, i el rendiment general ha estat millorat."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:47
msgid ""
"In addition to some other new features, **Xfwm4** is now able to detect "
"windows that do not respond and offer to terminate them."
msgstr ""
"A més d'algunes altres característiques noves, <b>Xfwm4</b> ara és capaç de "
"detectar les finestres que no responen i s'ofereix per acabar amb elles."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:49
msgid "![Dialog to terminate busy applications][img-xfwm4-net-ping]"
msgstr "![Diàleg per acabar amb les aplicacions ocupades][img-xfwm4-net-ping]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:51
msgid ""
"There is also a new **actions menu** which allows you to quickly move and "
"resize windows, put them above or below other windows, or fullscreen them."
msgstr ""
"Hi ha també un nou <b>menú d'accions</b> que us permet moure i canviar "
"ràpidament la mida de les finestres, posar-les per sobre o per sota d'altres "
"finestres, o posar-les a pantalla completa."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:53
msgid "![New actions menu][img-xfwm4-new-menu]"
msgstr "![Menú d'accions nou][img-xfwm4-new-menu]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:55
msgid ""
"A new **fill** operation has been implemented; it expands a given window to "
"the available space without overlapping other adjacent windows."
msgstr ""
"Una nova operació d'<b>ompliment</b> ha estat implementada; expandeix una "
"finestra indicada a l'espai disponible sense la superposició d'altres "
"finestres adjacents."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:57
msgid "![Fill operation][img-xfwm4-fill-operation]"
msgstr "![Operació d'ompliment][img-xfwm4-fill-operation]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:59
msgid ""
"The **compositor** has been optimized to reduce window flickering during "
"resize operations."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:61
msgid "![Flicker free resizing][img-xfwm4-resize]"
msgstr "![Redimensionament lliure de parpelleig][img-xfwm4-resize]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:63
msgid ""
"Some **tweakable options** have also been added: for example, you can now "
"disable the blinking of windows when they receive an urgency hint."
msgstr ""
"També s'han afegit <b>opcions ajustables</b>: per exemple, ara podeu "
"desactivar el parpelleig de les finestres quan rebin un consell d'urgència."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:65
msgid "![New tweakable options][img-xfwm4-new-tweaks]"
msgstr "![Opcions noves ajustables][img-xfwm4-new-tweaks]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:69
msgid ""
"There have been many bug fixes and performance improvements in **Thunar**. "
"It can use the mouse forward and backward buttons (if available) to "
"navigate, and it includes a new plugin that allows you to set an image as "
"wallpaper from the context menu."
msgstr ""
"Hi ha hagut moltes correccions d'errors i millores de rendiment en "
"<b>Thunar</b>. Pot utilitzar els botons del ratolí endavant i enrere (si "
"està disponible) per navegar, i inclou un connector nou que permet establir "
"una imatge com a fons de pantalla des del menú contextual."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:71
msgid ""
"![Set an image in a Thunar folder as wallpaper][img-thunar-wallpaper-plugin]"
msgstr ""
"![Establiment d'una imatge en una carpeta de Thunar com a paper pintat][img-"
"thunar-wallpaper-plugin]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:73
msgid ""
"**Thunar** now follows the [XDG user directories](https://freedesktop.org/"
"wiki/Software/xdg-user-dirs) specification; this allows you to have themed "
"and localized user folders to store your music, documents, videos, "
"templates, etcetera..."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:75
msgid "![Thunar menu for user directories][img-thunar-xdg-user-dirs]"
msgstr ""
"![Menú de Thunar per als directoris de l'usuari][img-thunar-xdg-user-dirs]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:77
msgid ""
"**Thunar** will now display a translucent icon for drives or volumes that "
"are not mounted, so that you can distinguish them from the mounted ones."
msgstr ""
"<b>Thunar</b> ara mostrarà una icona translúcida per a les unitats o volums "
"que no estiguin muntats, de manera que pugueu distingir-los dels muntats."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:79
msgid ""
"![Translucent icons for unmounted drives and volumes][img-thunar-mounting]"
msgstr ""
"![Icones translúcides per a les unitats i volums sense muntar][img-thunar-"
"mounting]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:81
msgid "Last, but not least, **Thunar** now supports encrypted devices!"
msgstr ""
"Per últim, però nom menys important, <b>Thunar</b> ara és compatible amb "
"dispositius xifrats!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:83
msgid "![Thunar support for encrypted devices][img-thunar-encrypted]"
msgstr ""
"![Compatibilitat de Thunar per als dispositius xifrats][img-thunar-encrypted]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:87
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.6 features a new settings interface, **Xfce Settings Manager**, which "
"allows you to configure your desktop environment much more easily than "
"before. The dialogs which are accessible by single clicking on the icons "
"have been designed to be more compact and to allow you to customize your "
"desktop quickly and in a more intuitive way."
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.6 compta amb una nova interfície de configuració, <b>Xfce Settings "
"Manager</b>, que us permet configurar el vostre entorn d'escriptori molt més "
"fàcilment que abans. Els diàlegs accessibles fent un sol clic a les icones "
"han estat dissenyats per a ser més compactes i permetre personalitzar el "
"vostre escriptori de manera ràpida i d'una manera més intuïtiva."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:89
msgid "![Xfce4 Settings Manager][img-xfce4-settings-manager]"
msgstr "![Gestor d'ajusts de l'Xfce4][img-xfce4-settings-manager]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:91
msgid "Accessibility settings"
msgstr "Ajusts de l'accessibilitat"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:93
msgid "![Accessibility settings dialog][img-xfce4-accessibility-settings]"
msgstr ""
"![Diàleg d'ajusts de l'accessibilitat][img-xfce4-accessibility-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:95
msgid ""
"The **Accessibility settings** dialog allows you to set the accessibility "
"related mouse and keyboard options, such as sticky keys, bounce keys, or "
"mouse emulation."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg <b>Configuració d'accessibilitat</b> us permet establir les "
"opcions relacionades amb l'accessibilitat del ratolí i del teclat, com ara "
"les tecles enganxoses, les tecles de rebot o l'emulació del ratolí."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:97
msgid "Appearance settings"
msgstr "Ajusts de l'aparença"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:99
msgid "![Appearance settings dialog][img-xfce4-appearance-settings]"
msgstr "![Diàleg d'ajusts de l'aparença][img-xfce4-appearance-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:101
msgid ""
"The **Appearance settings** dialog allows you to set the widget style, the "
"icon theme, and font, toolbar and menu options."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg <b>Configuració de l'aparença</b> us permet establir l'estil del "
"giny, el tema d'icones i les opcions de tipus de lletra, barra d'eines i "
"menú."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:103
msgid "Display settings"
msgstr "Mostra els paràmetres"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:105
msgid "![Display settings dialog][img-xfce4-display-settings]"
msgstr "![Mostra el diàleg de configuració][img-xfce4-display-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:107
msgid ""
"The **Display settings** dialog allows you to set the resolution, refresh "
"rate, and the rotation for each screen that is connected."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg <b>Configuració de la pantalla</b> us permet establir la "
"resolució, la freqüència d'actualització i la rotació per a cada pantalla "
"que està connectada."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:109
msgid "Keyboard settings"
msgstr "Ajusts del teclat"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:111
msgid ""
"![Keyboard settings dialog, layout tab][img-xfce4-keyboard-settings-layout]"
msgstr ""
"![Diàleg d'ajusts del teclat, pestanya de la disposició][img-xfce4-keyboard-"
"settings-layout]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:113
msgid ""
"The **Keyboard settings** dialog allows you to set keyboard preferences such "
"as key repeating, keyboard shortcuts, and your keyboard layout."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg <b>Configuració del teclat</b> us permet establir les preferències "
"del teclat, com ara la repetició de tecles, les dreceres de teclat i la "
"disposició del teclat."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:115
msgid ""
"![Keyboard settings dialog, shortcuts tab][img-xfce4-keyboard-settings-"
"shortcuts]"
msgstr ""
"![Diàleg d'ajusts del teclat, pestanya de les dreceres][img-xfce4-keyboard-"
"settings-shortcuts]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:117
msgid ""
"You can now configure shortcuts more simply, and any shortcut conflicts are "
"automatically detected."
msgstr ""
"Ara podeu configurar les dreceres de manera més simple, i qualsevol "
"conflicte de drecera es detecta automàticament."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:119
msgid "Mouse settings"
msgstr "Ajusts del ratolí"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:121
msgid "![Mouse settings dialog][img-xfce4-mouse-settings]"
msgstr "![Diàleg d'ajusts del ratolí][img-xfce4-mouse-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:123
msgid ""
"The **Mouse settings** dialog allows you to configure the different mice "
"connected to your computer: button order, acceleration, double-click speed, "
"mouse cursor theme, etcetera..."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg dels <b>ajusts del ratolí</b> us permet configurar els diferents "
"ratolins que estiguin connectats al vostre ordinador: l'ordre dels botons, "
"l'acceleració, la velocitat del doble clic, el tema de cursor del ratolí, "
"etc."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:125
msgid "Desktop settings"
msgstr "Ajusts de l'escriptori"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:127
msgid "![Desktop settings dialog][img-xfdesktop-settings]"
msgstr "![Diàleg d'ajusts de l'escriptori][img-xfdesktop-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:129
msgid ""
"The **Desktop settings** dialog is now much more compact; it allows you to "
"configure per-screen settings: wallpaper, brightness, desktop menu, "
"displayed icons, etcetera..."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg dels <b>ajusts de l'escriptori</b> ara és molt més compacte; us "
"permet configurar els ajusts de cada pantalla: el paper pintat, la "
"brillantor, el menú d'escriptori, les icones visualitzades, etcètera..."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:133
msgid ""
"**Xfce 4.6** also comes with a brand new application finder which features a "
"cleaner user interface. It is also easier to use it with the keyboard, and "
"it monitors installed applications to update the list \"on the fly.\" It "
"also allows you to create panel launchers quickly by dragging an application "
"icon to the launcher creation window."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:135
msgid "![New application finder][img-xfce4-appfinder]"
msgstr "![Descobridor d'aplicacions nou][img-xfce4-appfinder]"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour46.md:140
msgid "[Thunar website](https://xfce.org/projects/thunar)"
msgstr "[Lloc web de Thunar](https://xfce.org/projects/thunar)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour46.md:144
msgid "Written by Jérôme Guelfucci (February 2009)"
msgstr "Escrit per Jérôme Guelfucci (febrer del 2009)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour46.md:145
msgid "Screenshots by Jannis Pohlmann"
msgstr "Captures de pantalla per Jannis Pohlmann"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour48.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.8 tour"
msgstr "Recorregut de l'Xfce 4.8"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to all the new major visual features in Xfce "
"4.8. This is only the visual part of what has been done; for a full list of "
"changes, see the [changelogs](/download/changelogs/)."
msgstr ""
"Aquest recorregut us presentarà totes les característiques visuals "
"principals noves de l'Xfce 4.8. Només cobreix la part visual que s'ha fet; "
"per a la llista completa dels canvis, consulteu els [registres de canvis](/"
"download/changelogs/)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:11
msgid "Remote shares browsing"
msgstr "Navegació per les comparticions remotes"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:13
msgid ""
"Thunar now has optional support for GVFS which will allow you to browse "
"remote shares using Thunar: FTP, Windows Shares, WebDav and SSH servers..."
msgstr ""
"Thunar ara té suport opcional per a GVFS que us permetrà navegar per "
"comparticions remotes utilitzant Thunar: FTP, Windows Shares, WebDav i "
"servidors SSH..."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:15
msgid "![Thunar browsing a remote share][img-thunar-remote]"
msgstr "![Thunar navegant per una compartició remota][img-thunar-remote]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:17
msgid "New file operations progress dialog"
msgstr "Diàleg de progrés d'operacions de fitxer nou"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:19
msgid ""
"When several file operations (copy or move) are being handled in parallel, "
"Thunar now shows a single progress dialog which displays all the relevant "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Quan diverses operacions de fitxer (copia o mou) s'estan gestionant en "
"paral·lel, Thunar ara mostra un únic diàleg de progrés que mostra tota la "
"informació rellevant."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:21
msgid "![Progress dialog][img-thunar-progress]"
msgstr "![Diàleg de progrés][img-thunar-progress]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:23
msgid "Eject button for removable devices"
msgstr "Botó d'expulsió de dispositius extraïbles"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:25
msgid ""
"It is is now possible to eject removable devices by clicking the eject "
"button near each removable device label in the side pane."
msgstr ""
"Ara és possible l'expulsió dels dispositius extraïbles fent clic al botó "
"d'expulsió que està al costat de cadascuna de les etiquetes dels dispositius "
"extraïbles a la subfinestra lateral."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:27
msgid "![Eject button][img-thunar-eject]"
msgstr "![Botó d'expulsió][img-thunar-eject]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:31
msgid ""
"The Xfce panel has been totally rewritten in 4.8, here are the most visible "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"El panell de l'Xfce ha estat totalment reescrit per a la versió 4.8, aquí hi "
"ha els canvis més visibles."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:33
msgid "Improved positioning and size handling"
msgstr "Millora del posicionament i de la gestió de la mida"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:35
msgid ""
"The panel has much better support for positioning panels on the screen. It "
"can be dragged and snapped to screen borders; floating positions are only "
"remembered when moving a panel and the length of the panel can be adjusted "
"as a percentage of the monitor size."
msgstr ""
"El panell té un millor suport per al posicionament dels panells en pantalla. "
"Es pot arrossegar i forçar a vores de la pantalla; les posicions flotants "
"només es recorden en moure un panell i la longitud del panell es pot ajustar "
"com a percentatge de la mida del monitor."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:37
msgid "Transparent backgrounds"
msgstr "Fons transparents"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:39
msgid ""
"The panel is now able to draw transparent panel backgrounds with non "
"transparent items. Your panel items will remain readable and you will enjoy "
"a nice panel look."
msgstr ""
"El panell és ara capaç de dibuixar fons de panells transparents amb elements "
"no transparents. els vostres elements del panell romandran llegibles i "
"podreu gaudir d'un bon aspecte del panell."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:41
msgid "![Transparent panel background][img-panel-transparent]"
msgstr "![Fons del panell transparent][img-panel-transparent]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:43
msgid "New item editor"
msgstr "Editor d'elements nou"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:45
msgid ""
"The panel now features an item editor which allows to modify, move, add and "
"remove items quickly. This is particularly useful for items which are hard "
"to right click and gives you an easy way to change your panel layout from a "
"single place."
msgstr ""
"El panell ara compta amb un editor d'elements que permet modificar, moure, "
"afegir i suprimir elements amb més facilitat. Això és particularment útil "
"per als elements que són difícils per fer el botó dret del ratolí i us "
"proporciona una manera fàcil de canviar la distribució del vostre panell des "
"d'un sol lloc."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:47
msgid "![Panel item editor][img-panel-editor]"
msgstr "![Editor d'elements del panell][img-panel-editor]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:49
msgid "Drag and drop to create launchers"
msgstr "Arrossegar i deixar anar per crear llançadors"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:51
msgid ""
"You can now drag and drop menu entries from the panel applications menu, "
"application finder or Thunar to the panel to create launchers. This feature "
"should please the huge number of people who had been requesting it for ages. "
"The launcher also has an integrated application finder to add new items."
msgstr ""
"Ara podeu arrossegar i deixar anar les entrades des del menú d'aplicacions "
"del panell, des del descobridor d'aplicacions o des de Thunar al panell per "
"crear llançadors. Aquesta característica hauria de complaure el gran nombre "
"de persones que ho havien estat sol·licitant des de fa molts anys. El "
"llançador també té un descobridor d'aplicacions integrat per afegir nous "
"elements."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:53
msgid "Window buttons plugin"
msgstr "Connector dels botons de la finestra"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:55
msgid ""
"The iconbox and tasklist plugins are new merged into 1 plugin, called window "
"buttons. It implements different sorting modes, improved handling in "
"vertical panels and can draw a similar frame as Xfwm4 Alt+tab when hovering "
"a button."
msgstr ""
"Els connectors de caixa d'icones i de llista de tasques ara formen part de "
"la fusió nova d'1 connector, que s'anomena botons de la finestra. Implementa "
"diferents modes d'ordenació, millora la gestió als panells verticals i pot "
"dibuixar un panell similar a l'Alt+Tab de l'Xfwm4 quan es passa el ratolí "
"per sobre d'un botó."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:57
msgid "New fuzzy clock"
msgstr "Rellotge difús nou"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:59
msgid ""
"An Xfce release without a new clock mode would not be a true Xfce release. "
"Let us introduce you the 'fuzzy' clock mode!"
msgstr ""
"Un llançament Xfce sense un nou mode de rellotge no seria un llançament Xfce "
"veritable. Us presentem el mode de rellotge 'difús'!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:61
msgid "![New fuzzy clock mode][img-panel-fuzzy-clock]"
msgstr "![Nou mode de rellotge difús][img-panel-fuzzy-clock]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:63
msgid "New directory menu plugin"
msgstr "Connector de menú de directoris nou"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:65
msgid ""
"The directory menu plugin provides a menu reproducing the arborescence of a "
"particular folder. This allows you to open a terminal or a file manager in a "
"sub-folder in a very fast and efficient way."
msgstr ""
"El connector de menú de directoris proporciona un menú que reprodueix "
"l'arborescència d'una carpeta en particular. Això permet obrir un terminal o "
"un gestor de fitxers en una subcarpeta d'una manera molt ràpida i eficient."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:67
msgid "![Directory menu plugin][img-panel-directorymenu]"
msgstr "![Connector de menú de directoris][img-panel-directorymenu]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:69
msgid "Applications menu edition"
msgstr "Edició del menú d'aplicacions"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:71
msgid ""
"You can now edit the applications menu using any Freedesktop compliant menu "
"editor, Alacarte being the one we used to test."
msgstr ""
"Ara podeu editar el menú d'aplicacions utilitzant qualsevol editor de menús "
"compatible amb Freedesktop, sent Alacarte el que vam utilitzar per provar."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:75
msgid "Improved multihead setup configuration"
msgstr "S'ha millorat la configuració multicap"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:77
msgid ""
"Xfce can now handle and setup multihead setups for any randr 1.2 compatible "
"driver. Unfortunately, this means it will not work with Nvidia proprietary "
"drivers."
msgstr ""
"Xfce ara pot gestionar i configurar configuracions multicapçaleres per a "
"qualsevol controlador compatible amb el randr 1.2. Malauradament, això "
"significa que no funcionarà amb controladors propietaris de Nvidia."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:79
msgid ""
"You can enable and disable plugged screens, set their resolution, refresh "
"rate, rotation and reflection, clone screens or extend desktops."
msgstr ""
"Podeu activar i desactivar les pantalles endollades, establir la seva "
"resolució, velocitat d'actualització, rotació i reflexió, clonar pantalles o "
"estendre escriptoris."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:81
msgid "![New display settings dialog][img-display-settings]"
msgstr "![Diàleg de configuració de la pantalla nova][img-display-settings]"

#. type: Title ####
#: content/about/tour48.md:83
msgid "Timed confirmation"
msgstr "Confirmació cronometrada"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:85
msgid ""
"Any change made with the settings dialog will have to be confirmed within "
"ten seconds or they will be reverted. This prevents broken video drivers "
"from leaving your computer unusable."
msgstr ""
"Qualsevol canvi fet amb el diàleg de configuració s'haurà de confirmar en un "
"termini de deu segons o es revertirà. Això evita que els controladors de "
"vídeo trencats deixin l'ordinador inutilitzable."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:87
msgid ""
"![Timed confirmation for display settings changes][img-display-settings-"
"confirmation]"
msgstr ""
"![Confirmació cronometrada per als canvis de configuració de la pantalla]"
"[img-display-settings-confirmation]"

#. type: Title ####
#: content/about/tour48.md:89
msgid "Quick setup dialog"
msgstr "Diàleg de configuració ràpida"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:91
msgid ""
"The quick setup dialog allows you to configure a dual screen setup in a "
"second. Plug the second screen, press the display key or Windows + p and "
"select the wanted layout. Done!"
msgstr ""
"El diàleg de configuració ràpida permet configurar una configuració de doble "
"pantalla en un segon. Connecteu la segona pantalla, premeu la tecla de "
"visualització o Windows + p i seleccioneu la disposició desitjada. Fet!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:93
msgid "![Quick multihead setup][img-minimal-display-settings]"
msgstr "![Configuració ràpida multicap][img-minimal-display-settings]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:95
msgid "Settings edition in the Xfce Settings Editor"
msgstr "Edició de la configuració a l'editor de configuració de l'Xfce"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:97
msgid ""
"The Xfce Settings Editor now deserves its name, it is no longer a simpler "
"Xfconf settings viewer. You can now modify, delete, add and reset settings "
"through its interface. It also monitors changes to update its view."
msgstr ""
"L'editor de configuració Xfce ara mereix el seu nom, ja no és un visor de "
"configuració Xfconf més simple. Ara podeu modificar, suprimir, afegir i "
"restablir la configuració a través de la seva interfície. També supervisa "
"els canvis per actualitzar la seva vista."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:99
msgid ""
"![Editing Xfconf properties with the Settings Editor][img-settings-editor]"
msgstr ""
"![S'estan editant les propietats Xfconf amb l'editor de paràmetres][img-"
"settings-editor]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:101
msgid "Improved keyboard layout selection"
msgstr "Selecció millorada de la disposició del teclat"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:103
msgid ""
"The layout selection dialog received a lot of love: it no longer displays "
"cryptic language/variants codes but uses localized languages/variants names. "
"Layout edition was also made easier by prefilling the dialogs with the "
"current values."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg de selecció de la disposició va rebre molt d'amor: ja no mostra "
"codis de llenguatge críptic/variants, sinó que utilitza noms de llengües/"
"variants localitzats. L'edició de la disposició també es va fer més fàcil "
"preomplint els diàlegs amb els valors actuals."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:105
msgid "![Layouts and variants list][img-keyboard-settings-list]"
msgstr "![Llista de disposicions i variants][img-keyboard-settings-list]"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/community/_index.md:0
msgid "Community"
msgstr "Comunitat"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:6
msgid ""
"Whether it be to solve a problem or to contribute in any way, the Xfce "
"communities are a good place to get help or to share your ideas. You might "
"also want to have a look at the communities of the different distributions "
"which provide Xfce."
msgstr ""
"Ja sigui per resoldre un problema o per contribuir de qualsevol manera, les "
"comunitats de l'Xfce són un bon lloc per obtenir ajuda o per compartir les "
"seves idees. També pot ser que vulgueu fer una ullada a les comunitats de "
"les diferents distribucions que proporcionen l'Xfce."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:8
msgid "Mailing lists"
msgstr "Llistes de correu"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:10
msgid ""
"Almost all development and coordination work is taking place on the Xfce "
"mailing lists. A summary of all lists is available at [mail.xfce.org]"
"(https://mail.xfce.org). There is also a user-specific list where you can "
"ask questions and freely discuss about the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Gairebé tot el treball de desenvolupament i coordinació s'està duent a terme "
"en les llistes de correu de l'Xfce. Un resum de totes les llistes està "
"disponible a [mail.xfce.org](https://mail.xfce.org). També hi ha una llista "
"específica per a l'usuari on podeu fer preguntes i discutir lliurement sobre "
"l'escriptori."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:12
msgid "**NOTE:** In order to post to these lists, you must first subscribe."
msgstr ""
"**NOTA**: Per publicar en aquestes llistes, primer us heu de subscriure."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:14
msgid "Matrix"
msgstr "Matriu"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:16
msgid ""
"If you have a problem that you cannot resolve, you might want to try asking "
"a question in our Matrix channel [#xfce](https://matrix.to/#/"
"#xfce:matrix.org). The channel has several active users. It is recommended "
"that you consult the [documentation](https://docs.xfce.org/) about your "
"problem before asking your question."
msgstr ""
"Si teniu un problema que no podeu resoldre, podeu intentar fer una pregunta "
"al nostre canal Matrix [.xfce](https://matrix.to/#/#xfce:matrix.org). El "
"canal té diversos usuaris actius. Es recomana consultar la documentació []"
"(https://docs.xfce.org/) sobre el vostre problema abans de fer la vostra "
"pregunta."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:18
msgid "Forums"
msgstr "Fòrum"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:20
msgid ""
"For users who prefer forums, the [Xfce Forum](https://forum.xfce.org/) is "
"the place to be. Active contributors will be able to help you, but please do "
"not use it for bug reports."
msgstr ""
"Per als usuaris que prefereixen els fòrums, el [Xfce Forum](https://"
"forum.xfce.org/) és el lloc per ser. Els col·laboradors actius us podran "
"ajudar, però no l'utilitzeu per als informes d'errors."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:22
msgid "Social Networks"
msgstr "Xarxes socials"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:24
msgid ""
"You can follow us on the official [Mastodon account](https://floss.social/"
"@xfce) or [Twitter account](https://twitter.com/xfceofficial)"
msgstr ""
"Pots seguir-nos al compte oficial [Mastodon](https://floss.social/@xfce) o "
"al compte de Twitter</a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/xfceofficial\" "
"class=\"external\">)"

#: content/download/_index.md:0
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Baixada"

#: content/download/_index.md:7
msgid ""
"Most distributions ship with Xfce in their own packaging format, but if you "
"want a newer version or you want to build Xfce from scratch, you can find "
"the packages below. [How to compile Xfce](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/"
"building)."
msgstr ""

#: content/download/_index.md:9
msgid "Stable release {{% version \"stable\" %}}"
msgstr "Versió estable {{% version \"stable\" %}}"

#: content/download/_index.md:11
msgid ""
"Xfce {{% version \"stable\" %}} is the most recent version of the Xfce "
"desktop environment. [Changes in this release](/download/changelogs/{{% "
"version \"stable\" %}})."
msgstr ""
"Xfce {{% version \"stable\" %}} és la versió més recent de l'entorn "
"d'escriptori Xfce. [Canvis en aquest llançament](/download/changelogs/{{% "
"version \"stable\" %}})."

#: content/download/_index.md:13
#, fuzzy
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/{{% version \"stable\" %}}/>"
msgstr "[Baixada](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.8pre3/)"

#: content/download/_index.md:15
msgid "Individual releases"
msgstr "Publicacions individuals"

#: content/download/_index.md:17
msgid ""
"Each package in Xfce can make individual stable or development releases, "
"including the core packages (as described in the [release model](https://"
"docs.xfce.org/contribute/dev/make-a-platform-"
"release#making_a_platform_release)). You can follow the announcements of the "
"releases on the [Xfce users mailing list](/community), watch the [release "
"feeds](https://archive.xfce.org/feeds/project/) or follow the Xfce [Mastodon]"
"(https://floss.social/@xfce) or [Twitter account](https://twitter.com/"
"xfceofficial)."
msgstr ""
"Cada paquet en Xfce pot fer llançaments individuals estables o de "
"desenvolupament, incloent els paquets centrals (com es descriu en el model "
"de llançament [](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/dev/make-a-platform-"
"release#making_a_platform_release)). Podeu seguir els anuncis dels "
"llançaments a la llista de correu [Xfce users](/community), veure els canals "
"de llançament [](https://archive.xfce.org/feeds/project/)o seguir el Xfce "
"[Mastodon](https://floss.social/@xfce)o el compte de Twitter [](https://"
"twitter.com/xfceofficial)."

#: content/download/_index.md:19
#, fuzzy
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/src/>"
msgstr "[Baixada](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.6.2/)"

#: content/download/_index.md:22
msgid "Preview release {{% version \"preview\" %}}"
msgstr "Vista prèvia de la versió {{% version \"preview\" %}}"

#: content/download/_index.md:24
msgid ""
"Xfce {{% version \"preview\" %}} is the latest development release of the "
"Xfce desktop environment. This release should not be used in a production "
"environments. If you are uncertain about downloading this release, you "
"should probably use the [stable release](#stable) above. [Changes in this "
"release](/download/changelogs/{{% version \"preview\" %}})."
msgstr ""
"Xfce {{% version \"preview\" %}} és l'última versió de desenvolupament de "
"l'entorn d'escriptori Xfce. Aquest llançament no s'ha d'utilitzar en entorns "
"de producció. Si no esteu segur de baixar aquesta versió, probablement "
"hauríeu d'utilitzar la versió estable [](#stable) anterior. [Canvis en "
"aquest llançament](/download/changelogs/{{% version \"preview\" %}})."

#: content/download/_index.md:26
#, fuzzy
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/{{% version \"preview\" %}}/>"
msgstr "[Baixada](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.8pre3/)"

#: content/download/_index.md:30
msgid "Distributions"
msgstr "Distribucions"

#: content/download/_index.md:32
msgid ""
"A lot of different distributions provide Xfce packages. Popular examples "
"built around Xfce are [Xubuntu](https://xubuntu.org/), the [Fedora Xfce Spin]"
"(https://fedoraproject.org/spins/xfce), [Manjaro](https://manjaro.org/"
"products/download/) or [Zenwalk](http://www.zenwalk.org/), but there is a "
"good chance your favorite distro provides packages as well."
msgstr ""
"Moltes distribucions diferents proporcionen paquets de l'Xfce. Els exemples "
"populars construïts al voltant de l'Xfce són [Xubuntu](https://"
"xubuntu.org/), [Fedora Xfce Spin](https://fedoraproject.org/spins/xfce), "
"[Manjaro](https://manjaro.org/products/download/) o [Zenwalk](http://"
"www.zenwalk.org/), però hi ha moltes possibilitats que la vostra distribució "
"preferida també en proporcioni paquets."

#: content/download/_index.md:34
msgid ""
"You can find a more complete list at [DistroWatch.com](https://"
"distrowatch.com/search.php?pkg=xfdesktop&pkgver={{% version \"stable\" %}})."
msgstr ""
"Podeu trobar una llista més completa a [DistroWatch.com](https://"
"distrowatch.com/search.php?pkg=xfdesktop&pkgver={{% version \"stable\" %}})."

#: content/download/_index.md:36
msgid "Artwork"
msgstr "Artwork"

#: content/download/_index.md:38
msgid ""
"[Download the Xfce artwork tarball](//cdn.xfce.org/downloads/"
"xfce_artwork.tar.bz2). It contains some high-quality logos and banners. "
"Copying of the Xfce logo is subject to the LGPL copyright license."
msgstr ""
"[Descarrega el tarball d'art de l'Xfce .](//cdn.xfce.org/downloads/"
"xfce_artwork.tar.bz2). Conté alguns logotips i pancartes d'alta qualitat. La "
"còpia del logotip de l'Xfce està subjecta a la llicència de drets d'autor "
"LGPL."

#: content/download/changelogs/_index.md:0
msgid "Changelogs"
msgstr ""

#: content/download/changelogs/_index.md:7
msgid ""
"Xfce release notes are specific to each version. Select your version from "
"the list below to see the changes in the release."
msgstr ""
"Les notes de llançament de l'Xfce són específiques per a cada versió. "
"Seleccioneu la vostra versió de la llista de sota per veure els canvis a la "
"versió."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:0
msgid "Get Involved"
msgstr "Participació"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:6
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Xfce community. By joining our team, you will be part of an "
"international effort by hundreds of people working to deliver a stunning "
"Free Software computing experience. You will meet new friends, learn new "
"skills and make a difference to millions of users while working with people "
"from all around the globe. There are many different ways you can become part "
"of this, just read on and pick an area which interests you or seems "
"challenging."
msgstr ""
"Benvingut a la comunitat Xfce. En unir-te al nostre equip, formaràs part "
"d'un esforç internacional de centenars de persones que treballen per oferir "
"una impressionant experiència de computació de Programari Lliure. Coneixeràs "
"nous amics, aprendràs noves habilitats i marcaràs una diferència per a "
"milions d'usuaris mentre treballes amb persones de tot el món. Hi ha moltes "
"maneres diferents que es pot convertir en part d'això, només llegir i triar "
"una àrea que li interessa o sembla desafiant."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:8
msgid ""
"Possible tasks include testing, bug reporting; writing code, developing "
"artwork, documentation or translations; or spreading the word and helping "
"out with promotion and marketing both on line and at tradeshows and "
"conferences."
msgstr ""
"Les tasques possibles inclouen proves, informes d'errors; escriure codi, "
"desenvolupar obres d'art, documentació o traduccions; o difondre la paraula "
"i ajudar amb la promoció i el màrqueting tant en línia com en fires i "
"conferències."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:10
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Documentació"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:12
msgid ""
"There's lots of people using and testing Xfce. By providing useful and up-to-"
"date documentation, you will make a big impact on helping people understand "
"how to make the most of the Xfce Desktop Environment. [Learn More →](https://"
"docs.xfce.org/contribute/documentation)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:14
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "Traducció"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:16
msgid ""
"Are you fluent in multiple languages? By contributing your translations of "
"text to the Xfce Desktop Environment, you will help Xfce be a better part of "
"the global market and more accessible to the millions of potential users out "
"there. [Learn More →](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/translate/start)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:18
msgid "Development"
msgstr "Desenvolupament"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:20
msgid ""
"By becoming a developer, you can make a big difference while enjoying a "
"challenging and fun experience. You'll learn to be a better coder, you will "
"get to implement new features and defeat daunting bugs, creating a stunning "
"product, all the while collaborating with people from all around the world. "
"You can start by browsing the [source code](https://gitlab.xfce.org)."
msgstr ""
"En convertir-se en un desenvolupador, vostè pot fer una gran diferència "
"mentre gaudeix d'una experiència desafiant i divertit. Aprendràs a ser un "
"millor codificador, aconseguiràs implementar noves característiques i "
"derrotar els errors descoratjadors, creant un producte impressionant, tot "
"col·laborant amb persones de tot el món. Podeu començar navegant pel codi "
"font [](https://gitlab.xfce.org)."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:22
msgid "Promotion"
msgstr "Promoció"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:24
msgid ""
"If you own a blog or website you can greatly help by spreading the word and "
"encouraging new users to give Xfce a try. If you have a Mastodon or Twitter "
"account you can also help by reposting any announcements we make to help us "
"reach a larger audience."
msgstr ""
"Si teniu un blog o un lloc web podeu ajudar-vos molt difonent la paraula i "
"animant els nous usuaris a donar-li a Xfce un intent. Si tens un compte de "
"Mastodon o Twitter també pots ajudar-te enviant qualsevol anunci que fem per "
"ajudar-nos a arribar a un públic més gran."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:26
msgid "Bug Reporting and testing"
msgstr "Reportant errades i provant-lo"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:28
msgid ""
"One of the most useful tasks that we rely on the community for is testing "
"and reporting of bugs. Since Xfce runs on various platform and in a lot of "
"different setups, testing all changes in every possible situation is an "
"impossible task. As such we kindly ask users to assist in testing, and "
"reporting all bugs they may find, using our [bug tracker](https://"
"gitlab.xfce.org)."
msgstr ""
"Una de les tasques més útils per a les quals confiem en la comunitat és "
"provar i informar d'errors. Atès que Xfce funciona en diverses plataformes i "
"en moltes configuracions diferents, provar tots els canvis en totes les "
"situacions possibles és una tasca impossible. Com a tal, demanem als usuaris "
"que ajudin en les proves i informin de tots els errors que puguin trobar, "
"utilitzant el nostre [bug tracker](https://gitlab.xfce.org)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:30
msgid ""
"Once a bug has been found, the cause of the bug needs to be tracked down, "
"and then (obviously) fixed. If you want to get involved in the actual "
"development process of Xfce a great way to start is by solving bugs and then "
"submitting a patch file."
msgstr ""
"Un cop s'ha trobat un error, cal fer un seguiment de la causa de l'error i "
"després (òbviament) corregir-lo. Si voleu involucrar-vos en el procés de "
"desenvolupament real de l'Xfce, una bona manera de començar és resolent "
"errors i després enviant un fitxer de pedaç."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:32
msgid "OpenCollective"
msgstr "OpenCollective"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:34
msgid ""
"If you want to fund the project, you can use OpenCollective. Xfce has "
"created two collectives, known as [Xfce ($)](https://opencollective.com/"
"xfce) and [Xfce-Eu (€)](https://opencollective.com/xfce-eu) respectively. "
"[Learn More →](https://mail.xfce.org/pipermail/xfce/2021-May/037348.html)"
msgstr ""

#: content/projects/_index.md:0
msgid "Projects"
msgstr ""

#: content/projects/_index.md:7
msgid ""
"The Xfce project contains several separated projects for each part of the "
"desktop. Some projects have their own project pages to provide additional "
"information."
msgstr ""
"El projecte Xfce conté diversos projectes separats per a cada part de "
"l'escriptori. Alguns projectes tenen les seves pròpies pàgines de projectes "
"per proporcionar informació addicional."
